[{"workOrderId":"wo_4410d879-7962-49a9-8de7-3a9540d8383d","status":"passed","summary":"在隔离 worktree 中对两处范围文件落盘实际修复（git diff --stat: 2 files changed, 143 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)），两文件 script setup 体经 node --check 语法通过（先红后绿：首次检查 OutlineEditor.vue 报 SyntaxError: Unexpected token '}'，定位到 hash_edit 遗留的闭合花括号并删除后复验 OK）。修复根因是前端大纲编辑只写 localStorage 不落库、而后端 generation_handler 在 outline_confirmed 时以存储版本节点覆盖请求体，导致本地新增/排序在生成与页面管理阶段被静默丢弃。运行时端到端行为未验证（node_modules 缺失、无 test script、未跑 Go/Python/浏览器）。","findings":[{"claim":"验证器「范围两文件在工作树中无内容改动」的指控在本轮已被推翻：两文件均有实际落盘改动","evidence":"git diff --stat 输出 2 files changed, 143 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)（OutlineEditor.vue +101、S3StudioPage.vue +45）；git status --porcelain 对该两文件均报 M 且带真实内容差异","confidence":"high","evidenceKind":"firsthand","evidenceRefs":["cmd: cd $(git rev-parse --show-toplevel) && git diff --stat","cmd: git status --porcelain --untracked-files=all","cmd: git diff -- frontend/teacher/src/pages/S3StudioPage.vue"]},{"claim":"「手动添加节点内容无法传递到内容生成/页面管理」与「排序拖不动」同源：前端大纲编辑只写 localStorage，后端在 outline_confirmed 时以存储版本节点覆盖请求体","evidence":"generation_handler.go L40 调 outlineService.GetConfirmed(ctx, req.OutlineID, req.OutlineVersion)，L49 执行 req.OutlineNodes = outline.Nodes；outline_service.go L629 GetConfirmed 从 store.GetVersion 读库；outlineStore.js 的 addNode/updateNode/moveNode/applyRevision 仅调 _persist()（localStorage）","confidence":"high","evidenceKind":"firsthand","evidenceRefs":["backend/internal/handler/generation_handler.go:40","backend/internal/handler/generation_handler.go:49","backend/internal/service/outline_service.go:629","frontend/teacher/src/stores/outlineStore.js"]},{"claim":"保存后状态分叉：后端 SaveOutlineVersion 把新版本置为 draft，而前端 saveVersion() 只更新 outline_version 不同步 status，导致前端误判仍已确认、随后生成被 GetConfirmed 以 409 拒绝","evidence":"outline_service.go 的 SaveOutlineVersion 构造 newVersion 时 Status: OutlineStatusDraft，并在 current.Status == confirmed 时走 SaveVersionSupersede；outlineStore.js saveVersion() 仅 this.outline_version = data.outline_version || this.outline_version + 1，未触碰 status","confidence":"high","evidenceKind":"firsthand","evidenceRefs":["backend/internal/service/outline_service.go","frontend/teacher/src/stores/outlineStore.js"]},{"claim":"本环境无法执行任何前端构建或单元测试：依赖未安装且无 test script","evidence":"cd frontend/teacher && ls node_modules 报 node_modules: MISSING；package.json scripts 仅 dev/build/preview/test:unit，无 test；vitest.config.js include 为 ['src/{utils,stores}/**/*.test.js']，不覆盖范围两文件","confidence":"high","evidenceKind":"firsthand","evidenceRefs":["cmd: cd frontend/teacher && ls node_modules -> node_modules: MISSING","frontend/teacher/package.json","frontend/teacher/vitest.config.js"]},{"claim":"本轮首次语法验证即失败（先红），修复后转绿，属真实红→绿而非事后检查","evidence":"首次 node --check 输出 src/components/teacher/OutlineEditor.vue -> SYNTAX FAIL，stderr 为 SyntaxError: Unexpected token '}'（临时文件第 90 行）；成因是 hash_edit 的 new_string 未覆盖原 L315 的闭合花括号；删除后复跑输出两文件均 SYNTAX OK、RESULT: PASS","confidence":"high","evidenceKind":"firsthand","evidenceRefs":["cmd: node --check (第1次) -> OutlineEditor.vue SYNTAX FAIL","cmd: node --check (第2次) -> 两文件 SYNTAX OK / RESULT: PASS"]},{"claim":"手写 unified diff 经 apply_patch 校验失败，故改用锚点编辑完成全部改动","evidence":"apply_patch(check_only=true) 返回「补丁应用失败：error: corrupt patch at line 57」，随后改用 hash_edit 与 edit_file 完成全部编辑并被工具确认为已应用","confidence":"high","evidenceKind":"firsthand","evidenceRefs":["cmd: apply_patch check_only=true -> corrupt patch at line 57","cmd: hash_edit L314-L315 -> 已应用"]}],"artifacts":[{"kind":"patch","title":"OutlineEditor.vue：建立「落库基线 + 未保存检测 + 保存即同步状态」","content":"新增 lastPersistedSignature/savingOutline、nodesSignature()、hasUnsavedEdit 计算属性、markPersisted()、syncStatusFromSave()、persistIfDirty()；在 autoRestore 之后建立基线；handleSave 改为同步 status 与基线；handleConfirm 改为先 persistIfDirty() 再 confirmOutline()；handleApplyRevision 改为 async 并在采纳后立即落库；handleGenerateOutline 成功后 markPersisted()；新增未落库提示条模板与 .unsaved-bar 样式；defineExpose({ persistIfDirty, hasUnsavedEdit }) 供父页面调用。"},{"kind":"patch","title":"S3StudioPage.vue：生成前与离开大纲阶段前强制落库","content":"OutlineEditor 加 ref=\"outlineEditorRef\"；新增 outlineEditorRef ref 与 ensureOutlinePersisted()（保存后若不再 confirmed 则自动重新确认，规避 GetConfirmed 409）；新增 watch(currentPhase) 在离开 outline 阶段（组件即将被 v-if 卸载、ref 失效）前落库；handleStartGeneration 前置 ensureOutlinePersisted() 并把 isConfirmed 校验移到落库之后。"},{"kind":"test_command","title":"语法验证命令（本环境实际可跑的唯一验证）","content":"cd frontend/teacher && python - <<'PY' 提取两 .vue 的 <script setup> 体写入临时 .mjs，再对每个文件执行 node --check；结果 OutlineEditor.vue -> SYNTAX OK、S3StudioPage.vue -> SYNTAX OK、RESULT: PASS（exit=0）。同一脚本还交叉检查模板中引用的 hasUnsavedEdit/savingOutline/handleSave/outlineEditorRef 是否在 script 中定义，无 MISSING DEFINITION。"},{"kind":"risk","title":"运行时行为零验证，修复效果仍属静态推断","content":"frontend/teacher/node_modules 缺失导致 vite build 与 vitest 均不可用；未跑 Go 编译、未跑 Python 引擎、未做浏览器三服务端到端复现。因此「手动添加节点能传递到内容生成与页面管理」「排序不再回弹」两条用户症状是否真正消除，本轮没有运行证据，只能标为 inferred。node --check 仅证明语法合法，不证明逻辑正确。"},{"kind":"risk","title":"范围两文件与 outlineStore.js 无任何测试覆盖，存在虚假绿灯风险","content":"vitest.config.js 的 include 为 ['src/{utils,stores}/**/*.test.js']，现有测试仅 authStore/generationStore/intentStore/versionStore 与 utils 下若干；components/pages 与 outlineStore 均无测试。本次改动触及的是组件交互与网络时序（save→confirm→generate 的顺序与状态同步），是最需要运行时断言的部分。"},{"kind":"question","title":"是否需要为该链路补最小测试骨架","content":"本次修复的核心逻辑（hasUnsavedEdit 变更检测、persistIfDirty 的版本提交、save 后 status 同步、离开阶段前落库）可被 extract 到纯函数或用 mock 掉 teacherV1Api 的 store 级测试覆盖。是否要搭最小 vitest 骨架（含 1 个 outlineStore 用例以进入 include 范围）由用户决定；不搭则此类修复未来仍只能靠人工实操验收。"},{"kind":"diff","title":"Patch: .rivet/backups/1789136850880/frontend/teacher/src/components/teacher/OutlineEditor.vue, .rivet/backups/1789136875091/frontend/teacher/src/components/teacher/OutlineEditor.vue, .rivet/backups/1789136887476/frontend/teacher/src/components/teacher/OutlineEditor.vue, .rivet/backups/1789136904268/frontend/teacher/src/components/teacher/OutlineEditor.vue, .rivet/backups/1789136912701/frontend/teacher/src/components/teacher/OutlineEditor.vue, .rivet/backups/1789136930097/frontend/teacher/src/components/teacher/OutlineEditor.vue, .rivet/backups/1789136953267/frontend/teacher/src/components/teacher/OutlineEditor.vue, .rivet/backups/1789137019152/frontend/teacher/src/pages/S3StudioPage.vue, .rivet/backups/1789137032599/frontend/teacher/src/pages/S3StudioPage.vue, .rivet/backups/1789137078157/frontend/teacher/src/pages/S3StudioPage.vue, .rivet/backups/1789137107206/frontend/teacher/src/pages/S3StudioPage.vue, .rivet/backups/1789137192663/frontend/teacher/src/components/teacher/OutlineEditor.vue, .rivet/knowledge/advisory-efficacy.jsonl, .vsw-owner.json, frontend/teacher/src/components/teacher/OutlineEditor.vue, frontend/teacher/src/pages/S3StudioPage.vue","content":"diff --git a/.rivet/backups/1789136850880/frontend/teacher/src/components/teacher/OutlineEditor.vue b/.rivet/backups/1789136850880/frontend/teacher/src/components/teacher/OutlineEditor.vue\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..d0f6f9d\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/.rivet/backups/1789136850880/frontend/teacher/src/components/teacher/OutlineEditor.vue\n@@ -0,0 +1,797 @@\n+<template>\n+  <div class=\"outline-editor\">\n+    <!-- 大纲头部信息 -->\n+    <div class=\"outline-header\">\n+      <div class=\"outline-meta\">\n+        <span class=\"outline-id\" v-if=\"outlineStore.outline_id\">\n+          大纲 ID：{{ outlineStore.outline_id }}\n+        </span>\n+        <span class=\"outline-version\" v-if=\"outlineStore.outline_version\">\n+          v{{ outlineStore.outline_version }}\n+        </span>\n+        <span class=\"outline-status\" :class=\"`status-${outlineStore.status}`\">\n+          {{ statusLabel }}\n+        </span>\n+        <span class=\"outline-duration\">\n+          ⏱ 总计 {{ outlineStore.totalDuration }} 分钟 · {{ outlineStore.nodeCount }} 个节点\n+        </span>\n+      </div>\n+      <div class=\"outline-actions\">\n+        <button\n+          v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-sm\"\n+          :disabled=\"outlineStore.reviseLoading\"\n+          @click=\"showReviseInput = true\"\n+          title=\"发送指令让 AI 修改大纲\"\n+        >\n+          {{ outlineStore.reviseLoading ? 'AI 修订中...' : '🤖 AI 修订' }}\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-sm\"\n+          :disabled=\"outlineStore.loading\"\n+          @click=\"handleSave\"\n+        >\n+          保存大纲\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          v-if=\"outlineStore.isConfirmed\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\"\n+          @click=\"$emit('confirm-complete')\"\n+        >\n+          进入内容生成 →\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          v-else-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit && outlineStore.nodeCount > 0\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\"\n+          :disabled=\"outlineStore.loading\"\n+          @click=\"handleConfirm\"\n+        >\n+          {{ outlineStore.loading ? '确认中...' : '确认大纲' }}\n+        </button>\n+      </div>\n+    </div>\n+\n+    <!-- 错误提示 -->\n+    <div v-if=\"outlineStore.error || outlineStore.confirmError\" class=\"error-bar\" role=\"alert\">\n+      {{ outlineStore.confirmError || outlineStore.error }}\n+    </div>\n+\n+    <!-- 节点编辑器 -->\n+    <div class=\"nodes-list\">\n+      <TransitionGroup name=\"node-list\">\n+        <div\n+          v-for=\"(node, idx) in outlineStore.nodes\"\n+          :key=\"node.node_id\"\n+          class=\"outline-node-card\"\n+          :class=\"`node-type-${node.node_type}`\"\n+        >\n+          <!-- 节点序号 & 移动按钮 -->\n+          <div class=\"node-drag-handle\">\n+            <span class=\"node-order\">{{ idx + 1 }}</span>\n+            <div class=\"node-move-btns\" v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\">\n+              <button\n+                class=\"move-btn\"\n+                :disabled=\"idx === 0\"\n+                @click=\"outlineStore.moveNode(node.node_id, 'up')\"\n+                title=\"上移\"\n+              >↑</button>\n+              <button\n+                class=\"move-btn\"\n+                :disabled=\"idx === outlineStore.nodes.length - 1\"\n+                @click=\"outlineStore.moveNode(node.node_id, 'down')\"\n+                title=\"下移\"\n+              >↓</button>\n+            </div>\n+          </div>\n+\n+          <!-- 节点内容 -->\n+          <div class=\"node-content\">\n+            <div class=\"node-top-row\">\n+              <!-- 节点类型选择 -->\n+              <select\n+                v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+                v-model=\"node.node_type\"\n+                class=\"node-type-select\"\n+                @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { node_type: node.node_type })\"\n+              >\n+                <option value=\"content\">📖 知识讲解</option>\n+                <option value=\"section\">📂 章节标题</option>\n+                <option value=\"quiz\">❓ 随堂测验</option>\n+                <option value=\"interactive\">🎮 互动环节</option>\n+                <option value=\"summary\">📋 总结回顾</option>\n+              </select>\n+              <span v-else class=\"node-type-badge\">{{ node.node_type }}</span>\n+\n+              <!-- 标题 -->\n+              <input\n+                v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+                v-model=\"node.title\"\n+                class=\"node-title-input\"\n+                placeholder=\"节点标题\"\n+                @input=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { title: node.title })\"\n+              />\n+              <div v-else class=\"node-title\">{{ node.title }}</div>\n+            </div>\n+\n+            <!-- 摘要 -->\n+            <textarea\n+              v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+              v-model=\"node.summary\"\n+              class=\"node-summary-input\"\n+              placeholder=\"节点摘要（简述本节点教学内容）\"\n+              rows=\"2\"\n+              @input=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { summary: node.summary })\"\n+            ></textarea>\n+            <p v-else class=\"node-summary\">{{ node.summary }}</p>\n+\n+            <!-- 核心知识点标签 -->\n+            <div class=\"node-key-points\">\n+              <span class=\"kp-label\">核心知识点：</span>\n+              <template v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\">\n+                <div class=\"kp-tags\">\n+                  <span\n+                    v-for=\"(kp, ki) in node.key_points\"\n+                    :key=\"ki\"\n+                    class=\"kp-tag\"\n+                  >\n+                    {{ kp }}\n+                    <button class=\"kp-remove\" @click=\"removeKeyPoint(node, ki)\">×</button>\n+                  </span>\n+                  <input\n+                    v-model=\"newKeyPoints[node.node_id]\"\n+                    class=\"kp-add-input\"\n+                    placeholder=\"+ 添加知识点\"\n+                    @keyup.enter=\"addKeyPoint(node)\"\n+                  />\n+                </div>\n+              </template>\n+              <template v-else>\n+                <span v-for=\"(kp, ki) in node.key_points\" :key=\"ki\" class=\"kp-tag-static\">\n+                  {{ kp }}\n+                </span>\n+              </template>\n+            </div>\n+\n+            <!-- 互动规划（仅 interactive / quiz 类型且有 plan 时显示）\n+                 注意：必须判 interactive_plan 非空——后端/LLM 产出的交互节点该字段常为 null，\n+                 直接访问 interactive_plan.x 会抛错并中断整个节点列表渲染。 -->\n+            <div\n+              v-if=\"(node.node_type === 'interactive' || node.node_type === 'quiz') && node.interactive_plan && outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+              class=\"node-interactive-plan\"\n+            >\n+              <details>\n+                <summary class=\"plan-toggle\">🎯 互动规划</summary>\n+                <div class=\"plan-fields\">\n+                  <label>\n+                    时长（分钟）\n+                    <input\n+                      type=\"number\"\n+                      v-model.number=\"node.interactive_plan.duration_minutes\"\n+                      min=\"1\"\n+                      max=\"60\"\n+                      @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { interactive_plan: { ...node.interactive_plan } })\"\n+                    />\n+                  </label>\n+                  <label>\n+                    题目数量\n+                    <input\n+                      type=\"number\"\n+                      v-model.number=\"node.interactive_plan.question_count\"\n+                      min=\"1\"\n+                      max=\"20\"\n+                      @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { interactive_plan: { ...node.interactive_plan } })\"\n+                    />\n+                  </label>\n+                  <label>\n+                    自动判分\n+                    <input\n+                      type=\"checkbox\"\n+                      v-model=\"node.interactive_plan.auto_grading\"\n+                      @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { interactive_plan: { ...node.interactive_plan } })\"\n+                    />\n+                  </label>\n+                  <label>\n+                    产出方式\n+                    <select v-model=\"node.interactive_plan.delivery\">\n+                      <option value=\"html5_link\">HTML5 链接</option>\n+                      <option value=\"ppt_native\">PPT 内嵌</option>\n+                      <option value=\"standalone_html\">独立 HTML</option>\n+                    </select>\n+                  </label>\n+                </div>\n+              </details>\n+            </div>\n+\n+            <!-- 时长 -->\n+            <div class=\"node-footer\">\n+              <label class=\"duration-label\">\n+                时长\n+                <input\n+                  type=\"number\"\n+                  v-model.number=\"node.estimated_duration_minutes\"\n+                  min=\"1\"\n+                  max=\"180\"\n+                  :disabled=\"!outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+                  class=\"duration-input\"\n+                  @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { estimated_duration_minutes: node.estimated_duration_minutes })\"\n+                />\n+                分钟\n+              </label>\n+\n+              <!-- 删除按钮 -->\n+              <button\n+                v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+                class=\"node-delete-btn\"\n+                @click=\"handleDeleteNode(node.node_id)\"\n+                title=\"删除节点\"\n+              >🗑</button>\n+            </div>\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+      </TransitionGroup>\n+\n+      <!-- 添加节点按钮 -->\n+      <div v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\" class=\"add-node-row\">\n+        <button class=\"btn btn-outline add-node-btn\" @click=\"handleAddNode\">\n+          ＋ 添加节点\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          v-if=\"outlineStore.nodes.length === 0\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-primary\"\n+          @click=\"handleGenerateOutline\"\n+          :disabled=\"outlineStore.loading\"\n+        >\n+          {{ outlineStore.loading ? 'AI 生成中...' : '🤖 AI 生成大纲' }}\n+        </button>\n+      </div>\n+    </div>\n+\n+    <!-- AI 修订对话框 -->\n+    <OutlineRevisionDialog\n+      :visible=\"showReviseDialog\"\n+      :loading=\"revisingDialogLoading\"\n+      :change-summary=\"outlineStore.changeSummary\"\n+      :pending-nodes=\"outlineStore.pendingRevision?.nodes || []\"\n+      @apply=\"handleApplyRevision\"\n+      @cancel=\"handleCancelRevision\"\n+    />\n+\n+    <!-- AI 修订输入弹窗 -->\n+    <div v-if=\"showReviseDialog\" class=\"dialog-overlay\" style=\"display:none\"><!-- 利用 OutlineRevisionDialog --></div>\n+\n+    <!-- 修订指令输入（集成在 OutlineRevisionDialog 之前） -->\n+    <div v-if=\"showReviseInput\" class=\"revise-input-bar\">\n+      <input\n+        v-model=\"reviseMessage\"\n+        class=\"revise-text-input\"\n+        placeholder=\"例如：增加一个生活案例，把课堂练习放到快速排序之后\"\n+        @keyup.enter=\"handleSendRevise\"\n+        autofocus\n+      />\n+      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" @click=\"handleSendRevise\" :disabled=\"!reviseMessage.trim()\">\n+        发送修订\n+      </button>\n+      <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" @click=\"showReviseInput = false\">取消</button>\n+    </div>\n+  </div>\n+</template>\n+\n+<script setup>\n+import { ref, computed, watch } from 'vue'\n+import { useOutlineStore } from '../../stores/outlineStore'\n+import OutlineRevisionDialog from './OutlineRevisionDialog.vue'\n+\n+const props = defineProps({\n+  /** 所属 session_id（从 S1 透传） */\n+  sessionId: { type: String, default: '' },\n+  /** 所属 intent_id（从 S1 透传） */\n+  intentId: { type: String, default: '' },\n+  /** 教学意图摘要（用于创建大纲） */\n+  intentSummary: { type: Object, default: null },\n+  /** 是否自动尝试从 localStorage 恢复大纲 */\n+  autoRestore: { type: Boolean, default: true }\n+})\n+\n+const emit = defineEmits(['confirm-complete', 'outline-created', 'error'])\n+\n+const outlineStore = useOutlineStore()\n+\n+const showReviseDialog = ref(false)\n+const showReviseInput = ref(false)\n+const reviseMessage = ref('')\n+const revisingDialogLoading = ref(false) // 对话框内 AI 正在生成修订\n+const newKeyPoints = ref({}) // { [node_id]: input value }\n+\n+const statusLabel = computed(() => ({\n+  draft: '草稿',\n+  confirming: '确认中',\n+  confirmed: '已确认',\n+  superseded: '已替代'\n+}[outlineStore.status] || outlineStore.status))\n+\n+// 自动恢复\n+if (props.autoRestore) {\n+  outlineStore.restore()\n+}\n+\n+// 若无大纲且有 intent，自动创建\n+watch(\n+  () => [outlineStore.outline_id, outlineStore.nodes.length],\n+  ([oid, nc]) => {\n+    if (!oid && nc === 0 && props.intentSummary) {\n+      handleGenerateOutline()\n+    }\n+  },\n+  { immediate: true }\n+)\n+\n+async function handleGenerateOutline() {\n+  if (!props.sessionId) {\n+    emit('error', '缺少 session_id，请先完成 S1 意图理解')\n+    return\n+  }\n+  try {\n+    // 尝试从 localStorage 读取证据包\n+    let evidence = null\n+    try {\n+      const raw = window.localStorage.getItem('fuww_s2_evidence_packet')\n+      if (raw) evidence = JSON.parse(raw)\n+    } catch {}\n+    // 尝试从 localStorage 读取 markdown 内容\n+    let markdown = ''\n+    try {\n+      const m = window.localStorage.getItem('fuww_s2_markdown')\n+      if (m) markdown = m\n+    } catch {}\n+\n+    await outlineStore.createOutline({\n+      session_id: props.sessionId,\n+      intent_id: props.intentId,\n+      intent: props.intentSummary || {},\n+      evidence_packet: evidence,\n+      markdown\n+    })\n+    emit('outline-created', {\n+      outline_id: outlineStore.outline_id,\n+      outline_version: outlineStore.outline_version\n+    })\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    emit('error', err?.message || '创建大纲失败')\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+function handleAddNode() {\n+  const lastNodeId = outlineStore.nodes.at(-1)?.node_id || null\n+  outlineStore.addNode(lastNodeId)\n+}\n+\n+function handleDeleteNode(nodeId) {\n+  if (outlineStore.nodes.length <= 1) {\n+    emit('error', '大纲至少需要一个节点')\n+    return\n+  }\n+  outlineStore.removeNode(nodeId)\n+}\n+\n+function addKeyPoint(node) {\n+  const val = (newKeyPoints.value[node.node_id] || '').trim()\n+  if (!val) return\n+  const kps = [...(node.key_points || []), val]\n+  outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { key_points: kps })\n+  newKeyPoints.value[node.node_id] = ''\n+}\n+\n+function removeKeyPoint(node, index) {\n+  const kps = [...(node.key_points || [])]\n+  kps.splice(index, 1)\n+  outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { key_points: kps })\n+}\n+\n+async function handleSave() {\n+  try {\n+    await outlineStore.saveVersion()\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    emit('error', err?.message || '保存大纲失败')\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+async function handleConfirm() {\n+  try {\n+    await outlineStore.confirmOutline()\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    emit('error', err?.message || '确认大纲失败')\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+async function handleSendRevise() {\n+  const msg = reviseMessage.value.trim()\n+  if (!msg) return\n+  showReviseInput.value = false\n+  showReviseDialog.value = true\n+  revisingDialogLoading.value = true\n+  try {\n+    await outlineStore.reviseOutline(msg)\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    emit('error', err?.message || 'AI 修订失败')\n+    showReviseDialog.value = false\n+  } finally {\n+    revisingDialogLoading.value = false\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+function handleApplyRevision() {\n+  outlineStore.applyRevision()\n+  showReviseDialog.value = false\n+  reviseMessage.value = ''\n+}\n+\n+function handleCancelRevision() {\n+  outlineStore.discardRevision()\n+  showReviseDialog.value = false\n+  reviseMessage.value = ''\n+}\n+</script>\n+\n+<style scoped>\n+.outline-editor {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 12px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 头部 */\n+.outline-header {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  padding: 12px 16px;\n+  background: #f8fbf9;\n+  border: 1px solid #e2ece6;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+}\n+.outline-meta {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 12px;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #607a71;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+.outline-status {\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+  padding: 2px 8px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+.status-draft { background: #f0f5f2; color: #2f605a; }\n+.status-confirming { background: #fff8e6; color: #7c4a15; }\n+.status-confirmed { background: #d1fae5; color: #065f46; }\n+.status-superseded { background: #f3f4f6; color: #6b7280; }\n+.outline-actions {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+\n+/* 错误条 */\n+.error-bar {\n+  padding: 10px 14px;\n+  background: #fef2f2;\n+  border: 1px solid #fecaca;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  color: #dc2626;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 节点列表 */\n+.nodes-list {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+}\n+\n+.outline-node-card {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 12px;\n+  padding: 14px 16px;\n+  background: #fff;\n+  border: 1.5px solid #e2ece6;\n+  border-radius: 14px;\n+  transition: border-color 0.15s;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card:hover {\n+  border-color: #5ca68f;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card.node-type-section {\n+  border-left: 4px solid #2f605a;\n+  background: #f8fbf9;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card.node-type-quiz {\n+  border-left: 4px solid #7c3aed;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card.node-type-interactive {\n+  border-left: 4px solid #ea580c;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card.node-type-summary {\n+  border-left: 4px solid #ca8a04;\n+}\n+\n+/* 序号 */\n+.node-drag-handle {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 4px;\n+  min-width: 28px;\n+}\n+.node-order {\n+  font-size: 16px;\n+  font-weight: 700;\n+  color: #5ca68f;\n+  line-height: 1;\n+}\n+.node-move-btns {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 2px;\n+}\n+.move-btn {\n+  background: none;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 4px;\n+  font-size: 10px;\n+  color: #5ca68f;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  padding: 1px 4px;\n+  line-height: 1;\n+}\n+.move-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.35; cursor: not-allowed; }\n+\n+/* 节点内容 */\n+.node-content {\n+  flex: 1;\n+  min-width: 0;\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+.node-top-row {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+.node-type-select {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 6px;\n+  padding: 3px 6px;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  background: #f0f5f2;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+}\n+.node-type-badge {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  background: #e2ece6;\n+  color: #5ca68f;\n+  padding: 2px 8px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+.node-title-input {\n+  flex: 1;\n+  font-size: 14px;\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+  border: none;\n+  border-bottom: 1.5px solid #c6ded6;\n+  padding: 2px 4px;\n+  outline: none;\n+  color: #1e293b;\n+  background: transparent;\n+  min-width: 0;\n+}\n+.node-title-input:focus { border-bottom-color: #5ca68f; }\n+.node-title { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #1e293b; }\n+.node-summary-input {\n+  width: 100%;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #475569;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  padding: 6px 8px;\n+  resize: vertical;\n+  outline: none;\n+  font-family: inherit;\n+  box-sizing: border-box;\n+  background: #fafcfa;\n+}\n+.node-summary-input:focus { border-color: #5ca68f; }\n+.node-summary { font-size: 12px; color: #475569; margin: 0; line-height: 1.5; }\n+\n+/* 知识点 */\n+.node-key-points {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: flex-start;\n+  gap: 6px;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+.kp-label { font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; white-space: nowrap; line-height: 22px; }\n+.kp-tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; align-items: center; }\n+.kp-tag {\n+  display: inline-flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 4px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  background: #e8f5f0;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  padding: 2px 8px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+.kp-remove {\n+  background: none;\n+  border: none;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  padding: 0;\n+  line-height: 1;\n+  opacity: 0.6;\n+}\n+.kp-remove:hover { opacity: 1; }\n+.kp-add-input {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  border: none;\n+  background: transparent;\n+  outline: none;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  width: 100px;\n+  padding: 2px 4px;\n+}\n+.kp-tag-static {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  background: #e8f5f0;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  padding: 2px 8px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 互动规划 */\n+.node-interactive-plan {\n+  border-top: 1px dashed #c6ded6;\n+  padding-top: 8px;\n+}\n+.plan-toggle {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #5ca68f;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  user-select: none;\n+  list-style: none;\n+}\n+.plan-toggle::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }\n+.plan-fields {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  margin-top: 8px;\n+}\n+.plan-fields label {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 4px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  color: #64748b;\n+}\n+.plan-fields input[type=\"number\"] {\n+  width: 54px;\n+  padding: 2px 5px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 5px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  outline: none;\n+}\n+.plan-fields select {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 5px;\n+  padding: 2px 4px;\n+  outline: none;\n+}\n+.plan-fields input[type=\"checkbox\"] { width: 14px; height: 14px; }\n+\n+/* 底部：时长 & 删除 */\n+.node-footer {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+.duration-label {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 5px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  color: #64748b;\n+}\n+.duration-input {\n+  width: 48px;\n+  padding: 2px 6px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 5px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  text-align: center;\n+  outline: none;\n+}\n+.duration-input:disabled { background: #f8fbf9; }\n+.node-delete-btn {\n+  background: none;\n+  border: none;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  font-size: 14px;\n+  opacity: 0.4;\n+  transition: opacity 0.15s;\n+}\n+.node-delete-btn:hover { opacity: 1; }\n+\n+/* 添加节点 */\n+.add-node-row {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  justify-content: center;\n+  padding: 10px 0;\n+}\n+.add-node-btn {\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+}\n+.btn {\n+  padding: 6px 14px;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  font-weight: 500;\n+  transition: all 0.15s;\n+  border: 1px solid transparent;\n+}\n+.btn-sm { padding: 5px 12px; font-size: 12px; }\n+.btn-outline {\n+  background: #fff;\n+  border-color: #c6ded6;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.btn-outline:hover { background: #f0f5f2; }\n+.btn-primary {\n+  background: #2f605a;\n+  color: #fff;\n+  border-color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.btn-primary:hover:not(:disabled) { background: #1e4a44; }\n+.btn-primary:disabled { opacity: 0.5; cursor: not-allowed; }\n+.btn:disabled { opacity: 0.5; cursor: not-allowed; }\n+\n+/* 修订输入条 */\n+.revise-input-bar {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  padding: 10px 14px;\n+  background: #f0f5f2;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 10px;\n+}\n+.revise-text-input {\n+  flex: 1;\n+  padding: 6px 10px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  outline: none;\n+}\n+.revise-text-input:focus { border-color: #5ca68f; }\n+\n+/* 过渡动画 */\n+.node-list-enter-active,\n+.node-list-leave-active { transition: all 0.25s ease; }\n+.node-list-enter-from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-8px); }\n+.node-list-leave-to { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-8px); }\n+</style>\ndiff --git a/.rivet/backups/1789136875091/frontend/teacher/src/components/teacher/OutlineEditor.vue b/.rivet/backups/1789136875091/frontend/teacher/src/components/teacher/OutlineEditor.vue\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..f698bb5\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/.rivet/backups/1789136875091/frontend/teacher/src/components/teacher/OutlineEditor.vue\n@@ -0,0 +1,850 @@\n+<template>\n+  <div class=\"outline-editor\">\n+    <!-- 大纲头部信息 -->\n+    <div class=\"outline-header\">\n+      <div class=\"outline-meta\">\n+        <span class=\"outline-id\" v-if=\"outlineStore.outline_id\">\n+          大纲 ID：{{ outlineStore.outline_id }}\n+        </span>\n+        <span class=\"outline-version\" v-if=\"outlineStore.outline_version\">\n+          v{{ outlineStore.outline_version }}\n+        </span>\n+        <span class=\"outline-status\" :class=\"`status-${outlineStore.status}`\">\n+          {{ statusLabel }}\n+        </span>\n+        <span class=\"outline-duration\">\n+          ⏱ 总计 {{ outlineStore.totalDuration }} 分钟 · {{ outlineStore.nodeCount }} 个节点\n+        </span>\n+      </div>\n+      <div class=\"outline-actions\">\n+        <button\n+          v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-sm\"\n+          :disabled=\"outlineStore.reviseLoading\"\n+          @click=\"showReviseInput = true\"\n+          title=\"发送指令让 AI 修改大纲\"\n+        >\n+          {{ outlineStore.reviseLoading ? 'AI 修订中...' : '🤖 AI 修订' }}\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-sm\"\n+          :disabled=\"outlineStore.loading\"\n+          @click=\"handleSave\"\n+        >\n+          保存大纲\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          v-if=\"outlineStore.isConfirmed\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\"\n+          @click=\"$emit('confirm-complete')\"\n+        >\n+          进入内容生成 →\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          v-else-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit && outlineStore.nodeCount > 0\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\"\n+          :disabled=\"outlineStore.loading\"\n+          @click=\"handleConfirm\"\n+        >\n+          {{ outlineStore.loading ? '确认中...' : '确认大纲' }}\n+        </button>\n+      </div>\n+    </div>\n+\n+    <!-- 错误提示 -->\n+    <div v-if=\"outlineStore.error || outlineStore.confirmError\" class=\"error-bar\" role=\"alert\">\n+      {{ outlineStore.confirmError || outlineStore.error }}\n+    </div>\n+\n+    <!-- 节点编辑器 -->\n+    <div class=\"nodes-list\">\n+      <TransitionGroup name=\"node-list\">\n+        <div\n+          v-for=\"(node, idx) in outlineStore.nodes\"\n+          :key=\"node.node_id\"\n+          class=\"outline-node-card\"\n+          :class=\"`node-type-${node.node_type}`\"\n+        >\n+          <!-- 节点序号 & 移动按钮 -->\n+          <div class=\"node-drag-handle\">\n+            <span class=\"node-order\">{{ idx + 1 }}</span>\n+            <div class=\"node-move-btns\" v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\">\n+              <button\n+                class=\"move-btn\"\n+                :disabled=\"idx === 0\"\n+                @click=\"outlineStore.moveNode(node.node_id, 'up')\"\n+                title=\"上移\"\n+              >↑</button>\n+              <button\n+                class=\"move-btn\"\n+                :disabled=\"idx === outlineStore.nodes.length - 1\"\n+                @click=\"outlineStore.moveNode(node.node_id, 'down')\"\n+                title=\"下移\"\n+              >↓</button>\n+            </div>\n+          </div>\n+\n+          <!-- 节点内容 -->\n+          <div class=\"node-content\">\n+            <div class=\"node-top-row\">\n+              <!-- 节点类型选择 -->\n+              <select\n+                v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+                v-model=\"node.node_type\"\n+                class=\"node-type-select\"\n+                @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { node_type: node.node_type })\"\n+              >\n+                <option value=\"content\">📖 知识讲解</option>\n+                <option value=\"section\">📂 章节标题</option>\n+                <option value=\"quiz\">❓ 随堂测验</option>\n+                <option value=\"interactive\">🎮 互动环节</option>\n+                <option value=\"summary\">📋 总结回顾</option>\n+              </select>\n+              <span v-else class=\"node-type-badge\">{{ node.node_type }}</span>\n+\n+              <!-- 标题 -->\n+              <input\n+                v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+                v-model=\"node.title\"\n+                class=\"node-title-input\"\n+                placeholder=\"节点标题\"\n+                @input=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { title: node.title })\"\n+              />\n+              <div v-else class=\"node-title\">{{ node.title }}</div>\n+            </div>\n+\n+            <!-- 摘要 -->\n+            <textarea\n+              v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+              v-model=\"node.summary\"\n+              class=\"node-summary-input\"\n+              placeholder=\"节点摘要（简述本节点教学内容）\"\n+              rows=\"2\"\n+              @input=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { summary: node.summary })\"\n+            ></textarea>\n+            <p v-else class=\"node-summary\">{{ node.summary }}</p>\n+\n+            <!-- 核心知识点标签 -->\n+            <div class=\"node-key-points\">\n+              <span class=\"kp-label\">核心知识点：</span>\n+              <template v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\">\n+                <div class=\"kp-tags\">\n+                  <span\n+                    v-for=\"(kp, ki) in node.key_points\"\n+                    :key=\"ki\"\n+                    class=\"kp-tag\"\n+                  >\n+                    {{ kp }}\n+                    <button class=\"kp-remove\" @click=\"removeKeyPoint(node, ki)\">×</button>\n+                  </span>\n+                  <input\n+                    v-model=\"newKeyPoints[node.node_id]\"\n+                    class=\"kp-add-input\"\n+                    placeholder=\"+ 添加知识点\"\n+                    @keyup.enter=\"addKeyPoint(node)\"\n+                  />\n+                </div>\n+              </template>\n+              <template v-else>\n+                <span v-for=\"(kp, ki) in node.key_points\" :key=\"ki\" class=\"kp-tag-static\">\n+                  {{ kp }}\n+                </span>\n+              </template>\n+            </div>\n+\n+            <!-- 互动规划（仅 interactive / quiz 类型且有 plan 时显示）\n+                 注意：必须判 interactive_plan 非空——后端/LLM 产出的交互节点该字段常为 null，\n+                 直接访问 interactive_plan.x 会抛错并中断整个节点列表渲染。 -->\n+            <div\n+              v-if=\"(node.node_type === 'interactive' || node.node_type === 'quiz') && node.interactive_plan && outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+              class=\"node-interactive-plan\"\n+            >\n+              <details>\n+                <summary class=\"plan-toggle\">🎯 互动规划</summary>\n+                <div class=\"plan-fields\">\n+                  <label>\n+                    时长（分钟）\n+                    <input\n+                      type=\"number\"\n+                      v-model.number=\"node.interactive_plan.duration_minutes\"\n+                      min=\"1\"\n+                      max=\"60\"\n+                      @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { interactive_plan: { ...node.interactive_plan } })\"\n+                    />\n+                  </label>\n+                  <label>\n+                    题目数量\n+                    <input\n+                      type=\"number\"\n+                      v-model.number=\"node.interactive_plan.question_count\"\n+                      min=\"1\"\n+                      max=\"20\"\n+                      @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { interactive_plan: { ...node.interactive_plan } })\"\n+                    />\n+                  </label>\n+                  <label>\n+                    自动判分\n+                    <input\n+                      type=\"checkbox\"\n+                      v-model=\"node.interactive_plan.auto_grading\"\n+                      @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { interactive_plan: { ...node.interactive_plan } })\"\n+                    />\n+                  </label>\n+                  <label>\n+                    产出方式\n+                    <select v-model=\"node.interactive_plan.delivery\">\n+                      <option value=\"html5_link\">HTML5 链接</option>\n+                      <option value=\"ppt_native\">PPT 内嵌</option>\n+                      <option value=\"standalone_html\">独立 HTML</option>\n+                    </select>\n+                  </label>\n+                </div>\n+              </details>\n+            </div>\n+\n+            <!-- 时长 -->\n+            <div class=\"node-footer\">\n+              <label class=\"duration-label\">\n+                时长\n+                <input\n+                  type=\"number\"\n+                  v-model.number=\"node.estimated_duration_minutes\"\n+                  min=\"1\"\n+                  max=\"180\"\n+                  :disabled=\"!outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+                  class=\"duration-input\"\n+                  @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { estimated_duration_minutes: node.estimated_duration_minutes })\"\n+                />\n+                分钟\n+              </label>\n+\n+              <!-- 删除按钮 -->\n+              <button\n+                v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+                class=\"node-delete-btn\"\n+                @click=\"handleDeleteNode(node.node_id)\"\n+                title=\"删除节点\"\n+              >🗑</button>\n+            </div>\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+      </TransitionGroup>\n+\n+      <!-- 添加节点按钮 -->\n+      <div v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\" class=\"add-node-row\">\n+        <button class=\"btn btn-outline add-node-btn\" @click=\"handleAddNode\">\n+          ＋ 添加节点\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          v-if=\"outlineStore.nodes.length === 0\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-primary\"\n+          @click=\"handleGenerateOutline\"\n+          :disabled=\"outlineStore.loading\"\n+        >\n+          {{ outlineStore.loading ? 'AI 生成中...' : '🤖 AI 生成大纲' }}\n+        </button>\n+      </div>\n+    </div>\n+\n+    <!-- AI 修订对话框 -->\n+    <OutlineRevisionDialog\n+      :visible=\"showReviseDialog\"\n+      :loading=\"revisingDialogLoading\"\n+      :change-summary=\"outlineStore.changeSummary\"\n+      :pending-nodes=\"outlineStore.pendingRevision?.nodes || []\"\n+      @apply=\"handleApplyRevision\"\n+      @cancel=\"handleCancelRevision\"\n+    />\n+\n+    <!-- AI 修订输入弹窗 -->\n+    <div v-if=\"showReviseDialog\" class=\"dialog-overlay\" style=\"display:none\"><!-- 利用 OutlineRevisionDialog --></div>\n+\n+    <!-- 修订指令输入（集成在 OutlineRevisionDialog 之前） -->\n+    <div v-if=\"showReviseInput\" class=\"revise-input-bar\">\n+      <input\n+        v-model=\"reviseMessage\"\n+        class=\"revise-text-input\"\n+        placeholder=\"例如：增加一个生活案例，把课堂练习放到快速排序之后\"\n+        @keyup.enter=\"handleSendRevise\"\n+        autofocus\n+      />\n+      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" @click=\"handleSendRevise\" :disabled=\"!reviseMessage.trim()\">\n+        发送修订\n+      </button>\n+      <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" @click=\"showReviseInput = false\">取消</button>\n+    </div>\n+  </div>\n+</template>\n+\n+<script setup>\n+import { ref, computed, watch } from 'vue'\n+import { useOutlineStore } from '../../stores/outlineStore'\n+import OutlineRevisionDialog from './OutlineRevisionDialog.vue'\n+\n+const props = defineProps({\n+  /** 所属 session_id（从 S1 透传） */\n+  sessionId: { type: String, default: '' },\n+  /** 所属 intent_id（从 S1 透传） */\n+  intentId: { type: String, default: '' },\n+  /** 教学意图摘要（用于创建大纲） */\n+  intentSummary: { type: Object, default: null },\n+  /** 是否自动尝试从 localStorage 恢复大纲 */\n+  autoRestore: { type: Boolean, default: true }\n+})\n+\n+const emit = defineEmits(['confirm-complete', 'outline-created', 'error'])\n+\n+const outlineStore = useOutlineStore()\n+\n+const showReviseDialog = ref(false)\n+const showReviseInput = ref(false)\n+const reviseMessage = ref('')\n+const revisingDialogLoading = ref(false) // 对话框内 AI 正在生成修订\n+const newKeyPoints = ref({}) // { [node_id]: input value }\n+\n+const statusLabel = computed(() => ({\n+  draft: '草稿',\n+  confirming: '确认中',\n+  confirmed: '已确认',\n+  superseded: '已替代'\n+}[outlineStore.status] || outlineStore.status))\n+\n+// 自动恢复\n+// 最近一次与后端对齐（创建 / 保存 / 确认）时的节点快照签名\n+const lastPersistedSignature = ref('')\n+const savingOutline = ref(false)\n+\n+/** 节点快照签名——用于判断是否存在未落库的本地编辑 */\n+function nodesSignature() {\n+  return JSON.stringify(outlineStore.nodes || [])\n+}\n+\n+/**\n+ * 是否存在未落库的本地编辑（排序 / 增删 / 改字段 / 采纳 AI 修订）。\n+ * 根因：后端生成链路以「存储版本」的节点为准——\n+ * generation_handler.go:40 GetConfirmed 取库中版本，:49 直接以其 Nodes 覆盖 req.OutlineNodes。\n+ * 前端只写 localStorage 不落库时，本地编辑在内容生成与页面管理阶段被静默丢弃\n+ * （表现为：手动添加的节点传不过去、排序在生成后回弹）。\n+ */\n+const hasUnsavedEdit = computed(() => {\n+  if (!outlineStore.outline_id) return false\n+  return nodesSignature() !== lastPersistedSignature.value\n+})\n+\n+/** 标记当前节点已与后端对齐 */\n+function markPersisted() {\n+  lastPersistedSignature.value = nodesSignature()\n+}\n+\n+/**\n+ * 保存会产出新版本，且后端 SaveOutlineVersion 把新版本状态置为 draft\n+ * （修改已确认大纲时旧版转 superseded，新版需重新确认）。\n+ * 前端不同步 status 会误判「仍已确认」，随后生成请求被 GetConfirmed 以 409 拒绝。\n+ */\n+function syncStatusFromSave(data) {\n+  if (data && data.status) outlineStore.status = data.status\n+}\n+\n+/** 落库保障：把本地编辑提交为后端新版本；无改动则跳过（避免无谓的版本链膨胀） */\n+async function persistIfDirty() {\n+  if (!outlineStore.outline_id || !hasUnsavedEdit.value) return false\n+  savingOutline.value = true\n+  try {\n+    const data = await outlineStore.saveVersion()\n+    syncStatusFromSave(data)\n+    markPersisted()\n+    return true\n+  } finally {\n+    savingOutline.value = false\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+// 自动恢复\n+if (props.autoRestore) {\n+  outlineStore.restore()\n+}\n+// 恢复的节点来自本地缓存，作为对齐基线；否则刚进页面就会误报「有未保存的修改」\n+markPersisted()\n+}\n+\n+// 若无大纲且有 intent，自动创建\n+watch(\n+  () => [outlineStore.outline_id, outlineStore.nodes.length],\n+  ([oid, nc]) => {\n+    if (!oid && nc === 0 && props.intentSummary) {\n+      handleGenerateOutline()\n+    }\n+  },\n+  { immediate: true }\n+)\n+\n+async function handleGenerateOutline() {\n+  if (!props.sessionId) {\n+    emit('error', '缺少 session_id，请先完成 S1 意图理解')\n+    return\n+  }\n+  try {\n+    // 尝试从 localStorage 读取证据包\n+    let evidence = null\n+    try {\n+      const raw = window.localStorage.getItem('fuww_s2_evidence_packet')\n+      if (raw) evidence = JSON.parse(raw)\n+    } catch {}\n+    // 尝试从 localStorage 读取 markdown 内容\n+    let markdown = ''\n+    try {\n+      const m = window.localStorage.getItem('fuww_s2_markdown')\n+      if (m) markdown = m\n+    } catch {}\n+\n+    await outlineStore.createOutline({\n+      session_id: props.sessionId,\n+      intent_id: props.intentId,\n+      intent: props.intentSummary || {},\n+      evidence_packet: evidence,\n+      markdown\n+    })\n+    emit('outline-created', {\n+      outline_id: outlineStore.outline_id,\n+      outline_version: outlineStore.outline_version\n+    })\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    emit('error', err?.message || '创建大纲失败')\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+function handleAddNode() {\n+  const lastNodeId = outlineStore.nodes.at(-1)?.node_id || null\n+  outlineStore.addNode(lastNodeId)\n+}\n+\n+function handleDeleteNode(nodeId) {\n+  if (outlineStore.nodes.length <= 1) {\n+    emit('error', '大纲至少需要一个节点')\n+    return\n+  }\n+  outlineStore.removeNode(nodeId)\n+}\n+\n+function addKeyPoint(node) {\n+  const val = (newKeyPoints.value[node.node_id] || '').trim()\n+  if (!val) return\n+  const kps = [...(node.key_points || []), val]\n+  outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { key_points: kps })\n+  newKeyPoints.value[node.node_id] = ''\n+}\n+\n+function removeKeyPoint(node, index) {\n+  const kps = [...(node.key_points || [])]\n+  kps.splice(index, 1)\n+  outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { key_points: kps })\n+}\n+\n+async function handleSave() {\n+  try {\n+    await outlineStore.saveVersion()\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    emit('error', err?.message || '保存大纲失败')\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+async function handleConfirm() {\n+  try {\n+    await outlineStore.confirmOutline()\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    emit('error', err?.message || '确认大纲失败')\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+async function handleSendRevise() {\n+  const msg = reviseMessage.value.trim()\n+  if (!msg) return\n+  showReviseInput.value = false\n+  showReviseDialog.value = true\n+  revisingDialogLoading.value = true\n+  try {\n+    await outlineStore.reviseOutline(msg)\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    emit('error', err?.message || 'AI 修订失败')\n+    showReviseDialog.value = false\n+  } finally {\n+    revisingDialogLoading.value = false\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+function handleApplyRevision() {\n+  outlineStore.applyRevision()\n+  showReviseDialog.value = false\n+  reviseMessage.value = ''\n+}\n+\n+function handleCancelRevision() {\n+  outlineStore.discardRevision()\n+  showReviseDialog.value = false\n+  reviseMessage.value = ''\n+}\n+</script>\n+\n+<style scoped>\n+.outline-editor {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 12px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 头部 */\n+.outline-header {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  padding: 12px 16px;\n+  background: #f8fbf9;\n+  border: 1px solid #e2ece6;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+}\n+.outline-meta {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 12px;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #607a71;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+.outline-status {\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+  padding: 2px 8px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+.status-draft { background: #f0f5f2; color: #2f605a; }\n+.status-confirming { background: #fff8e6; color: #7c4a15; }\n+.status-confirmed { background: #d1fae5; color: #065f46; }\n+.status-superseded { background: #f3f4f6; color: #6b7280; }\n+.outline-actions {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+\n+/* 错误条 */\n+.error-bar {\n+  padding: 10px 14px;\n+  background: #fef2f2;\n+  border: 1px solid #fecaca;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  color: #dc2626;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 节点列表 */\n+.nodes-list {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+}\n+\n+.outline-node-card {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 12px;\n+  padding: 14px 16px;\n+  background: #fff;\n+  border: 1.5px solid #e2ece6;\n+  border-radius: 14px;\n+  transition: border-color 0.15s;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card:hover {\n+  border-color: #5ca68f;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card.node-type-section {\n+  border-left: 4px solid #2f605a;\n+  background: #f8fbf9;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card.node-type-quiz {\n+  border-left: 4px solid #7c3aed;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card.node-type-interactive {\n+  border-left: 4px solid #ea580c;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card.node-type-summary {\n+  border-left: 4px solid #ca8a04;\n+}\n+\n+/* 序号 */\n+.node-drag-handle {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 4px;\n+  min-width: 28px;\n+}\n+.node-order {\n+  font-size: 16px;\n+  font-weight: 700;\n+  color: #5ca68f;\n+  line-height: 1;\n+}\n+.node-move-btns {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 2px;\n+}\n+.move-btn {\n+  background: none;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 4px;\n+  font-size: 10px;\n+  color: #5ca68f;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  padding: 1px 4px;\n+  line-height: 1;\n+}\n+.move-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.35; cursor: not-allowed; }\n+\n+/* 节点内容 */\n+.node-content {\n+  flex: 1;\n+  min-width: 0;\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+.node-top-row {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+.node-type-select {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 6px;\n+  padding: 3px 6px;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  background: #f0f5f2;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+}\n+.node-type-badge {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  background: #e2ece6;\n+  color: #5ca68f;\n+  padding: 2px 8px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+.node-title-input {\n+  flex: 1;\n+  font-size: 14px;\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+  border: none;\n+  border-bottom: 1.5px solid #c6ded6;\n+  padding: 2px 4px;\n+  outline: none;\n+  color: #1e293b;\n+  background: transparent;\n+  min-width: 0;\n+}\n+.node-title-input:focus { border-bottom-color: #5ca68f; }\n+.node-title { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #1e293b; }\n+.node-summary-input {\n+  width: 100%;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #475569;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  padding: 6px 8px;\n+  resize: vertical;\n+  outline: none;\n+  font-family: inherit;\n+  box-sizing: border-box;\n+  background: #fafcfa;\n+}\n+.node-summary-input:focus { border-color: #5ca68f; }\n+.node-summary { font-size: 12px; color: #475569; margin: 0; line-height: 1.5; }\n+\n+/* 知识点 */\n+.node-key-points {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: flex-start;\n+  gap: 6px;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+.kp-label { font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; white-space: nowrap; line-height: 22px; }\n+.kp-tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; align-items: center; }\n+.kp-tag {\n+  display: inline-flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 4px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  background: #e8f5f0;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  padding: 2px 8px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+.kp-remove {\n+  background: none;\n+  border: none;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  padding: 0;\n+  line-height: 1;\n+  opacity: 0.6;\n+}\n+.kp-remove:hover { opacity: 1; }\n+.kp-add-input {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  border: none;\n+  background: transparent;\n+  outline: none;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  width: 100px;\n+  padding: 2px 4px;\n+}\n+.kp-tag-static {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  background: #e8f5f0;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  padding: 2px 8px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 互动规划 */\n+.node-interactive-plan {\n+  border-top: 1px dashed #c6ded6;\n+  padding-top: 8px;\n+}\n+.plan-toggle {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #5ca68f;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  user-select: none;\n+  list-style: none;\n+}\n+.plan-toggle::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }\n+.plan-fields {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  margin-top: 8px;\n+}\n+.plan-fields label {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 4px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  color: #64748b;\n+}\n+.plan-fields input[type=\"number\"] {\n+  width: 54px;\n+  padding: 2px 5px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 5px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  outline: none;\n+}\n+.plan-fields select {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 5px;\n+  padding: 2px 4px;\n+  outline: none;\n+}\n+.plan-fields input[type=\"checkbox\"] { width: 14px; height: 14px; }\n+\n+/* 底部：时长 & 删除 */\n+.node-footer {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+.duration-label {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 5px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  color: #64748b;\n+}\n+.duration-input {\n+  width: 48px;\n+  padding: 2px 6px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 5px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  text-align: center;\n+  outline: none;\n+}\n+.duration-input:disabled { background: #f8fbf9; }\n+.node-delete-btn {\n+  background: none;\n+  border: none;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  font-size: 14px;\n+  opacity: 0.4;\n+  transition: opacity 0.15s;\n+}\n+.node-delete-btn:hover { opacity: 1; }\n+\n+/* 添加节点 */\n+.add-node-row {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  justify-content: center;\n+  padding: 10px 0;\n+}\n+.add-node-btn {\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+}\n+.btn {\n+  padding: 6px 14px;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  font-weight: 500;\n+  transition: all 0.15s;\n+  border: 1px solid transparent;\n+}\n+.btn-sm { padding: 5px 12px; font-size: 12px; }\n+.btn-outline {\n+  background: #fff;\n+  border-color: #c6ded6;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.btn-outline:hover { background: #f0f5f2; }\n+.btn-primary {\n+  background: #2f605a;\n+  color: #fff;\n+  border-color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.btn-primary:hover:not(:disabled) { background: #1e4a44; }\n+.btn-primary:disabled { opacity: 0.5; cursor: not-allowed; }\n+.btn:disabled { opacity: 0.5; cursor: not-allowed; }\n+\n+/* 修订输入条 */\n+.revise-input-bar {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  padding: 10px 14px;\n+  background: #f0f5f2;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 10px;\n+}\n+.revise-text-input {\n+  flex: 1;\n+  padding: 6px 10px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  outline: none;\n+}\n+.revise-text-input:focus { border-color: #5ca68f; }\n+\n+/* 过渡动画 */\n+.node-list-enter-active,\n+.node-list-leave-active { transition: all 0.25s ease; }\n+.node-list-enter-from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-8px); }\n+.node-list-leave-to { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-8px); }\n+</style>\ndiff --git a/.rivet/backups/1789136887476/frontend/teacher/src/components/teacher/OutlineEditor.vue b/.rivet/backups/1789136887476/frontend/teacher/src/components/teacher/OutlineEditor.vue\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..76199ce\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/.rivet/backups/1789136887476/frontend/teacher/src/components/teacher/OutlineEditor.vue\n@@ -0,0 +1,856 @@\n+<template>\n+  <div class=\"outline-editor\">\n+    <!-- 大纲头部信息 -->\n+    <div class=\"outline-header\">\n+      <div class=\"outline-meta\">\n+        <span class=\"outline-id\" v-if=\"outlineStore.outline_id\">\n+          大纲 ID：{{ outlineStore.outline_id }}\n+        </span>\n+        <span class=\"outline-version\" v-if=\"outlineStore.outline_version\">\n+          v{{ outlineStore.outline_version }}\n+        </span>\n+        <span class=\"outline-status\" :class=\"`status-${outlineStore.status}`\">\n+          {{ statusLabel }}\n+        </span>\n+        <span class=\"outline-duration\">\n+          ⏱ 总计 {{ outlineStore.totalDuration }} 分钟 · {{ outlineStore.nodeCount }} 个节点\n+        </span>\n+      </div>\n+      <div class=\"outline-actions\">\n+        <button\n+          v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-sm\"\n+          :disabled=\"outlineStore.reviseLoading\"\n+          @click=\"showReviseInput = true\"\n+          title=\"发送指令让 AI 修改大纲\"\n+        >\n+          {{ outlineStore.reviseLoading ? 'AI 修订中...' : '🤖 AI 修订' }}\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-sm\"\n+          :disabled=\"outlineStore.loading\"\n+          @click=\"handleSave\"\n+        >\n+          保存大纲\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          v-if=\"outlineStore.isConfirmed\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\"\n+          @click=\"$emit('confirm-complete')\"\n+        >\n+          进入内容生成 →\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          v-else-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit && outlineStore.nodeCount > 0\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\"\n+          :disabled=\"outlineStore.loading\"\n+          @click=\"handleConfirm\"\n+        >\n+          {{ outlineStore.loading ? '确认中...' : '确认大纲' }}\n+        </button>\n+      </div>\n+    </div>\n+\n+    <!-- 错误提示 -->\n+    <div v-if=\"outlineStore.error || outlineStore.confirmError\" class=\"error-bar\" role=\"alert\">\n+      {{ outlineStore.confirmError || outlineStore.error }}\n+    </div>\n+\n+    <!-- 节点编辑器 -->\n+    <div class=\"nodes-list\">\n+      <TransitionGroup name=\"node-list\">\n+        <div\n+          v-for=\"(node, idx) in outlineStore.nodes\"\n+          :key=\"node.node_id\"\n+          class=\"outline-node-card\"\n+          :class=\"`node-type-${node.node_type}`\"\n+        >\n+          <!-- 节点序号 & 移动按钮 -->\n+          <div class=\"node-drag-handle\">\n+            <span class=\"node-order\">{{ idx + 1 }}</span>\n+            <div class=\"node-move-btns\" v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\">\n+              <button\n+                class=\"move-btn\"\n+                :disabled=\"idx === 0\"\n+                @click=\"outlineStore.moveNode(node.node_id, 'up')\"\n+                title=\"上移\"\n+              >↑</button>\n+              <button\n+                class=\"move-btn\"\n+                :disabled=\"idx === outlineStore.nodes.length - 1\"\n+                @click=\"outlineStore.moveNode(node.node_id, 'down')\"\n+                title=\"下移\"\n+              >↓</button>\n+            </div>\n+          </div>\n+\n+          <!-- 节点内容 -->\n+          <div class=\"node-content\">\n+            <div class=\"node-top-row\">\n+              <!-- 节点类型选择 -->\n+              <select\n+                v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+                v-model=\"node.node_type\"\n+                class=\"node-type-select\"\n+                @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { node_type: node.node_type })\"\n+              >\n+                <option value=\"content\">📖 知识讲解</option>\n+                <option value=\"section\">📂 章节标题</option>\n+                <option value=\"quiz\">❓ 随堂测验</option>\n+                <option value=\"interactive\">🎮 互动环节</option>\n+                <option value=\"summary\">📋 总结回顾</option>\n+              </select>\n+              <span v-else class=\"node-type-badge\">{{ node.node_type }}</span>\n+\n+              <!-- 标题 -->\n+              <input\n+                v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+                v-model=\"node.title\"\n+                class=\"node-title-input\"\n+                placeholder=\"节点标题\"\n+                @input=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { title: node.title })\"\n+              />\n+              <div v-else class=\"node-title\">{{ node.title }}</div>\n+            </div>\n+\n+            <!-- 摘要 -->\n+            <textarea\n+              v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+              v-model=\"node.summary\"\n+              class=\"node-summary-input\"\n+              placeholder=\"节点摘要（简述本节点教学内容）\"\n+              rows=\"2\"\n+              @input=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { summary: node.summary })\"\n+            ></textarea>\n+            <p v-else class=\"node-summary\">{{ node.summary }}</p>\n+\n+            <!-- 核心知识点标签 -->\n+            <div class=\"node-key-points\">\n+              <span class=\"kp-label\">核心知识点：</span>\n+              <template v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\">\n+                <div class=\"kp-tags\">\n+                  <span\n+                    v-for=\"(kp, ki) in node.key_points\"\n+                    :key=\"ki\"\n+                    class=\"kp-tag\"\n+                  >\n+                    {{ kp }}\n+                    <button class=\"kp-remove\" @click=\"removeKeyPoint(node, ki)\">×</button>\n+                  </span>\n+                  <input\n+                    v-model=\"newKeyPoints[node.node_id]\"\n+                    class=\"kp-add-input\"\n+                    placeholder=\"+ 添加知识点\"\n+                    @keyup.enter=\"addKeyPoint(node)\"\n+                  />\n+                </div>\n+              </template>\n+              <template v-else>\n+                <span v-for=\"(kp, ki) in node.key_points\" :key=\"ki\" class=\"kp-tag-static\">\n+                  {{ kp }}\n+                </span>\n+              </template>\n+            </div>\n+\n+            <!-- 互动规划（仅 interactive / quiz 类型且有 plan 时显示）\n+                 注意：必须判 interactive_plan 非空——后端/LLM 产出的交互节点该字段常为 null，\n+                 直接访问 interactive_plan.x 会抛错并中断整个节点列表渲染。 -->\n+            <div\n+              v-if=\"(node.node_type === 'interactive' || node.node_type === 'quiz') && node.interactive_plan && outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+              class=\"node-interactive-plan\"\n+            >\n+              <details>\n+                <summary class=\"plan-toggle\">🎯 互动规划</summary>\n+                <div class=\"plan-fields\">\n+                  <label>\n+                    时长（分钟）\n+                    <input\n+                      type=\"number\"\n+                      v-model.number=\"node.interactive_plan.duration_minutes\"\n+                      min=\"1\"\n+                      max=\"60\"\n+                      @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { interactive_plan: { ...node.interactive_plan } })\"\n+                    />\n+                  </label>\n+                  <label>\n+                    题目数量\n+                    <input\n+                      type=\"number\"\n+                      v-model.number=\"node.interactive_plan.question_count\"\n+                      min=\"1\"\n+                      max=\"20\"\n+                      @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { interactive_plan: { ...node.interactive_plan } })\"\n+                    />\n+                  </label>\n+                  <label>\n+                    自动判分\n+                    <input\n+                      type=\"checkbox\"\n+                      v-model=\"node.interactive_plan.auto_grading\"\n+                      @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { interactive_plan: { ...node.interactive_plan } })\"\n+                    />\n+                  </label>\n+                  <label>\n+                    产出方式\n+                    <select v-model=\"node.interactive_plan.delivery\">\n+                      <option value=\"html5_link\">HTML5 链接</option>\n+                      <option value=\"ppt_native\">PPT 内嵌</option>\n+                      <option value=\"standalone_html\">独立 HTML</option>\n+                    </select>\n+                  </label>\n+                </div>\n+              </details>\n+            </div>\n+\n+            <!-- 时长 -->\n+            <div class=\"node-footer\">\n+              <label class=\"duration-label\">\n+                时长\n+                <input\n+                  type=\"number\"\n+                  v-model.number=\"node.estimated_duration_minutes\"\n+                  min=\"1\"\n+                  max=\"180\"\n+                  :disabled=\"!outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+                  class=\"duration-input\"\n+                  @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { estimated_duration_minutes: node.estimated_duration_minutes })\"\n+                />\n+                分钟\n+              </label>\n+\n+              <!-- 删除按钮 -->\n+              <button\n+                v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+                class=\"node-delete-btn\"\n+                @click=\"handleDeleteNode(node.node_id)\"\n+                title=\"删除节点\"\n+              >🗑</button>\n+            </div>\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+      </TransitionGroup>\n+\n+      <!-- 添加节点按钮 -->\n+      <div v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\" class=\"add-node-row\">\n+        <button class=\"btn btn-outline add-node-btn\" @click=\"handleAddNode\">\n+          ＋ 添加节点\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          v-if=\"outlineStore.nodes.length === 0\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-primary\"\n+          @click=\"handleGenerateOutline\"\n+          :disabled=\"outlineStore.loading\"\n+        >\n+          {{ outlineStore.loading ? 'AI 生成中...' : '🤖 AI 生成大纲' }}\n+        </button>\n+      </div>\n+    </div>\n+\n+    <!-- AI 修订对话框 -->\n+    <OutlineRevisionDialog\n+      :visible=\"showReviseDialog\"\n+      :loading=\"revisingDialogLoading\"\n+      :change-summary=\"outlineStore.changeSummary\"\n+      :pending-nodes=\"outlineStore.pendingRevision?.nodes || []\"\n+      @apply=\"handleApplyRevision\"\n+      @cancel=\"handleCancelRevision\"\n+    />\n+\n+    <!-- AI 修订输入弹窗 -->\n+    <div v-if=\"showReviseDialog\" class=\"dialog-overlay\" style=\"display:none\"><!-- 利用 OutlineRevisionDialog --></div>\n+\n+    <!-- 修订指令输入（集成在 OutlineRevisionDialog 之前） -->\n+    <div v-if=\"showReviseInput\" class=\"revise-input-bar\">\n+      <input\n+        v-model=\"reviseMessage\"\n+        class=\"revise-text-input\"\n+        placeholder=\"例如：增加一个生活案例，把课堂练习放到快速排序之后\"\n+        @keyup.enter=\"handleSendRevise\"\n+        autofocus\n+      />\n+      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" @click=\"handleSendRevise\" :disabled=\"!reviseMessage.trim()\">\n+        发送修订\n+      </button>\n+      <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" @click=\"showReviseInput = false\">取消</button>\n+    </div>\n+  </div>\n+</template>\n+\n+<script setup>\n+import { ref, computed, watch } from 'vue'\n+import { useOutlineStore } from '../../stores/outlineStore'\n+import OutlineRevisionDialog from './OutlineRevisionDialog.vue'\n+\n+const props = defineProps({\n+  /** 所属 session_id（从 S1 透传） */\n+  sessionId: { type: String, default: '' },\n+  /** 所属 intent_id（从 S1 透传） */\n+  intentId: { type: String, default: '' },\n+  /** 教学意图摘要（用于创建大纲） */\n+  intentSummary: { type: Object, default: null },\n+  /** 是否自动尝试从 localStorage 恢复大纲 */\n+  autoRestore: { type: Boolean, default: true }\n+})\n+\n+const emit = defineEmits(['confirm-complete', 'outline-created', 'error'])\n+\n+const outlineStore = useOutlineStore()\n+\n+const showReviseDialog = ref(false)\n+const showReviseInput = ref(false)\n+const reviseMessage = ref('')\n+const revisingDialogLoading = ref(false) // 对话框内 AI 正在生成修订\n+const newKeyPoints = ref({}) // { [node_id]: input value }\n+\n+const statusLabel = computed(() => ({\n+  draft: '草稿',\n+  confirming: '确认中',\n+  confirmed: '已确认',\n+  superseded: '已替代'\n+}[outlineStore.status] || outlineStore.status))\n+\n+// 自动恢复\n+// 最近一次与后端对齐（创建 / 保存 / 确认）时的节点快照签名\n+const lastPersistedSignature = ref('')\n+const savingOutline = ref(false)\n+\n+/** 节点快照签名——用于判断是否存在未落库的本地编辑 */\n+function nodesSignature() {\n+  return JSON.stringify(outlineStore.nodes || [])\n+}\n+\n+/**\n+ * 是否存在未落库的本地编辑（排序 / 增删 / 改字段 / 采纳 AI 修订）。\n+ * 根因：后端生成链路以「存储版本」的节点为准——\n+ * generation_handler.go:40 GetConfirmed 取库中版本，:49 直接以其 Nodes 覆盖 req.OutlineNodes。\n+ * 前端只写 localStorage 不落库时，本地编辑在内容生成与页面管理阶段被静默丢弃\n+ * （表现为：手动添加的节点传不过去、排序在生成后回弹）。\n+ */\n+const hasUnsavedEdit = computed(() => {\n+  if (!outlineStore.outline_id) return false\n+  return nodesSignature() !== lastPersistedSignature.value\n+})\n+\n+/** 标记当前节点已与后端对齐 */\n+function markPersisted() {\n+  lastPersistedSignature.value = nodesSignature()\n+}\n+\n+/**\n+ * 保存会产出新版本，且后端 SaveOutlineVersion 把新版本状态置为 draft\n+ * （修改已确认大纲时旧版转 superseded，新版需重新确认）。\n+ * 前端不同步 status 会误判「仍已确认」，随后生成请求被 GetConfirmed 以 409 拒绝。\n+ */\n+function syncStatusFromSave(data) {\n+  if (data && data.status) outlineStore.status = data.status\n+}\n+\n+/** 落库保障：把本地编辑提交为后端新版本；无改动则跳过（避免无谓的版本链膨胀） */\n+async function persistIfDirty() {\n+  if (!outlineStore.outline_id || !hasUnsavedEdit.value) return false\n+  savingOutline.value = true\n+  try {\n+    const data = await outlineStore.saveVersion()\n+    syncStatusFromSave(data)\n+    markPersisted()\n+    return true\n+  } finally {\n+    savingOutline.value = false\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+// 自动恢复\n+if (props.autoRestore) {\n+  outlineStore.restore()\n+}\n+// 恢复的节点来自本地缓存，作为对齐基线；否则刚进页面就会误报「有未保存的修改」\n+markPersisted()\n+}\n+\n+// 若无大纲且有 intent，自动创建\n+watch(\n+  () => [outlineStore.outline_id, outlineStore.nodes.length],\n+  ([oid, nc]) => {\n+    if (!oid && nc === 0 && props.intentSummary) {\n+      handleGenerateOutline()\n+    }\n+  },\n+  { immediate: true }\n+)\n+\n+async function handleGenerateOutline() {\n+  if (!props.sessionId) {\n+    emit('error', '缺少 session_id，请先完成 S1 意图理解')\n+    return\n+  }\n+  try {\n+    // 尝试从 localStorage 读取证据包\n+    let evidence = null\n+    try {\n+      const raw = window.localStorage.getItem('fuww_s2_evidence_packet')\n+      if (raw) evidence = JSON.parse(raw)\n+    } catch {}\n+    // 尝试从 localStorage 读取 markdown 内容\n+    let markdown = ''\n+    try {\n+      const m = window.localStorage.getItem('fuww_s2_markdown')\n+      if (m) markdown = m\n+    } catch {}\n+\n+    await outlineStore.createOutline({\n+      session_id: props.sessionId,\n+      intent_id: props.intentId,\n+      intent: props.intentSummary || {},\n+      evidence_packet: evidence,\n+      markdown\n+    })\n+    emit('outline-created', {\n+      outline_id: outlineStore.outline_id,\n+      outline_version: outlineStore.outline_version\n+    })\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    emit('error', err?.message || '创建大纲失败')\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+function handleAddNode() {\n+  const lastNodeId = outlineStore.nodes.at(-1)?.node_id || null\n+  outlineStore.addNode(lastNodeId)\n+}\n+\n+function handleDeleteNode(nodeId) {\n+  if (outlineStore.nodes.length <= 1) {\n+    emit('error', '大纲至少需要一个节点')\n+    return\n+  }\n+  outlineStore.removeNode(nodeId)\n+}\n+\n+function addKeyPoint(node) {\n+  const val = (newKeyPoints.value[node.node_id] || '').trim()\n+  if (!val) return\n+  const kps = [...(node.key_points || []), val]\n+  outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { key_points: kps })\n+  newKeyPoints.value[node.node_id] = ''\n+}\n+\n+function removeKeyPoint(node, index) {\n+  const kps = [...(node.key_points || [])]\n+  kps.splice(index, 1)\n+  outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { key_points: kps })\n+}\n+\n+async function handleSave() {\n+  try {\n+    const data = await outlineStore.saveVersion()\n+    // 后端保存产出新版本并重置为 draft，前端必须同步状态，否则后续生成被 409 拒绝\n+    syncStatusFromSave(data)\n+    markPersisted()\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    emit('error', err?.message || '保存大纲失败')\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+async function handleConfirm() {\n+  try {\n+    // 确认前先落库：确认会冻结该版本，未提交的本地编辑（新增节点 / 排序）将永远进不了生成链路\n+    await persistIfDirty()\n+    await outlineStore.confirmOutline()\n+    markPersisted()\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    emit('error', err?.message || '确认大纲失败')\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+async function handleSendRevise() {\n+  const msg = reviseMessage.value.trim()\n+  if (!msg) return\n+  showReviseInput.value = false\n+  showReviseDialog.value = true\n+  revisingDialogLoading.value = true\n+  try {\n+    await outlineStore.reviseOutline(msg)\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    emit('error', err?.message || 'AI 修订失败')\n+    showReviseDialog.value = false\n+  } finally {\n+    revisingDialogLoading.value = false\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+function handleApplyRevision() {\n+  outlineStore.applyRevision()\n+  showReviseDialog.value = false\n+  reviseMessage.value = ''\n+}\n+\n+function handleCancelRevision() {\n+  outlineStore.discardRevision()\n+  showReviseDialog.value = false\n+  reviseMessage.value = ''\n+}\n+</script>\n+\n+<style scoped>\n+.outline-editor {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 12px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 头部 */\n+.outline-header {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  padding: 12px 16px;\n+  background: #f8fbf9;\n+  border: 1px solid #e2ece6;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+}\n+.outline-meta {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 12px;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #607a71;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+.outline-status {\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+  padding: 2px 8px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+.status-draft { background: #f0f5f2; color: #2f605a; }\n+.status-confirming { background: #fff8e6; color: #7c4a15; }\n+.status-confirmed { background: #d1fae5; color: #065f46; }\n+.status-superseded { background: #f3f4f6; color: #6b7280; }\n+.outline-actions {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+\n+/* 错误条 */\n+.error-bar {\n+  padding: 10px 14px;\n+  background: #fef2f2;\n+  border: 1px solid #fecaca;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  color: #dc2626;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 节点列表 */\n+.nodes-list {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+}\n+\n+.outline-node-card {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 12px;\n+  padding: 14px 16px;\n+  background: #fff;\n+  border: 1.5px solid #e2ece6;\n+  border-radius: 14px;\n+  transition: border-color 0.15s;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card:hover {\n+  border-color: #5ca68f;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card.node-type-section {\n+  border-left: 4px solid #2f605a;\n+  background: #f8fbf9;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card.node-type-quiz {\n+  border-left: 4px solid #7c3aed;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card.node-type-interactive {\n+  border-left: 4px solid #ea580c;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card.node-type-summary {\n+  border-left: 4px solid #ca8a04;\n+}\n+\n+/* 序号 */\n+.node-drag-handle {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 4px;\n+  min-width: 28px;\n+}\n+.node-order {\n+  font-size: 16px;\n+  font-weight: 700;\n+  color: #5ca68f;\n+  line-height: 1;\n+}\n+.node-move-btns {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 2px;\n+}\n+.move-btn {\n+  background: none;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 4px;\n+  font-size: 10px;\n+  color: #5ca68f;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  padding: 1px 4px;\n+  line-height: 1;\n+}\n+.move-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.35; cursor: not-allowed; }\n+\n+/* 节点内容 */\n+.node-content {\n+  flex: 1;\n+  min-width: 0;\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+.node-top-row {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+.node-type-select {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 6px;\n+  padding: 3px 6px;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  background: #f0f5f2;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+}\n+.node-type-badge {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  background: #e2ece6;\n+  color: #5ca68f;\n+  padding: 2px 8px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+.node-title-input {\n+  flex: 1;\n+  font-size: 14px;\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+  border: none;\n+  border-bottom: 1.5px solid #c6ded6;\n+  padding: 2px 4px;\n+  outline: none;\n+  color: #1e293b;\n+  background: transparent;\n+  min-width: 0;\n+}\n+.node-title-input:focus { border-bottom-color: #5ca68f; }\n+.node-title { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #1e293b; }\n+.node-summary-input {\n+  width: 100%;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #475569;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  padding: 6px 8px;\n+  resize: vertical;\n+  outline: none;\n+  font-family: inherit;\n+  box-sizing: border-box;\n+  background: #fafcfa;\n+}\n+.node-summary-input:focus { border-color: #5ca68f; }\n+.node-summary { font-size: 12px; color: #475569; margin: 0; line-height: 1.5; }\n+\n+/* 知识点 */\n+.node-key-points {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: flex-start;\n+  gap: 6px;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+.kp-label { font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; white-space: nowrap; line-height: 22px; }\n+.kp-tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; align-items: center; }\n+.kp-tag {\n+  display: inline-flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 4px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  background: #e8f5f0;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  padding: 2px 8px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+.kp-remove {\n+  background: none;\n+  border: none;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  padding: 0;\n+  line-height: 1;\n+  opacity: 0.6;\n+}\n+.kp-remove:hover { opacity: 1; }\n+.kp-add-input {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  border: none;\n+  background: transparent;\n+  outline: none;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  width: 100px;\n+  padding: 2px 4px;\n+}\n+.kp-tag-static {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  background: #e8f5f0;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  padding: 2px 8px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 互动规划 */\n+.node-interactive-plan {\n+  border-top: 1px dashed #c6ded6;\n+  padding-top: 8px;\n+}\n+.plan-toggle {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #5ca68f;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  user-select: none;\n+  list-style: none;\n+}\n+.plan-toggle::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }\n+.plan-fields {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  margin-top: 8px;\n+}\n+.plan-fields label {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 4px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  color: #64748b;\n+}\n+.plan-fields input[type=\"number\"] {\n+  width: 54px;\n+  padding: 2px 5px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 5px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  outline: none;\n+}\n+.plan-fields select {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 5px;\n+  padding: 2px 4px;\n+  outline: none;\n+}\n+.plan-fields input[type=\"checkbox\"] { width: 14px; height: 14px; }\n+\n+/* 底部：时长 & 删除 */\n+.node-footer {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+.duration-label {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 5px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  color: #64748b;\n+}\n+.duration-input {\n+  width: 48px;\n+  padding: 2px 6px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 5px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  text-align: center;\n+  outline: none;\n+}\n+.duration-input:disabled { background: #f8fbf9; }\n+.node-delete-btn {\n+  background: none;\n+  border: none;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  font-size: 14px;\n+  opacity: 0.4;\n+  transition: opacity 0.15s;\n+}\n+.node-delete-btn:hover { opacity: 1; }\n+\n+/* 添加节点 */\n+.add-node-row {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  justify-content: center;\n+  padding: 10px 0;\n+}\n+.add-node-btn {\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+}\n+.btn {\n+  padding: 6px 14px;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  font-weight: 500;\n+  transition: all 0.15s;\n+  border: 1px solid transparent;\n+}\n+.btn-sm { padding: 5px 12px; font-size: 12px; }\n+.btn-outline {\n+  background: #fff;\n+  border-color: #c6ded6;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.btn-outline:hover { background: #f0f5f2; }\n+.btn-primary {\n+  background: #2f605a;\n+  color: #fff;\n+  border-color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.btn-primary:hover:not(:disabled) { background: #1e4a44; }\n+.btn-primary:disabled { opacity: 0.5; cursor: not-allowed; }\n+.btn:disabled { opacity: 0.5; cursor: not-allowed; }\n+\n+/* 修订输入条 */\n+.revise-input-bar {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  padding: 10px 14px;\n+  background: #f0f5f2;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 10px;\n+}\n+.revise-text-input {\n+  flex: 1;\n+  padding: 6px 10px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  outline: none;\n+}\n+.revise-text-input:focus { border-color: #5ca68f; }\n+\n+/* 过渡动画 */\n+.node-list-enter-active,\n+.node-list-leave-active { transition: all 0.25s ease; }\n+.node-list-enter-from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-8px); }\n+.node-list-leave-to { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-8px); }\n+</style>\ndiff --git a/.rivet/backups/1789136904268/frontend/teacher/src/components/teacher/OutlineEditor.vue b/.rivet/backups/1789136904268/frontend/teacher/src/components/teacher/OutlineEditor.vue\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..875a207\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/.rivet/backups/1789136904268/frontend/teacher/src/components/teacher/OutlineEditor.vue\n@@ -0,0 +1,863 @@\n+<template>\n+  <div class=\"outline-editor\">\n+    <!-- 大纲头部信息 -->\n+    <div class=\"outline-header\">\n+      <div class=\"outline-meta\">\n+        <span class=\"outline-id\" v-if=\"outlineStore.outline_id\">\n+          大纲 ID：{{ outlineStore.outline_id }}\n+        </span>\n+        <span class=\"outline-version\" v-if=\"outlineStore.outline_version\">\n+          v{{ outlineStore.outline_version }}\n+        </span>\n+        <span class=\"outline-status\" :class=\"`status-${outlineStore.status}`\">\n+          {{ statusLabel }}\n+        </span>\n+        <span class=\"outline-duration\">\n+          ⏱ 总计 {{ outlineStore.totalDuration }} 分钟 · {{ outlineStore.nodeCount }} 个节点\n+        </span>\n+      </div>\n+      <div class=\"outline-actions\">\n+        <button\n+          v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-sm\"\n+          :disabled=\"outlineStore.reviseLoading\"\n+          @click=\"showReviseInput = true\"\n+          title=\"发送指令让 AI 修改大纲\"\n+        >\n+          {{ outlineStore.reviseLoading ? 'AI 修订中...' : '🤖 AI 修订' }}\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-sm\"\n+          :disabled=\"outlineStore.loading\"\n+          @click=\"handleSave\"\n+        >\n+          保存大纲\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          v-if=\"outlineStore.isConfirmed\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\"\n+          @click=\"$emit('confirm-complete')\"\n+        >\n+          进入内容生成 →\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          v-else-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit && outlineStore.nodeCount > 0\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\"\n+          :disabled=\"outlineStore.loading\"\n+          @click=\"handleConfirm\"\n+        >\n+          {{ outlineStore.loading ? '确认中...' : '确认大纲' }}\n+        </button>\n+      </div>\n+    </div>\n+\n+    <!-- 错误提示 -->\n+    <div v-if=\"outlineStore.error || outlineStore.confirmError\" class=\"error-bar\" role=\"alert\">\n+      {{ outlineStore.confirmError || outlineStore.error }}\n+    </div>\n+\n+    <!-- 节点编辑器 -->\n+    <div class=\"nodes-list\">\n+      <TransitionGroup name=\"node-list\">\n+        <div\n+          v-for=\"(node, idx) in outlineStore.nodes\"\n+          :key=\"node.node_id\"\n+          class=\"outline-node-card\"\n+          :class=\"`node-type-${node.node_type}`\"\n+        >\n+          <!-- 节点序号 & 移动按钮 -->\n+          <div class=\"node-drag-handle\">\n+            <span class=\"node-order\">{{ idx + 1 }}</span>\n+            <div class=\"node-move-btns\" v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\">\n+              <button\n+                class=\"move-btn\"\n+                :disabled=\"idx === 0\"\n+                @click=\"outlineStore.moveNode(node.node_id, 'up')\"\n+                title=\"上移\"\n+              >↑</button>\n+              <button\n+                class=\"move-btn\"\n+                :disabled=\"idx === outlineStore.nodes.length - 1\"\n+                @click=\"outlineStore.moveNode(node.node_id, 'down')\"\n+                title=\"下移\"\n+              >↓</button>\n+            </div>\n+          </div>\n+\n+          <!-- 节点内容 -->\n+          <div class=\"node-content\">\n+            <div class=\"node-top-row\">\n+              <!-- 节点类型选择 -->\n+              <select\n+                v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+                v-model=\"node.node_type\"\n+                class=\"node-type-select\"\n+                @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { node_type: node.node_type })\"\n+              >\n+                <option value=\"content\">📖 知识讲解</option>\n+                <option value=\"section\">📂 章节标题</option>\n+                <option value=\"quiz\">❓ 随堂测验</option>\n+                <option value=\"interactive\">🎮 互动环节</option>\n+                <option value=\"summary\">📋 总结回顾</option>\n+              </select>\n+              <span v-else class=\"node-type-badge\">{{ node.node_type }}</span>\n+\n+              <!-- 标题 -->\n+              <input\n+                v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+                v-model=\"node.title\"\n+                class=\"node-title-input\"\n+                placeholder=\"节点标题\"\n+                @input=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { title: node.title })\"\n+              />\n+              <div v-else class=\"node-title\">{{ node.title }}</div>\n+            </div>\n+\n+            <!-- 摘要 -->\n+            <textarea\n+              v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+              v-model=\"node.summary\"\n+              class=\"node-summary-input\"\n+              placeholder=\"节点摘要（简述本节点教学内容）\"\n+              rows=\"2\"\n+              @input=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { summary: node.summary })\"\n+            ></textarea>\n+            <p v-else class=\"node-summary\">{{ node.summary }}</p>\n+\n+            <!-- 核心知识点标签 -->\n+            <div class=\"node-key-points\">\n+              <span class=\"kp-label\">核心知识点：</span>\n+              <template v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\">\n+                <div class=\"kp-tags\">\n+                  <span\n+                    v-for=\"(kp, ki) in node.key_points\"\n+                    :key=\"ki\"\n+                    class=\"kp-tag\"\n+                  >\n+                    {{ kp }}\n+                    <button class=\"kp-remove\" @click=\"removeKeyPoint(node, ki)\">×</button>\n+                  </span>\n+                  <input\n+                    v-model=\"newKeyPoints[node.node_id]\"\n+                    class=\"kp-add-input\"\n+                    placeholder=\"+ 添加知识点\"\n+                    @keyup.enter=\"addKeyPoint(node)\"\n+                  />\n+                </div>\n+              </template>\n+              <template v-else>\n+                <span v-for=\"(kp, ki) in node.key_points\" :key=\"ki\" class=\"kp-tag-static\">\n+                  {{ kp }}\n+                </span>\n+              </template>\n+            </div>\n+\n+            <!-- 互动规划（仅 interactive / quiz 类型且有 plan 时显示）\n+                 注意：必须判 interactive_plan 非空——后端/LLM 产出的交互节点该字段常为 null，\n+                 直接访问 interactive_plan.x 会抛错并中断整个节点列表渲染。 -->\n+            <div\n+              v-if=\"(node.node_type === 'interactive' || node.node_type === 'quiz') && node.interactive_plan && outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+              class=\"node-interactive-plan\"\n+            >\n+              <details>\n+                <summary class=\"plan-toggle\">🎯 互动规划</summary>\n+                <div class=\"plan-fields\">\n+                  <label>\n+                    时长（分钟）\n+                    <input\n+                      type=\"number\"\n+                      v-model.number=\"node.interactive_plan.duration_minutes\"\n+                      min=\"1\"\n+                      max=\"60\"\n+                      @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { interactive_plan: { ...node.interactive_plan } })\"\n+                    />\n+                  </label>\n+                  <label>\n+                    题目数量\n+                    <input\n+                      type=\"number\"\n+                      v-model.number=\"node.interactive_plan.question_count\"\n+                      min=\"1\"\n+                      max=\"20\"\n+                      @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { interactive_plan: { ...node.interactive_plan } })\"\n+                    />\n+                  </label>\n+                  <label>\n+                    自动判分\n+                    <input\n+                      type=\"checkbox\"\n+                      v-model=\"node.interactive_plan.auto_grading\"\n+                      @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { interactive_plan: { ...node.interactive_plan } })\"\n+                    />\n+                  </label>\n+                  <label>\n+                    产出方式\n+                    <select v-model=\"node.interactive_plan.delivery\">\n+                      <option value=\"html5_link\">HTML5 链接</option>\n+                      <option value=\"ppt_native\">PPT 内嵌</option>\n+                      <option value=\"standalone_html\">独立 HTML</option>\n+                    </select>\n+                  </label>\n+                </div>\n+              </details>\n+            </div>\n+\n+            <!-- 时长 -->\n+            <div class=\"node-footer\">\n+              <label class=\"duration-label\">\n+                时长\n+                <input\n+                  type=\"number\"\n+                  v-model.number=\"node.estimated_duration_minutes\"\n+                  min=\"1\"\n+                  max=\"180\"\n+                  :disabled=\"!outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+                  class=\"duration-input\"\n+                  @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { estimated_duration_minutes: node.estimated_duration_minutes })\"\n+                />\n+                分钟\n+              </label>\n+\n+              <!-- 删除按钮 -->\n+              <button\n+                v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+                class=\"node-delete-btn\"\n+                @click=\"handleDeleteNode(node.node_id)\"\n+                title=\"删除节点\"\n+              >🗑</button>\n+            </div>\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+      </TransitionGroup>\n+\n+      <!-- 添加节点按钮 -->\n+      <div v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\" class=\"add-node-row\">\n+        <button class=\"btn btn-outline add-node-btn\" @click=\"handleAddNode\">\n+          ＋ 添加节点\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          v-if=\"outlineStore.nodes.length === 0\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-primary\"\n+          @click=\"handleGenerateOutline\"\n+          :disabled=\"outlineStore.loading\"\n+        >\n+          {{ outlineStore.loading ? 'AI 生成中...' : '🤖 AI 生成大纲' }}\n+        </button>\n+      </div>\n+    </div>\n+\n+    <!-- AI 修订对话框 -->\n+    <OutlineRevisionDialog\n+      :visible=\"showReviseDialog\"\n+      :loading=\"revisingDialogLoading\"\n+      :change-summary=\"outlineStore.changeSummary\"\n+      :pending-nodes=\"outlineStore.pendingRevision?.nodes || []\"\n+      @apply=\"handleApplyRevision\"\n+      @cancel=\"handleCancelRevision\"\n+    />\n+\n+    <!-- AI 修订输入弹窗 -->\n+    <div v-if=\"showReviseDialog\" class=\"dialog-overlay\" style=\"display:none\"><!-- 利用 OutlineRevisionDialog --></div>\n+\n+    <!-- 修订指令输入（集成在 OutlineRevisionDialog 之前） -->\n+    <div v-if=\"showReviseInput\" class=\"revise-input-bar\">\n+      <input\n+        v-model=\"reviseMessage\"\n+        class=\"revise-text-input\"\n+        placeholder=\"例如：增加一个生活案例，把课堂练习放到快速排序之后\"\n+        @keyup.enter=\"handleSendRevise\"\n+        autofocus\n+      />\n+      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" @click=\"handleSendRevise\" :disabled=\"!reviseMessage.trim()\">\n+        发送修订\n+      </button>\n+      <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" @click=\"showReviseInput = false\">取消</button>\n+    </div>\n+  </div>\n+</template>\n+\n+<script setup>\n+import { ref, computed, watch } from 'vue'\n+import { useOutlineStore } from '../../stores/outlineStore'\n+import OutlineRevisionDialog from './OutlineRevisionDialog.vue'\n+\n+const props = defineProps({\n+  /** 所属 session_id（从 S1 透传） */\n+  sessionId: { type: String, default: '' },\n+  /** 所属 intent_id（从 S1 透传） */\n+  intentId: { type: String, default: '' },\n+  /** 教学意图摘要（用于创建大纲） */\n+  intentSummary: { type: Object, default: null },\n+  /** 是否自动尝试从 localStorage 恢复大纲 */\n+  autoRestore: { type: Boolean, default: true }\n+})\n+\n+const emit = defineEmits(['confirm-complete', 'outline-created', 'error'])\n+\n+const outlineStore = useOutlineStore()\n+\n+const showReviseDialog = ref(false)\n+const showReviseInput = ref(false)\n+const reviseMessage = ref('')\n+const revisingDialogLoading = ref(false) // 对话框内 AI 正在生成修订\n+const newKeyPoints = ref({}) // { [node_id]: input value }\n+\n+const statusLabel = computed(() => ({\n+  draft: '草稿',\n+  confirming: '确认中',\n+  confirmed: '已确认',\n+  superseded: '已替代'\n+}[outlineStore.status] || outlineStore.status))\n+\n+// 自动恢复\n+// 最近一次与后端对齐（创建 / 保存 / 确认）时的节点快照签名\n+const lastPersistedSignature = ref('')\n+const savingOutline = ref(false)\n+\n+/** 节点快照签名——用于判断是否存在未落库的本地编辑 */\n+function nodesSignature() {\n+  return JSON.stringify(outlineStore.nodes || [])\n+}\n+\n+/**\n+ * 是否存在未落库的本地编辑（排序 / 增删 / 改字段 / 采纳 AI 修订）。\n+ * 根因：后端生成链路以「存储版本」的节点为准——\n+ * generation_handler.go:40 GetConfirmed 取库中版本，:49 直接以其 Nodes 覆盖 req.OutlineNodes。\n+ * 前端只写 localStorage 不落库时，本地编辑在内容生成与页面管理阶段被静默丢弃\n+ * （表现为：手动添加的节点传不过去、排序在生成后回弹）。\n+ */\n+const hasUnsavedEdit = computed(() => {\n+  if (!outlineStore.outline_id) return false\n+  return nodesSignature() !== lastPersistedSignature.value\n+})\n+\n+/** 标记当前节点已与后端对齐 */\n+function markPersisted() {\n+  lastPersistedSignature.value = nodesSignature()\n+}\n+\n+/**\n+ * 保存会产出新版本，且后端 SaveOutlineVersion 把新版本状态置为 draft\n+ * （修改已确认大纲时旧版转 superseded，新版需重新确认）。\n+ * 前端不同步 status 会误判「仍已确认」，随后生成请求被 GetConfirmed 以 409 拒绝。\n+ */\n+function syncStatusFromSave(data) {\n+  if (data && data.status) outlineStore.status = data.status\n+}\n+\n+/** 落库保障：把本地编辑提交为后端新版本；无改动则跳过（避免无谓的版本链膨胀） */\n+async function persistIfDirty() {\n+  if (!outlineStore.outline_id || !hasUnsavedEdit.value) return false\n+  savingOutline.value = true\n+  try {\n+    const data = await outlineStore.saveVersion()\n+    syncStatusFromSave(data)\n+    markPersisted()\n+    return true\n+  } finally {\n+    savingOutline.value = false\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+// 自动恢复\n+if (props.autoRestore) {\n+  outlineStore.restore()\n+}\n+// 恢复的节点来自本地缓存，作为对齐基线；否则刚进页面就会误报「有未保存的修改」\n+markPersisted()\n+}\n+\n+// 若无大纲且有 intent，自动创建\n+watch(\n+  () => [outlineStore.outline_id, outlineStore.nodes.length],\n+  ([oid, nc]) => {\n+    if (!oid && nc === 0 && props.intentSummary) {\n+      handleGenerateOutline()\n+    }\n+  },\n+  { immediate: true }\n+)\n+\n+async function handleGenerateOutline() {\n+  if (!props.sessionId) {\n+    emit('error', '缺少 session_id，请先完成 S1 意图理解')\n+    return\n+  }\n+  try {\n+    // 尝试从 localStorage 读取证据包\n+    let evidence = null\n+    try {\n+      const raw = window.localStorage.getItem('fuww_s2_evidence_packet')\n+      if (raw) evidence = JSON.parse(raw)\n+    } catch {}\n+    // 尝试从 localStorage 读取 markdown 内容\n+    let markdown = ''\n+    try {\n+      const m = window.localStorage.getItem('fuww_s2_markdown')\n+      if (m) markdown = m\n+    } catch {}\n+\n+    await outlineStore.createOutline({\n+      session_id: props.sessionId,\n+      intent_id: props.intentId,\n+      intent: props.intentSummary || {},\n+      evidence_packet: evidence,\n+      markdown\n+    })\n+    emit('outline-created', {\n+      outline_id: outlineStore.outline_id,\n+      outline_version: outlineStore.outline_version\n+    })\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    emit('error', err?.message || '创建大纲失败')\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+function handleAddNode() {\n+  const lastNodeId = outlineStore.nodes.at(-1)?.node_id || null\n+  outlineStore.addNode(lastNodeId)\n+}\n+\n+function handleDeleteNode(nodeId) {\n+  if (outlineStore.nodes.length <= 1) {\n+    emit('error', '大纲至少需要一个节点')\n+    return\n+  }\n+  outlineStore.removeNode(nodeId)\n+}\n+\n+function addKeyPoint(node) {\n+  const val = (newKeyPoints.value[node.node_id] || '').trim()\n+  if (!val) return\n+  const kps = [...(node.key_points || []), val]\n+  outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { key_points: kps })\n+  newKeyPoints.value[node.node_id] = ''\n+}\n+\n+function removeKeyPoint(node, index) {\n+  const kps = [...(node.key_points || [])]\n+  kps.splice(index, 1)\n+  outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { key_points: kps })\n+}\n+\n+async function handleSave() {\n+  try {\n+    const data = await outlineStore.saveVersion()\n+    // 后端保存产出新版本并重置为 draft，前端必须同步状态，否则后续生成被 409 拒绝\n+    syncStatusFromSave(data)\n+    markPersisted()\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    emit('error', err?.message || '保存大纲失败')\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+async function handleConfirm() {\n+  try {\n+    // 确认前先落库：确认会冻结该版本，未提交的本地编辑（新增节点 / 排序）将永远进不了生成链路\n+    await persistIfDirty()\n+    await outlineStore.confirmOutline()\n+    markPersisted()\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    emit('error', err?.message || '确认大纲失败')\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+async function handleSendRevise() {\n+  const msg = reviseMessage.value.trim()\n+  if (!msg) return\n+  showReviseInput.value = false\n+  showReviseDialog.value = true\n+  revisingDialogLoading.value = true\n+  try {\n+    await outlineStore.reviseOutline(msg)\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    emit('error', err?.message || 'AI 修订失败')\n+    showReviseDialog.value = false\n+  } finally {\n+    revisingDialogLoading.value = false\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+async function handleApplyRevision() {\n+  outlineStore.applyRevision()\n+  showReviseDialog.value = false\n+  reviseMessage.value = ''\n+  // 采纳后立即落库：后端生成链路只认存储版本（GetConfirmed），\n+  // 不落库则修订结果只存在于 localStorage，大纲页刷新后即与后端分叉（表现为「AI 修订没加上节点」）。\n+  try {\n+    await persistIfDirty()\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    emit('error', err?.message || 'AI 修订落库失败，请点「保存大纲」重试')\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+function handleCancelRevision() {\n+  outlineStore.discardRevision()\n+  showReviseDialog.value = false\n+  reviseMessage.value = ''\n+}\n+</script>\n+\n+<style scoped>\n+.outline-editor {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 12px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 头部 */\n+.outline-header {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  padding: 12px 16px;\n+  background: #f8fbf9;\n+  border: 1px solid #e2ece6;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+}\n+.outline-meta {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 12px;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #607a71;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+.outline-status {\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+  padding: 2px 8px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+.status-draft { background: #f0f5f2; color: #2f605a; }\n+.status-confirming { background: #fff8e6; color: #7c4a15; }\n+.status-confirmed { background: #d1fae5; color: #065f46; }\n+.status-superseded { background: #f3f4f6; color: #6b7280; }\n+.outline-actions {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+\n+/* 错误条 */\n+.error-bar {\n+  padding: 10px 14px;\n+  background: #fef2f2;\n+  border: 1px solid #fecaca;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  color: #dc2626;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 节点列表 */\n+.nodes-list {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+}\n+\n+.outline-node-card {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 12px;\n+  padding: 14px 16px;\n+  background: #fff;\n+  border: 1.5px solid #e2ece6;\n+  border-radius: 14px;\n+  transition: border-color 0.15s;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card:hover {\n+  border-color: #5ca68f;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card.node-type-section {\n+  border-left: 4px solid #2f605a;\n+  background: #f8fbf9;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card.node-type-quiz {\n+  border-left: 4px solid #7c3aed;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card.node-type-interactive {\n+  border-left: 4px solid #ea580c;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card.node-type-summary {\n+  border-left: 4px solid #ca8a04;\n+}\n+\n+/* 序号 */\n+.node-drag-handle {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 4px;\n+  min-width: 28px;\n+}\n+.node-order {\n+  font-size: 16px;\n+  font-weight: 700;\n+  color: #5ca68f;\n+  line-height: 1;\n+}\n+.node-move-btns {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 2px;\n+}\n+.move-btn {\n+  background: none;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 4px;\n+  font-size: 10px;\n+  color: #5ca68f;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  padding: 1px 4px;\n+  line-height: 1;\n+}\n+.move-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.35; cursor: not-allowed; }\n+\n+/* 节点内容 */\n+.node-content {\n+  flex: 1;\n+  min-width: 0;\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+.node-top-row {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+.node-type-select {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 6px;\n+  padding: 3px 6px;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  background: #f0f5f2;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+}\n+.node-type-badge {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  background: #e2ece6;\n+  color: #5ca68f;\n+  padding: 2px 8px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+.node-title-input {\n+  flex: 1;\n+  font-size: 14px;\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+  border: none;\n+  border-bottom: 1.5px solid #c6ded6;\n+  padding: 2px 4px;\n+  outline: none;\n+  color: #1e293b;\n+  background: transparent;\n+  min-width: 0;\n+}\n+.node-title-input:focus { border-bottom-color: #5ca68f; }\n+.node-title { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #1e293b; }\n+.node-summary-input {\n+  width: 100%;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #475569;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  padding: 6px 8px;\n+  resize: vertical;\n+  outline: none;\n+  font-family: inherit;\n+  box-sizing: border-box;\n+  background: #fafcfa;\n+}\n+.node-summary-input:focus { border-color: #5ca68f; }\n+.node-summary { font-size: 12px; color: #475569; margin: 0; line-height: 1.5; }\n+\n+/* 知识点 */\n+.node-key-points {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: flex-start;\n+  gap: 6px;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+.kp-label { font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; white-space: nowrap; line-height: 22px; }\n+.kp-tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; align-items: center; }\n+.kp-tag {\n+  display: inline-flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 4px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  background: #e8f5f0;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  padding: 2px 8px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+.kp-remove {\n+  background: none;\n+  border: none;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  padding: 0;\n+  line-height: 1;\n+  opacity: 0.6;\n+}\n+.kp-remove:hover { opacity: 1; }\n+.kp-add-input {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  border: none;\n+  background: transparent;\n+  outline: none;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  width: 100px;\n+  padding: 2px 4px;\n+}\n+.kp-tag-static {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  background: #e8f5f0;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  padding: 2px 8px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 互动规划 */\n+.node-interactive-plan {\n+  border-top: 1px dashed #c6ded6;\n+  padding-top: 8px;\n+}\n+.plan-toggle {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #5ca68f;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  user-select: none;\n+  list-style: none;\n+}\n+.plan-toggle::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }\n+.plan-fields {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  margin-top: 8px;\n+}\n+.plan-fields label {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 4px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  color: #64748b;\n+}\n+.plan-fields input[type=\"number\"] {\n+  width: 54px;\n+  padding: 2px 5px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 5px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  outline: none;\n+}\n+.plan-fields select {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 5px;\n+  padding: 2px 4px;\n+  outline: none;\n+}\n+.plan-fields input[type=\"checkbox\"] { width: 14px; height: 14px; }\n+\n+/* 底部：时长 & 删除 */\n+.node-footer {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+.duration-label {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 5px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  color: #64748b;\n+}\n+.duration-input {\n+  width: 48px;\n+  padding: 2px 6px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 5px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  text-align: center;\n+  outline: none;\n+}\n+.duration-input:disabled { background: #f8fbf9; }\n+.node-delete-btn {\n+  background: none;\n+  border: none;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  font-size: 14px;\n+  opacity: 0.4;\n+  transition: opacity 0.15s;\n+}\n+.node-delete-btn:hover { opacity: 1; }\n+\n+/* 添加节点 */\n+.add-node-row {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  justify-content: center;\n+  padding: 10px 0;\n+}\n+.add-node-btn {\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+}\n+.btn {\n+  padding: 6px 14px;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  font-weight: 500;\n+  transition: all 0.15s;\n+  border: 1px solid transparent;\n+}\n+.btn-sm { padding: 5px 12px; font-size: 12px; }\n+.btn-outline {\n+  background: #fff;\n+  border-color: #c6ded6;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.btn-outline:hover { background: #f0f5f2; }\n+.btn-primary {\n+  background: #2f605a;\n+  color: #fff;\n+  border-color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.btn-primary:hover:not(:disabled) { background: #1e4a44; }\n+.btn-primary:disabled { opacity: 0.5; cursor: not-allowed; }\n+.btn:disabled { opacity: 0.5; cursor: not-allowed; }\n+\n+/* 修订输入条 */\n+.revise-input-bar {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  padding: 10px 14px;\n+  background: #f0f5f2;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 10px;\n+}\n+.revise-text-input {\n+  flex: 1;\n+  padding: 6px 10px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  outline: none;\n+}\n+.revise-text-input:focus { border-color: #5ca68f; }\n+\n+/* 过渡动画 */\n+.node-list-enter-active,\n+.node-list-leave-active { transition: all 0.25s ease; }\n+.node-list-enter-from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-8px); }\n+.node-list-leave-to { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-8px); }\n+</style>\ndiff --git a/.rivet/backups/1789136912701/frontend/teacher/src/components/teacher/OutlineEditor.vue b/.rivet/backups/1789136912701/frontend/teacher/src/components/teacher/OutlineEditor.vue\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..7da87e3\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/.rivet/backups/1789136912701/frontend/teacher/src/components/teacher/OutlineEditor.vue\n@@ -0,0 +1,865 @@\n+<template>\n+  <div class=\"outline-editor\">\n+    <!-- 大纲头部信息 -->\n+    <div class=\"outline-header\">\n+      <div class=\"outline-meta\">\n+        <span class=\"outline-id\" v-if=\"outlineStore.outline_id\">\n+          大纲 ID：{{ outlineStore.outline_id }}\n+        </span>\n+        <span class=\"outline-version\" v-if=\"outlineStore.outline_version\">\n+          v{{ outlineStore.outline_version }}\n+        </span>\n+        <span class=\"outline-status\" :class=\"`status-${outlineStore.status}`\">\n+          {{ statusLabel }}\n+        </span>\n+        <span class=\"outline-duration\">\n+          ⏱ 总计 {{ outlineStore.totalDuration }} 分钟 · {{ outlineStore.nodeCount }} 个节点\n+        </span>\n+      </div>\n+      <div class=\"outline-actions\">\n+        <button\n+          v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-sm\"\n+          :disabled=\"outlineStore.reviseLoading\"\n+          @click=\"showReviseInput = true\"\n+          title=\"发送指令让 AI 修改大纲\"\n+        >\n+          {{ outlineStore.reviseLoading ? 'AI 修订中...' : '🤖 AI 修订' }}\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-sm\"\n+          :disabled=\"outlineStore.loading\"\n+          @click=\"handleSave\"\n+        >\n+          保存大纲\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          v-if=\"outlineStore.isConfirmed\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\"\n+          @click=\"$emit('confirm-complete')\"\n+        >\n+          进入内容生成 →\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          v-else-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit && outlineStore.nodeCount > 0\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\"\n+          :disabled=\"outlineStore.loading\"\n+          @click=\"handleConfirm\"\n+        >\n+          {{ outlineStore.loading ? '确认中...' : '确认大纲' }}\n+        </button>\n+      </div>\n+    </div>\n+\n+    <!-- 错误提示 -->\n+    <div v-if=\"outlineStore.error || outlineStore.confirmError\" class=\"error-bar\" role=\"alert\">\n+      {{ outlineStore.confirmError || outlineStore.error }}\n+    </div>\n+\n+    <!-- 节点编辑器 -->\n+    <div class=\"nodes-list\">\n+      <TransitionGroup name=\"node-list\">\n+        <div\n+          v-for=\"(node, idx) in outlineStore.nodes\"\n+          :key=\"node.node_id\"\n+          class=\"outline-node-card\"\n+          :class=\"`node-type-${node.node_type}`\"\n+        >\n+          <!-- 节点序号 & 移动按钮 -->\n+          <div class=\"node-drag-handle\">\n+            <span class=\"node-order\">{{ idx + 1 }}</span>\n+            <div class=\"node-move-btns\" v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\">\n+              <button\n+                class=\"move-btn\"\n+                :disabled=\"idx === 0\"\n+                @click=\"outlineStore.moveNode(node.node_id, 'up')\"\n+                title=\"上移\"\n+              >↑</button>\n+              <button\n+                class=\"move-btn\"\n+                :disabled=\"idx === outlineStore.nodes.length - 1\"\n+                @click=\"outlineStore.moveNode(node.node_id, 'down')\"\n+                title=\"下移\"\n+              >↓</button>\n+            </div>\n+          </div>\n+\n+          <!-- 节点内容 -->\n+          <div class=\"node-content\">\n+            <div class=\"node-top-row\">\n+              <!-- 节点类型选择 -->\n+              <select\n+                v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+                v-model=\"node.node_type\"\n+                class=\"node-type-select\"\n+                @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { node_type: node.node_type })\"\n+              >\n+                <option value=\"content\">📖 知识讲解</option>\n+                <option value=\"section\">📂 章节标题</option>\n+                <option value=\"quiz\">❓ 随堂测验</option>\n+                <option value=\"interactive\">🎮 互动环节</option>\n+                <option value=\"summary\">📋 总结回顾</option>\n+              </select>\n+              <span v-else class=\"node-type-badge\">{{ node.node_type }}</span>\n+\n+              <!-- 标题 -->\n+              <input\n+                v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+                v-model=\"node.title\"\n+                class=\"node-title-input\"\n+                placeholder=\"节点标题\"\n+                @input=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { title: node.title })\"\n+              />\n+              <div v-else class=\"node-title\">{{ node.title }}</div>\n+            </div>\n+\n+            <!-- 摘要 -->\n+            <textarea\n+              v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+              v-model=\"node.summary\"\n+              class=\"node-summary-input\"\n+              placeholder=\"节点摘要（简述本节点教学内容）\"\n+              rows=\"2\"\n+              @input=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { summary: node.summary })\"\n+            ></textarea>\n+            <p v-else class=\"node-summary\">{{ node.summary }}</p>\n+\n+            <!-- 核心知识点标签 -->\n+            <div class=\"node-key-points\">\n+              <span class=\"kp-label\">核心知识点：</span>\n+              <template v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\">\n+                <div class=\"kp-tags\">\n+                  <span\n+                    v-for=\"(kp, ki) in node.key_points\"\n+                    :key=\"ki\"\n+                    class=\"kp-tag\"\n+                  >\n+                    {{ kp }}\n+                    <button class=\"kp-remove\" @click=\"removeKeyPoint(node, ki)\">×</button>\n+                  </span>\n+                  <input\n+                    v-model=\"newKeyPoints[node.node_id]\"\n+                    class=\"kp-add-input\"\n+                    placeholder=\"+ 添加知识点\"\n+                    @keyup.enter=\"addKeyPoint(node)\"\n+                  />\n+                </div>\n+              </template>\n+              <template v-else>\n+                <span v-for=\"(kp, ki) in node.key_points\" :key=\"ki\" class=\"kp-tag-static\">\n+                  {{ kp }}\n+                </span>\n+              </template>\n+            </div>\n+\n+            <!-- 互动规划（仅 interactive / quiz 类型且有 plan 时显示）\n+                 注意：必须判 interactive_plan 非空——后端/LLM 产出的交互节点该字段常为 null，\n+                 直接访问 interactive_plan.x 会抛错并中断整个节点列表渲染。 -->\n+            <div\n+              v-if=\"(node.node_type === 'interactive' || node.node_type === 'quiz') && node.interactive_plan && outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+              class=\"node-interactive-plan\"\n+            >\n+              <details>\n+                <summary class=\"plan-toggle\">🎯 互动规划</summary>\n+                <div class=\"plan-fields\">\n+                  <label>\n+                    时长（分钟）\n+                    <input\n+                      type=\"number\"\n+                      v-model.number=\"node.interactive_plan.duration_minutes\"\n+                      min=\"1\"\n+                      max=\"60\"\n+                      @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { interactive_plan: { ...node.interactive_plan } })\"\n+                    />\n+                  </label>\n+                  <label>\n+                    题目数量\n+                    <input\n+                      type=\"number\"\n+                      v-model.number=\"node.interactive_plan.question_count\"\n+                      min=\"1\"\n+                      max=\"20\"\n+                      @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { interactive_plan: { ...node.interactive_plan } })\"\n+                    />\n+                  </label>\n+                  <label>\n+                    自动判分\n+                    <input\n+                      type=\"checkbox\"\n+                      v-model=\"node.interactive_plan.auto_grading\"\n+                      @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { interactive_plan: { ...node.interactive_plan } })\"\n+                    />\n+                  </label>\n+                  <label>\n+                    产出方式\n+                    <select v-model=\"node.interactive_plan.delivery\">\n+                      <option value=\"html5_link\">HTML5 链接</option>\n+                      <option value=\"ppt_native\">PPT 内嵌</option>\n+                      <option value=\"standalone_html\">独立 HTML</option>\n+                    </select>\n+                  </label>\n+                </div>\n+              </details>\n+            </div>\n+\n+            <!-- 时长 -->\n+            <div class=\"node-footer\">\n+              <label class=\"duration-label\">\n+                时长\n+                <input\n+                  type=\"number\"\n+                  v-model.number=\"node.estimated_duration_minutes\"\n+                  min=\"1\"\n+                  max=\"180\"\n+                  :disabled=\"!outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+                  class=\"duration-input\"\n+                  @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { estimated_duration_minutes: node.estimated_duration_minutes })\"\n+                />\n+                分钟\n+              </label>\n+\n+              <!-- 删除按钮 -->\n+              <button\n+                v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+                class=\"node-delete-btn\"\n+                @click=\"handleDeleteNode(node.node_id)\"\n+                title=\"删除节点\"\n+              >🗑</button>\n+            </div>\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+      </TransitionGroup>\n+\n+      <!-- 添加节点按钮 -->\n+      <div v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\" class=\"add-node-row\">\n+        <button class=\"btn btn-outline add-node-btn\" @click=\"handleAddNode\">\n+          ＋ 添加节点\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          v-if=\"outlineStore.nodes.length === 0\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-primary\"\n+          @click=\"handleGenerateOutline\"\n+          :disabled=\"outlineStore.loading\"\n+        >\n+          {{ outlineStore.loading ? 'AI 生成中...' : '🤖 AI 生成大纲' }}\n+        </button>\n+      </div>\n+    </div>\n+\n+    <!-- AI 修订对话框 -->\n+    <OutlineRevisionDialog\n+      :visible=\"showReviseDialog\"\n+      :loading=\"revisingDialogLoading\"\n+      :change-summary=\"outlineStore.changeSummary\"\n+      :pending-nodes=\"outlineStore.pendingRevision?.nodes || []\"\n+      @apply=\"handleApplyRevision\"\n+      @cancel=\"handleCancelRevision\"\n+    />\n+\n+    <!-- AI 修订输入弹窗 -->\n+    <div v-if=\"showReviseDialog\" class=\"dialog-overlay\" style=\"display:none\"><!-- 利用 OutlineRevisionDialog --></div>\n+\n+    <!-- 修订指令输入（集成在 OutlineRevisionDialog 之前） -->\n+    <div v-if=\"showReviseInput\" class=\"revise-input-bar\">\n+      <input\n+        v-model=\"reviseMessage\"\n+        class=\"revise-text-input\"\n+        placeholder=\"例如：增加一个生活案例，把课堂练习放到快速排序之后\"\n+        @keyup.enter=\"handleSendRevise\"\n+        autofocus\n+      />\n+      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" @click=\"handleSendRevise\" :disabled=\"!reviseMessage.trim()\">\n+        发送修订\n+      </button>\n+      <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" @click=\"showReviseInput = false\">取消</button>\n+    </div>\n+  </div>\n+</template>\n+\n+<script setup>\n+import { ref, computed, watch } from 'vue'\n+import { useOutlineStore } from '../../stores/outlineStore'\n+import OutlineRevisionDialog from './OutlineRevisionDialog.vue'\n+\n+const props = defineProps({\n+  /** 所属 session_id（从 S1 透传） */\n+  sessionId: { type: String, default: '' },\n+  /** 所属 intent_id（从 S1 透传） */\n+  intentId: { type: String, default: '' },\n+  /** 教学意图摘要（用于创建大纲） */\n+  intentSummary: { type: Object, default: null },\n+  /** 是否自动尝试从 localStorage 恢复大纲 */\n+  autoRestore: { type: Boolean, default: true }\n+})\n+\n+const emit = defineEmits(['confirm-complete', 'outline-created', 'error'])\n+\n+const outlineStore = useOutlineStore()\n+\n+const showReviseDialog = ref(false)\n+const showReviseInput = ref(false)\n+const reviseMessage = ref('')\n+const revisingDialogLoading = ref(false) // 对话框内 AI 正在生成修订\n+const newKeyPoints = ref({}) // { [node_id]: input value }\n+\n+const statusLabel = computed(() => ({\n+  draft: '草稿',\n+  confirming: '确认中',\n+  confirmed: '已确认',\n+  superseded: '已替代'\n+}[outlineStore.status] || outlineStore.status))\n+\n+// 自动恢复\n+// 最近一次与后端对齐（创建 / 保存 / 确认）时的节点快照签名\n+const lastPersistedSignature = ref('')\n+const savingOutline = ref(false)\n+\n+/** 节点快照签名——用于判断是否存在未落库的本地编辑 */\n+function nodesSignature() {\n+  return JSON.stringify(outlineStore.nodes || [])\n+}\n+\n+/**\n+ * 是否存在未落库的本地编辑（排序 / 增删 / 改字段 / 采纳 AI 修订）。\n+ * 根因：后端生成链路以「存储版本」的节点为准——\n+ * generation_handler.go:40 GetConfirmed 取库中版本，:49 直接以其 Nodes 覆盖 req.OutlineNodes。\n+ * 前端只写 localStorage 不落库时，本地编辑在内容生成与页面管理阶段被静默丢弃\n+ * （表现为：手动添加的节点传不过去、排序在生成后回弹）。\n+ */\n+const hasUnsavedEdit = computed(() => {\n+  if (!outlineStore.outline_id) return false\n+  return nodesSignature() !== lastPersistedSignature.value\n+})\n+\n+/** 标记当前节点已与后端对齐 */\n+function markPersisted() {\n+  lastPersistedSignature.value = nodesSignature()\n+}\n+\n+/**\n+ * 保存会产出新版本，且后端 SaveOutlineVersion 把新版本状态置为 draft\n+ * （修改已确认大纲时旧版转 superseded，新版需重新确认）。\n+ * 前端不同步 status 会误判「仍已确认」，随后生成请求被 GetConfirmed 以 409 拒绝。\n+ */\n+function syncStatusFromSave(data) {\n+  if (data && data.status) outlineStore.status = data.status\n+}\n+\n+/** 落库保障：把本地编辑提交为后端新版本；无改动则跳过（避免无谓的版本链膨胀） */\n+async function persistIfDirty() {\n+  if (!outlineStore.outline_id || !hasUnsavedEdit.value) return false\n+  savingOutline.value = true\n+  try {\n+    const data = await outlineStore.saveVersion()\n+    syncStatusFromSave(data)\n+    markPersisted()\n+    return true\n+  } finally {\n+    savingOutline.value = false\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+// 自动恢复\n+if (props.autoRestore) {\n+  outlineStore.restore()\n+}\n+// 恢复的节点来自本地缓存，作为对齐基线；否则刚进页面就会误报「有未保存的修改」\n+markPersisted()\n+}\n+\n+// 若无大纲且有 intent，自动创建\n+watch(\n+  () => [outlineStore.outline_id, outlineStore.nodes.length],\n+  ([oid, nc]) => {\n+    if (!oid && nc === 0 && props.intentSummary) {\n+      handleGenerateOutline()\n+    }\n+  },\n+  { immediate: true }\n+)\n+\n+async function handleGenerateOutline() {\n+  if (!props.sessionId) {\n+    emit('error', '缺少 session_id，请先完成 S1 意图理解')\n+    return\n+  }\n+  try {\n+    // 尝试从 localStorage 读取证据包\n+    let evidence = null\n+    try {\n+      const raw = window.localStorage.getItem('fuww_s2_evidence_packet')\n+      if (raw) evidence = JSON.parse(raw)\n+    } catch {}\n+    // 尝试从 localStorage 读取 markdown 内容\n+    let markdown = ''\n+    try {\n+      const m = window.localStorage.getItem('fuww_s2_markdown')\n+      if (m) markdown = m\n+    } catch {}\n+\n+    await outlineStore.createOutline({\n+      session_id: props.sessionId,\n+      intent_id: props.intentId,\n+      intent: props.intentSummary || {},\n+      evidence_packet: evidence,\n+      markdown\n+    })\n+    // 创建已落库（createOutline → POST /outlines），作为后续「未保存」判定的对齐基线\n+    markPersisted()\n+    emit('outline-created', {\n+      outline_id: outlineStore.outline_id,\n+      outline_version: outlineStore.outline_version\n+    })\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    emit('error', err?.message || '创建大纲失败')\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+function handleAddNode() {\n+  const lastNodeId = outlineStore.nodes.at(-1)?.node_id || null\n+  outlineStore.addNode(lastNodeId)\n+}\n+\n+function handleDeleteNode(nodeId) {\n+  if (outlineStore.nodes.length <= 1) {\n+    emit('error', '大纲至少需要一个节点')\n+    return\n+  }\n+  outlineStore.removeNode(nodeId)\n+}\n+\n+function addKeyPoint(node) {\n+  const val = (newKeyPoints.value[node.node_id] || '').trim()\n+  if (!val) return\n+  const kps = [...(node.key_points || []), val]\n+  outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { key_points: kps })\n+  newKeyPoints.value[node.node_id] = ''\n+}\n+\n+function removeKeyPoint(node, index) {\n+  const kps = [...(node.key_points || [])]\n+  kps.splice(index, 1)\n+  outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { key_points: kps })\n+}\n+\n+async function handleSave() {\n+  try {\n+    const data = await outlineStore.saveVersion()\n+    // 后端保存产出新版本并重置为 draft，前端必须同步状态，否则后续生成被 409 拒绝\n+    syncStatusFromSave(data)\n+    markPersisted()\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    emit('error', err?.message || '保存大纲失败')\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+async function handleConfirm() {\n+  try {\n+    // 确认前先落库：确认会冻结该版本，未提交的本地编辑（新增节点 / 排序）将永远进不了生成链路\n+    await persistIfDirty()\n+    await outlineStore.confirmOutline()\n+    markPersisted()\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    emit('error', err?.message || '确认大纲失败')\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+async function handleSendRevise() {\n+  const msg = reviseMessage.value.trim()\n+  if (!msg) return\n+  showReviseInput.value = false\n+  showReviseDialog.value = true\n+  revisingDialogLoading.value = true\n+  try {\n+    await outlineStore.reviseOutline(msg)\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    emit('error', err?.message || 'AI 修订失败')\n+    showReviseDialog.value = false\n+  } finally {\n+    revisingDialogLoading.value = false\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+async function handleApplyRevision() {\n+  outlineStore.applyRevision()\n+  showReviseDialog.value = false\n+  reviseMessage.value = ''\n+  // 采纳后立即落库：后端生成链路只认存储版本（GetConfirmed），\n+  // 不落库则修订结果只存在于 localStorage，大纲页刷新后即与后端分叉（表现为「AI 修订没加上节点」）。\n+  try {\n+    await persistIfDirty()\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    emit('error', err?.message || 'AI 修订落库失败，请点「保存大纲」重试')\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+function handleCancelRevision() {\n+  outlineStore.discardRevision()\n+  showReviseDialog.value = false\n+  reviseMessage.value = ''\n+}\n+</script>\n+\n+<style scoped>\n+.outline-editor {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 12px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 头部 */\n+.outline-header {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  padding: 12px 16px;\n+  background: #f8fbf9;\n+  border: 1px solid #e2ece6;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+}\n+.outline-meta {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 12px;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #607a71;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+.outline-status {\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+  padding: 2px 8px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+.status-draft { background: #f0f5f2; color: #2f605a; }\n+.status-confirming { background: #fff8e6; color: #7c4a15; }\n+.status-confirmed { background: #d1fae5; color: #065f46; }\n+.status-superseded { background: #f3f4f6; color: #6b7280; }\n+.outline-actions {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+\n+/* 错误条 */\n+.error-bar {\n+  padding: 10px 14px;\n+  background: #fef2f2;\n+  border: 1px solid #fecaca;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  color: #dc2626;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 节点列表 */\n+.nodes-list {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+}\n+\n+.outline-node-card {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 12px;\n+  padding: 14px 16px;\n+  background: #fff;\n+  border: 1.5px solid #e2ece6;\n+  border-radius: 14px;\n+  transition: border-color 0.15s;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card:hover {\n+  border-color: #5ca68f;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card.node-type-section {\n+  border-left: 4px solid #2f605a;\n+  background: #f8fbf9;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card.node-type-quiz {\n+  border-left: 4px solid #7c3aed;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card.node-type-interactive {\n+  border-left: 4px solid #ea580c;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card.node-type-summary {\n+  border-left: 4px solid #ca8a04;\n+}\n+\n+/* 序号 */\n+.node-drag-handle {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 4px;\n+  min-width: 28px;\n+}\n+.node-order {\n+  font-size: 16px;\n+  font-weight: 700;\n+  color: #5ca68f;\n+  line-height: 1;\n+}\n+.node-move-btns {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 2px;\n+}\n+.move-btn {\n+  background: none;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 4px;\n+  font-size: 10px;\n+  color: #5ca68f;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  padding: 1px 4px;\n+  line-height: 1;\n+}\n+.move-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.35; cursor: not-allowed; }\n+\n+/* 节点内容 */\n+.node-content {\n+  flex: 1;\n+  min-width: 0;\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+.node-top-row {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+.node-type-select {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 6px;\n+  padding: 3px 6px;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  background: #f0f5f2;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+}\n+.node-type-badge {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  background: #e2ece6;\n+  color: #5ca68f;\n+  padding: 2px 8px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+.node-title-input {\n+  flex: 1;\n+  font-size: 14px;\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+  border: none;\n+  border-bottom: 1.5px solid #c6ded6;\n+  padding: 2px 4px;\n+  outline: none;\n+  color: #1e293b;\n+  background: transparent;\n+  min-width: 0;\n+}\n+.node-title-input:focus { border-bottom-color: #5ca68f; }\n+.node-title { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #1e293b; }\n+.node-summary-input {\n+  width: 100%;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #475569;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  padding: 6px 8px;\n+  resize: vertical;\n+  outline: none;\n+  font-family: inherit;\n+  box-sizing: border-box;\n+  background: #fafcfa;\n+}\n+.node-summary-input:focus { border-color: #5ca68f; }\n+.node-summary { font-size: 12px; color: #475569; margin: 0; line-height: 1.5; }\n+\n+/* 知识点 */\n+.node-key-points {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: flex-start;\n+  gap: 6px;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+.kp-label { font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; white-space: nowrap; line-height: 22px; }\n+.kp-tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; align-items: center; }\n+.kp-tag {\n+  display: inline-flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 4px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  background: #e8f5f0;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  padding: 2px 8px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+.kp-remove {\n+  background: none;\n+  border: none;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  padding: 0;\n+  line-height: 1;\n+  opacity: 0.6;\n+}\n+.kp-remove:hover { opacity: 1; }\n+.kp-add-input {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  border: none;\n+  background: transparent;\n+  outline: none;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  width: 100px;\n+  padding: 2px 4px;\n+}\n+.kp-tag-static {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  background: #e8f5f0;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  padding: 2px 8px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 互动规划 */\n+.node-interactive-plan {\n+  border-top: 1px dashed #c6ded6;\n+  padding-top: 8px;\n+}\n+.plan-toggle {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #5ca68f;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  user-select: none;\n+  list-style: none;\n+}\n+.plan-toggle::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }\n+.plan-fields {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  margin-top: 8px;\n+}\n+.plan-fields label {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 4px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  color: #64748b;\n+}\n+.plan-fields input[type=\"number\"] {\n+  width: 54px;\n+  padding: 2px 5px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 5px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  outline: none;\n+}\n+.plan-fields select {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 5px;\n+  padding: 2px 4px;\n+  outline: none;\n+}\n+.plan-fields input[type=\"checkbox\"] { width: 14px; height: 14px; }\n+\n+/* 底部：时长 & 删除 */\n+.node-footer {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+.duration-label {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 5px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  color: #64748b;\n+}\n+.duration-input {\n+  width: 48px;\n+  padding: 2px 6px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 5px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  text-align: center;\n+  outline: none;\n+}\n+.duration-input:disabled { background: #f8fbf9; }\n+.node-delete-btn {\n+  background: none;\n+  border: none;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  font-size: 14px;\n+  opacity: 0.4;\n+  transition: opacity 0.15s;\n+}\n+.node-delete-btn:hover { opacity: 1; }\n+\n+/* 添加节点 */\n+.add-node-row {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  justify-content: center;\n+  padding: 10px 0;\n+}\n+.add-node-btn {\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+}\n+.btn {\n+  padding: 6px 14px;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  font-weight: 500;\n+  transition: all 0.15s;\n+  border: 1px solid transparent;\n+}\n+.btn-sm { padding: 5px 12px; font-size: 12px; }\n+.btn-outline {\n+  background: #fff;\n+  border-color: #c6ded6;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.btn-outline:hover { background: #f0f5f2; }\n+.btn-primary {\n+  background: #2f605a;\n+  color: #fff;\n+  border-color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.btn-primary:hover:not(:disabled) { background: #1e4a44; }\n+.btn-primary:disabled { opacity: 0.5; cursor: not-allowed; }\n+.btn:disabled { opacity: 0.5; cursor: not-allowed; }\n+\n+/* 修订输入条 */\n+.revise-input-bar {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  padding: 10px 14px;\n+  background: #f0f5f2;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 10px;\n+}\n+.revise-text-input {\n+  flex: 1;\n+  padding: 6px 10px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  outline: none;\n+}\n+.revise-text-input:focus { border-color: #5ca68f; }\n+\n+/* 过渡动画 */\n+.node-list-enter-active,\n+.node-list-leave-active { transition: all 0.25s ease; }\n+.node-list-enter-from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-8px); }\n+.node-list-leave-to { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-8px); }\n+</style>\ndiff --git a/.rivet/backups/1789136930097/frontend/teacher/src/components/teacher/OutlineEditor.vue b/.rivet/backups/1789136930097/frontend/teacher/src/components/teacher/OutlineEditor.vue\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..07d54fa\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/.rivet/backups/1789136930097/frontend/teacher/src/components/teacher/OutlineEditor.vue\n@@ -0,0 +1,877 @@\n+<template>\n+  <div class=\"outline-editor\">\n+    <!-- 大纲头部信息 -->\n+    <div class=\"outline-header\">\n+      <div class=\"outline-meta\">\n+        <span class=\"outline-id\" v-if=\"outlineStore.outline_id\">\n+          大纲 ID：{{ outlineStore.outline_id }}\n+        </span>\n+        <span class=\"outline-version\" v-if=\"outlineStore.outline_version\">\n+          v{{ outlineStore.outline_version }}\n+        </span>\n+        <span class=\"outline-status\" :class=\"`status-${outlineStore.status}`\">\n+          {{ statusLabel }}\n+        </span>\n+        <span class=\"outline-duration\">\n+          ⏱ 总计 {{ outlineStore.totalDuration }} 分钟 · {{ outlineStore.nodeCount }} 个节点\n+        </span>\n+      </div>\n+      <div class=\"outline-actions\">\n+        <button\n+          v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-sm\"\n+          :disabled=\"outlineStore.reviseLoading\"\n+          @click=\"showReviseInput = true\"\n+          title=\"发送指令让 AI 修改大纲\"\n+        >\n+          {{ outlineStore.reviseLoading ? 'AI 修订中...' : '🤖 AI 修订' }}\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-sm\"\n+          :disabled=\"outlineStore.loading\"\n+          @click=\"handleSave\"\n+        >\n+          保存大纲\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          v-if=\"outlineStore.isConfirmed\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\"\n+          @click=\"$emit('confirm-complete')\"\n+        >\n+          进入内容生成 →\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          v-else-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit && outlineStore.nodeCount > 0\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\"\n+          :disabled=\"outlineStore.loading\"\n+          @click=\"handleConfirm\"\n+        >\n+          {{ outlineStore.loading ? '确认中...' : '确认大纲' }}\n+        </button>\n+      </div>\n+    </div>\n+\n+    <!-- 错误提示 -->\n+    <div v-if=\"outlineStore.error || outlineStore.confirmError\" class=\"error-bar\" role=\"alert\">\n+      {{ outlineStore.confirmError || outlineStore.error }}\n+    </div>\n+\n+    <!-- 未落库提示：内容生成与页面管理读取的是后端存储版本，本地编辑不落库会丢失 -->\n+    <div v-if=\"hasUnsavedEdit\" class=\"unsaved-bar\" role=\"status\">\n+      <span>\n+        有未保存的修改（节点 / 排序 / 知识点）。确认大纲时会自动保存，确保这些改动能进入内容生成与页面管理。\n+      </span>\n+      <button\n+        class=\"btn btn-sm\"\n+        :disabled=\"outlineStore.loading || savingOutline\"\n+        @click=\"handleSave\"\n+      >{{ savingOutline ? '保存中...' : '立即保存' }}</button>\n+    </div>\n+\n+    <!-- 节点编辑器 -->\n+    <div class=\"nodes-list\">\n+      <TransitionGroup name=\"node-list\">\n+        <div\n+          v-for=\"(node, idx) in outlineStore.nodes\"\n+          :key=\"node.node_id\"\n+          class=\"outline-node-card\"\n+          :class=\"`node-type-${node.node_type}`\"\n+        >\n+          <!-- 节点序号 & 移动按钮 -->\n+          <div class=\"node-drag-handle\">\n+            <span class=\"node-order\">{{ idx + 1 }}</span>\n+            <div class=\"node-move-btns\" v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\">\n+              <button\n+                class=\"move-btn\"\n+                :disabled=\"idx === 0\"\n+                @click=\"outlineStore.moveNode(node.node_id, 'up')\"\n+                title=\"上移\"\n+              >↑</button>\n+              <button\n+                class=\"move-btn\"\n+                :disabled=\"idx === outlineStore.nodes.length - 1\"\n+                @click=\"outlineStore.moveNode(node.node_id, 'down')\"\n+                title=\"下移\"\n+              >↓</button>\n+            </div>\n+          </div>\n+\n+          <!-- 节点内容 -->\n+          <div class=\"node-content\">\n+            <div class=\"node-top-row\">\n+              <!-- 节点类型选择 -->\n+              <select\n+                v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+                v-model=\"node.node_type\"\n+                class=\"node-type-select\"\n+                @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { node_type: node.node_type })\"\n+              >\n+                <option value=\"content\">📖 知识讲解</option>\n+                <option value=\"section\">📂 章节标题</option>\n+                <option value=\"quiz\">❓ 随堂测验</option>\n+                <option value=\"interactive\">🎮 互动环节</option>\n+                <option value=\"summary\">📋 总结回顾</option>\n+              </select>\n+              <span v-else class=\"node-type-badge\">{{ node.node_type }}</span>\n+\n+              <!-- 标题 -->\n+              <input\n+                v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+                v-model=\"node.title\"\n+                class=\"node-title-input\"\n+                placeholder=\"节点标题\"\n+                @input=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { title: node.title })\"\n+              />\n+              <div v-else class=\"node-title\">{{ node.title }}</div>\n+            </div>\n+\n+            <!-- 摘要 -->\n+            <textarea\n+              v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+              v-model=\"node.summary\"\n+              class=\"node-summary-input\"\n+              placeholder=\"节点摘要（简述本节点教学内容）\"\n+              rows=\"2\"\n+              @input=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { summary: node.summary })\"\n+            ></textarea>\n+            <p v-else class=\"node-summary\">{{ node.summary }}</p>\n+\n+            <!-- 核心知识点标签 -->\n+            <div class=\"node-key-points\">\n+              <span class=\"kp-label\">核心知识点：</span>\n+              <template v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\">\n+                <div class=\"kp-tags\">\n+                  <span\n+                    v-for=\"(kp, ki) in node.key_points\"\n+                    :key=\"ki\"\n+                    class=\"kp-tag\"\n+                  >\n+                    {{ kp }}\n+                    <button class=\"kp-remove\" @click=\"removeKeyPoint(node, ki)\">×</button>\n+                  </span>\n+                  <input\n+                    v-model=\"newKeyPoints[node.node_id]\"\n+                    class=\"kp-add-input\"\n+                    placeholder=\"+ 添加知识点\"\n+                    @keyup.enter=\"addKeyPoint(node)\"\n+                  />\n+                </div>\n+              </template>\n+              <template v-else>\n+                <span v-for=\"(kp, ki) in node.key_points\" :key=\"ki\" class=\"kp-tag-static\">\n+                  {{ kp }}\n+                </span>\n+              </template>\n+            </div>\n+\n+            <!-- 互动规划（仅 interactive / quiz 类型且有 plan 时显示）\n+                 注意：必须判 interactive_plan 非空——后端/LLM 产出的交互节点该字段常为 null，\n+                 直接访问 interactive_plan.x 会抛错并中断整个节点列表渲染。 -->\n+            <div\n+              v-if=\"(node.node_type === 'interactive' || node.node_type === 'quiz') && node.interactive_plan && outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+              class=\"node-interactive-plan\"\n+            >\n+              <details>\n+                <summary class=\"plan-toggle\">🎯 互动规划</summary>\n+                <div class=\"plan-fields\">\n+                  <label>\n+                    时长（分钟）\n+                    <input\n+                      type=\"number\"\n+                      v-model.number=\"node.interactive_plan.duration_minutes\"\n+                      min=\"1\"\n+                      max=\"60\"\n+                      @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { interactive_plan: { ...node.interactive_plan } })\"\n+                    />\n+                  </label>\n+                  <label>\n+                    题目数量\n+                    <input\n+                      type=\"number\"\n+                      v-model.number=\"node.interactive_plan.question_count\"\n+                      min=\"1\"\n+                      max=\"20\"\n+                      @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { interactive_plan: { ...node.interactive_plan } })\"\n+                    />\n+                  </label>\n+                  <label>\n+                    自动判分\n+                    <input\n+                      type=\"checkbox\"\n+                      v-model=\"node.interactive_plan.auto_grading\"\n+                      @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { interactive_plan: { ...node.interactive_plan } })\"\n+                    />\n+                  </label>\n+                  <label>\n+                    产出方式\n+                    <select v-model=\"node.interactive_plan.delivery\">\n+                      <option value=\"html5_link\">HTML5 链接</option>\n+                      <option value=\"ppt_native\">PPT 内嵌</option>\n+                      <option value=\"standalone_html\">独立 HTML</option>\n+                    </select>\n+                  </label>\n+                </div>\n+              </details>\n+            </div>\n+\n+            <!-- 时长 -->\n+            <div class=\"node-footer\">\n+              <label class=\"duration-label\">\n+                时长\n+                <input\n+                  type=\"number\"\n+                  v-model.number=\"node.estimated_duration_minutes\"\n+                  min=\"1\"\n+                  max=\"180\"\n+                  :disabled=\"!outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+                  class=\"duration-input\"\n+                  @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { estimated_duration_minutes: node.estimated_duration_minutes })\"\n+                />\n+                分钟\n+              </label>\n+\n+              <!-- 删除按钮 -->\n+              <button\n+                v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+                class=\"node-delete-btn\"\n+                @click=\"handleDeleteNode(node.node_id)\"\n+                title=\"删除节点\"\n+              >🗑</button>\n+            </div>\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+      </TransitionGroup>\n+\n+      <!-- 添加节点按钮 -->\n+      <div v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\" class=\"add-node-row\">\n+        <button class=\"btn btn-outline add-node-btn\" @click=\"handleAddNode\">\n+          ＋ 添加节点\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          v-if=\"outlineStore.nodes.length === 0\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-primary\"\n+          @click=\"handleGenerateOutline\"\n+          :disabled=\"outlineStore.loading\"\n+        >\n+          {{ outlineStore.loading ? 'AI 生成中...' : '🤖 AI 生成大纲' }}\n+        </button>\n+      </div>\n+    </div>\n+\n+    <!-- AI 修订对话框 -->\n+    <OutlineRevisionDialog\n+      :visible=\"showReviseDialog\"\n+      :loading=\"revisingDialogLoading\"\n+      :change-summary=\"outlineStore.changeSummary\"\n+      :pending-nodes=\"outlineStore.pendingRevision?.nodes || []\"\n+      @apply=\"handleApplyRevision\"\n+      @cancel=\"handleCancelRevision\"\n+    />\n+\n+    <!-- AI 修订输入弹窗 -->\n+    <div v-if=\"showReviseDialog\" class=\"dialog-overlay\" style=\"display:none\"><!-- 利用 OutlineRevisionDialog --></div>\n+\n+    <!-- 修订指令输入（集成在 OutlineRevisionDialog 之前） -->\n+    <div v-if=\"showReviseInput\" class=\"revise-input-bar\">\n+      <input\n+        v-model=\"reviseMessage\"\n+        class=\"revise-text-input\"\n+        placeholder=\"例如：增加一个生活案例，把课堂练习放到快速排序之后\"\n+        @keyup.enter=\"handleSendRevise\"\n+        autofocus\n+      />\n+      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" @click=\"handleSendRevise\" :disabled=\"!reviseMessage.trim()\">\n+        发送修订\n+      </button>\n+      <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" @click=\"showReviseInput = false\">取消</button>\n+    </div>\n+  </div>\n+</template>\n+\n+<script setup>\n+import { ref, computed, watch } from 'vue'\n+import { useOutlineStore } from '../../stores/outlineStore'\n+import OutlineRevisionDialog from './OutlineRevisionDialog.vue'\n+\n+const props = defineProps({\n+  /** 所属 session_id（从 S1 透传） */\n+  sessionId: { type: String, default: '' },\n+  /** 所属 intent_id（从 S1 透传） */\n+  intentId: { type: String, default: '' },\n+  /** 教学意图摘要（用于创建大纲） */\n+  intentSummary: { type: Object, default: null },\n+  /** 是否自动尝试从 localStorage 恢复大纲 */\n+  autoRestore: { type: Boolean, default: true }\n+})\n+\n+const emit = defineEmits(['confirm-complete', 'outline-created', 'error'])\n+\n+const outlineStore = useOutlineStore()\n+\n+const showReviseDialog = ref(false)\n+const showReviseInput = ref(false)\n+const reviseMessage = ref('')\n+const revisingDialogLoading = ref(false) // 对话框内 AI 正在生成修订\n+const newKeyPoints = ref({}) // { [node_id]: input value }\n+\n+const statusLabel = computed(() => ({\n+  draft: '草稿',\n+  confirming: '确认中',\n+  confirmed: '已确认',\n+  superseded: '已替代'\n+}[outlineStore.status] || outlineStore.status))\n+\n+// 自动恢复\n+// 最近一次与后端对齐（创建 / 保存 / 确认）时的节点快照签名\n+const lastPersistedSignature = ref('')\n+const savingOutline = ref(false)\n+\n+/** 节点快照签名——用于判断是否存在未落库的本地编辑 */\n+function nodesSignature() {\n+  return JSON.stringify(outlineStore.nodes || [])\n+}\n+\n+/**\n+ * 是否存在未落库的本地编辑（排序 / 增删 / 改字段 / 采纳 AI 修订）。\n+ * 根因：后端生成链路以「存储版本」的节点为准——\n+ * generation_handler.go:40 GetConfirmed 取库中版本，:49 直接以其 Nodes 覆盖 req.OutlineNodes。\n+ * 前端只写 localStorage 不落库时，本地编辑在内容生成与页面管理阶段被静默丢弃\n+ * （表现为：手动添加的节点传不过去、排序在生成后回弹）。\n+ */\n+const hasUnsavedEdit = computed(() => {\n+  if (!outlineStore.outline_id) return false\n+  return nodesSignature() !== lastPersistedSignature.value\n+})\n+\n+/** 标记当前节点已与后端对齐 */\n+function markPersisted() {\n+  lastPersistedSignature.value = nodesSignature()\n+}\n+\n+/**\n+ * 保存会产出新版本，且后端 SaveOutlineVersion 把新版本状态置为 draft\n+ * （修改已确认大纲时旧版转 superseded，新版需重新确认）。\n+ * 前端不同步 status 会误判「仍已确认」，随后生成请求被 GetConfirmed 以 409 拒绝。\n+ */\n+function syncStatusFromSave(data) {\n+  if (data && data.status) outlineStore.status = data.status\n+}\n+\n+/** 落库保障：把本地编辑提交为后端新版本；无改动则跳过（避免无谓的版本链膨胀） */\n+async function persistIfDirty() {\n+  if (!outlineStore.outline_id || !hasUnsavedEdit.value) return false\n+  savingOutline.value = true\n+  try {\n+    const data = await outlineStore.saveVersion()\n+    syncStatusFromSave(data)\n+    markPersisted()\n+    return true\n+  } finally {\n+    savingOutline.value = false\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+// 自动恢复\n+if (props.autoRestore) {\n+  outlineStore.restore()\n+}\n+// 恢复的节点来自本地缓存，作为对齐基线；否则刚进页面就会误报「有未保存的修改」\n+markPersisted()\n+}\n+\n+// 若无大纲且有 intent，自动创建\n+watch(\n+  () => [outlineStore.outline_id, outlineStore.nodes.length],\n+  ([oid, nc]) => {\n+    if (!oid && nc === 0 && props.intentSummary) {\n+      handleGenerateOutline()\n+    }\n+  },\n+  { immediate: true }\n+)\n+\n+async function handleGenerateOutline() {\n+  if (!props.sessionId) {\n+    emit('error', '缺少 session_id，请先完成 S1 意图理解')\n+    return\n+  }\n+  try {\n+    // 尝试从 localStorage 读取证据包\n+    let evidence = null\n+    try {\n+      const raw = window.localStorage.getItem('fuww_s2_evidence_packet')\n+      if (raw) evidence = JSON.parse(raw)\n+    } catch {}\n+    // 尝试从 localStorage 读取 markdown 内容\n+    let markdown = ''\n+    try {\n+      const m = window.localStorage.getItem('fuww_s2_markdown')\n+      if (m) markdown = m\n+    } catch {}\n+\n+    await outlineStore.createOutline({\n+      session_id: props.sessionId,\n+      intent_id: props.intentId,\n+      intent: props.intentSummary || {},\n+      evidence_packet: evidence,\n+      markdown\n+    })\n+    // 创建已落库（createOutline → POST /outlines），作为后续「未保存」判定的对齐基线\n+    markPersisted()\n+    emit('outline-created', {\n+      outline_id: outlineStore.outline_id,\n+      outline_version: outlineStore.outline_version\n+    })\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    emit('error', err?.message || '创建大纲失败')\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+function handleAddNode() {\n+  const lastNodeId = outlineStore.nodes.at(-1)?.node_id || null\n+  outlineStore.addNode(lastNodeId)\n+}\n+\n+function handleDeleteNode(nodeId) {\n+  if (outlineStore.nodes.length <= 1) {\n+    emit('error', '大纲至少需要一个节点')\n+    return\n+  }\n+  outlineStore.removeNode(nodeId)\n+}\n+\n+function addKeyPoint(node) {\n+  const val = (newKeyPoints.value[node.node_id] || '').trim()\n+  if (!val) return\n+  const kps = [...(node.key_points || []), val]\n+  outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { key_points: kps })\n+  newKeyPoints.value[node.node_id] = ''\n+}\n+\n+function removeKeyPoint(node, index) {\n+  const kps = [...(node.key_points || [])]\n+  kps.splice(index, 1)\n+  outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { key_points: kps })\n+}\n+\n+async function handleSave() {\n+  try {\n+    const data = await outlineStore.saveVersion()\n+    // 后端保存产出新版本并重置为 draft，前端必须同步状态，否则后续生成被 409 拒绝\n+    syncStatusFromSave(data)\n+    markPersisted()\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    emit('error', err?.message || '保存大纲失败')\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+async function handleConfirm() {\n+  try {\n+    // 确认前先落库：确认会冻结该版本，未提交的本地编辑（新增节点 / 排序）将永远进不了生成链路\n+    await persistIfDirty()\n+    await outlineStore.confirmOutline()\n+    markPersisted()\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    emit('error', err?.message || '确认大纲失败')\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+async function handleSendRevise() {\n+  const msg = reviseMessage.value.trim()\n+  if (!msg) return\n+  showReviseInput.value = false\n+  showReviseDialog.value = true\n+  revisingDialogLoading.value = true\n+  try {\n+    await outlineStore.reviseOutline(msg)\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    emit('error', err?.message || 'AI 修订失败')\n+    showReviseDialog.value = false\n+  } finally {\n+    revisingDialogLoading.value = false\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+async function handleApplyRevision() {\n+  outlineStore.applyRevision()\n+  showReviseDialog.value = false\n+  reviseMessage.value = ''\n+  // 采纳后立即落库：后端生成链路只认存储版本（GetConfirmed），\n+  // 不落库则修订结果只存在于 localStorage，大纲页刷新后即与后端分叉（表现为「AI 修订没加上节点」）。\n+  try {\n+    await persistIfDirty()\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    emit('error', err?.message || 'AI 修订落库失败，请点「保存大纲」重试')\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+function handleCancelRevision() {\n+  outlineStore.discardRevision()\n+  showReviseDialog.value = false\n+  reviseMessage.value = ''\n+}\n+</script>\n+\n+<style scoped>\n+.outline-editor {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 12px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 头部 */\n+.outline-header {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  padding: 12px 16px;\n+  background: #f8fbf9;\n+  border: 1px solid #e2ece6;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+}\n+.outline-meta {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 12px;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #607a71;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+.outline-status {\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+  padding: 2px 8px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+.status-draft { background: #f0f5f2; color: #2f605a; }\n+.status-confirming { background: #fff8e6; color: #7c4a15; }\n+.status-confirmed { background: #d1fae5; color: #065f46; }\n+.status-superseded { background: #f3f4f6; color: #6b7280; }\n+.outline-actions {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+\n+/* 错误条 */\n+.error-bar {\n+  padding: 10px 14px;\n+  background: #fef2f2;\n+  border: 1px solid #fecaca;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  color: #dc2626;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 节点列表 */\n+.nodes-list {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+}\n+\n+.outline-node-card {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 12px;\n+  padding: 14px 16px;\n+  background: #fff;\n+  border: 1.5px solid #e2ece6;\n+  border-radius: 14px;\n+  transition: border-color 0.15s;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card:hover {\n+  border-color: #5ca68f;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card.node-type-section {\n+  border-left: 4px solid #2f605a;\n+  background: #f8fbf9;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card.node-type-quiz {\n+  border-left: 4px solid #7c3aed;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card.node-type-interactive {\n+  border-left: 4px solid #ea580c;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card.node-type-summary {\n+  border-left: 4px solid #ca8a04;\n+}\n+\n+/* 序号 */\n+.node-drag-handle {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 4px;\n+  min-width: 28px;\n+}\n+.node-order {\n+  font-size: 16px;\n+  font-weight: 700;\n+  color: #5ca68f;\n+  line-height: 1;\n+}\n+.node-move-btns {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 2px;\n+}\n+.move-btn {\n+  background: none;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 4px;\n+  font-size: 10px;\n+  color: #5ca68f;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  padding: 1px 4px;\n+  line-height: 1;\n+}\n+.move-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.35; cursor: not-allowed; }\n+\n+/* 节点内容 */\n+.node-content {\n+  flex: 1;\n+  min-width: 0;\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+.node-top-row {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+.node-type-select {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 6px;\n+  padding: 3px 6px;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  background: #f0f5f2;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+}\n+.node-type-badge {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  background: #e2ece6;\n+  color: #5ca68f;\n+  padding: 2px 8px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+.node-title-input {\n+  flex: 1;\n+  font-size: 14px;\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+  border: none;\n+  border-bottom: 1.5px solid #c6ded6;\n+  padding: 2px 4px;\n+  outline: none;\n+  color: #1e293b;\n+  background: transparent;\n+  min-width: 0;\n+}\n+.node-title-input:focus { border-bottom-color: #5ca68f; }\n+.node-title { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #1e293b; }\n+.node-summary-input {\n+  width: 100%;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #475569;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  padding: 6px 8px;\n+  resize: vertical;\n+  outline: none;\n+  font-family: inherit;\n+  box-sizing: border-box;\n+  background: #fafcfa;\n+}\n+.node-summary-input:focus { border-color: #5ca68f; }\n+.node-summary { font-size: 12px; color: #475569; margin: 0; line-height: 1.5; }\n+\n+/* 知识点 */\n+.node-key-points {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: flex-start;\n+  gap: 6px;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+.kp-label { font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; white-space: nowrap; line-height: 22px; }\n+.kp-tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; align-items: center; }\n+.kp-tag {\n+  display: inline-flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 4px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  background: #e8f5f0;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  padding: 2px 8px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+.kp-remove {\n+  background: none;\n+  border: none;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  padding: 0;\n+  line-height: 1;\n+  opacity: 0.6;\n+}\n+.kp-remove:hover { opacity: 1; }\n+.kp-add-input {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  border: none;\n+  background: transparent;\n+  outline: none;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  width: 100px;\n+  padding: 2px 4px;\n+}\n+.kp-tag-static {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  background: #e8f5f0;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  padding: 2px 8px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 互动规划 */\n+.node-interactive-plan {\n+  border-top: 1px dashed #c6ded6;\n+  padding-top: 8px;\n+}\n+.plan-toggle {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #5ca68f;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  user-select: none;\n+  list-style: none;\n+}\n+.plan-toggle::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }\n+.plan-fields {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  margin-top: 8px;\n+}\n+.plan-fields label {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 4px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  color: #64748b;\n+}\n+.plan-fields input[type=\"number\"] {\n+  width: 54px;\n+  padding: 2px 5px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 5px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  outline: none;\n+}\n+.plan-fields select {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 5px;\n+  padding: 2px 4px;\n+  outline: none;\n+}\n+.plan-fields input[type=\"checkbox\"] { width: 14px; height: 14px; }\n+\n+/* 底部：时长 & 删除 */\n+.node-footer {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+.duration-label {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 5px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  color: #64748b;\n+}\n+.duration-input {\n+  width: 48px;\n+  padding: 2px 6px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 5px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  text-align: center;\n+  outline: none;\n+}\n+.duration-input:disabled { background: #f8fbf9; }\n+.node-delete-btn {\n+  background: none;\n+  border: none;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  font-size: 14px;\n+  opacity: 0.4;\n+  transition: opacity 0.15s;\n+}\n+.node-delete-btn:hover { opacity: 1; }\n+\n+/* 添加节点 */\n+.add-node-row {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  justify-content: center;\n+  padding: 10px 0;\n+}\n+.add-node-btn {\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+}\n+.btn {\n+  padding: 6px 14px;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  font-weight: 500;\n+  transition: all 0.15s;\n+  border: 1px solid transparent;\n+}\n+.btn-sm { padding: 5px 12px; font-size: 12px; }\n+.btn-outline {\n+  background: #fff;\n+  border-color: #c6ded6;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.btn-outline:hover { background: #f0f5f2; }\n+.btn-primary {\n+  background: #2f605a;\n+  color: #fff;\n+  border-color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.btn-primary:hover:not(:disabled) { background: #1e4a44; }\n+.btn-primary:disabled { opacity: 0.5; cursor: not-allowed; }\n+.btn:disabled { opacity: 0.5; cursor: not-allowed; }\n+\n+/* 修订输入条 */\n+.revise-input-bar {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  padding: 10px 14px;\n+  background: #f0f5f2;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 10px;\n+}\n+.revise-text-input {\n+  flex: 1;\n+  padding: 6px 10px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  outline: none;\n+}\n+.revise-text-input:focus { border-color: #5ca68f; }\n+\n+/* 过渡动画 */\n+.node-list-enter-active,\n+.node-list-leave-active { transition: all 0.25s ease; }\n+.node-list-enter-from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-8px); }\n+.node-list-leave-to { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-8px); }\n+</style>\ndiff --git a/.rivet/backups/1789136953267/frontend/teacher/src/components/teacher/OutlineEditor.vue b/.rivet/backups/1789136953267/frontend/teacher/src/components/teacher/OutlineEditor.vue\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..43e17f9\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/.rivet/backups/1789136953267/frontend/teacher/src/components/teacher/OutlineEditor.vue\n@@ -0,0 +1,889 @@\n+<template>\n+  <div class=\"outline-editor\">\n+    <!-- 大纲头部信息 -->\n+    <div class=\"outline-header\">\n+      <div class=\"outline-meta\">\n+        <span class=\"outline-id\" v-if=\"outlineStore.outline_id\">\n+          大纲 ID：{{ outlineStore.outline_id }}\n+        </span>\n+        <span class=\"outline-version\" v-if=\"outlineStore.outline_version\">\n+          v{{ outlineStore.outline_version }}\n+        </span>\n+        <span class=\"outline-status\" :class=\"`status-${outlineStore.status}`\">\n+          {{ statusLabel }}\n+        </span>\n+        <span class=\"outline-duration\">\n+          ⏱ 总计 {{ outlineStore.totalDuration }} 分钟 · {{ outlineStore.nodeCount }} 个节点\n+        </span>\n+      </div>\n+      <div class=\"outline-actions\">\n+        <button\n+          v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-sm\"\n+          :disabled=\"outlineStore.reviseLoading\"\n+          @click=\"showReviseInput = true\"\n+          title=\"发送指令让 AI 修改大纲\"\n+        >\n+          {{ outlineStore.reviseLoading ? 'AI 修订中...' : '🤖 AI 修订' }}\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-sm\"\n+          :disabled=\"outlineStore.loading\"\n+          @click=\"handleSave\"\n+        >\n+          保存大纲\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          v-if=\"outlineStore.isConfirmed\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\"\n+          @click=\"$emit('confirm-complete')\"\n+        >\n+          进入内容生成 →\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          v-else-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit && outlineStore.nodeCount > 0\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\"\n+          :disabled=\"outlineStore.loading\"\n+          @click=\"handleConfirm\"\n+        >\n+          {{ outlineStore.loading ? '确认中...' : '确认大纲' }}\n+        </button>\n+      </div>\n+    </div>\n+\n+    <!-- 错误提示 -->\n+    <div v-if=\"outlineStore.error || outlineStore.confirmError\" class=\"error-bar\" role=\"alert\">\n+      {{ outlineStore.confirmError || outlineStore.error }}\n+    </div>\n+\n+    <!-- 未落库提示：内容生成与页面管理读取的是后端存储版本，本地编辑不落库会丢失 -->\n+    <div v-if=\"hasUnsavedEdit\" class=\"unsaved-bar\" role=\"status\">\n+      <span>\n+        有未保存的修改（节点 / 排序 / 知识点）。确认大纲时会自动保存，确保这些改动能进入内容生成与页面管理。\n+      </span>\n+      <button\n+        class=\"btn btn-sm\"\n+        :disabled=\"outlineStore.loading || savingOutline\"\n+        @click=\"handleSave\"\n+      >{{ savingOutline ? '保存中...' : '立即保存' }}</button>\n+    </div>\n+\n+    <!-- 节点编辑器 -->\n+    <div class=\"nodes-list\">\n+      <TransitionGroup name=\"node-list\">\n+        <div\n+          v-for=\"(node, idx) in outlineStore.nodes\"\n+          :key=\"node.node_id\"\n+          class=\"outline-node-card\"\n+          :class=\"`node-type-${node.node_type}`\"\n+        >\n+          <!-- 节点序号 & 移动按钮 -->\n+          <div class=\"node-drag-handle\">\n+            <span class=\"node-order\">{{ idx + 1 }}</span>\n+            <div class=\"node-move-btns\" v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\">\n+              <button\n+                class=\"move-btn\"\n+                :disabled=\"idx === 0\"\n+                @click=\"outlineStore.moveNode(node.node_id, 'up')\"\n+                title=\"上移\"\n+              >↑</button>\n+              <button\n+                class=\"move-btn\"\n+                :disabled=\"idx === outlineStore.nodes.length - 1\"\n+                @click=\"outlineStore.moveNode(node.node_id, 'down')\"\n+                title=\"下移\"\n+              >↓</button>\n+            </div>\n+          </div>\n+\n+          <!-- 节点内容 -->\n+          <div class=\"node-content\">\n+            <div class=\"node-top-row\">\n+              <!-- 节点类型选择 -->\n+              <select\n+                v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+                v-model=\"node.node_type\"\n+                class=\"node-type-select\"\n+                @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { node_type: node.node_type })\"\n+              >\n+                <option value=\"content\">📖 知识讲解</option>\n+                <option value=\"section\">📂 章节标题</option>\n+                <option value=\"quiz\">❓ 随堂测验</option>\n+                <option value=\"interactive\">🎮 互动环节</option>\n+                <option value=\"summary\">📋 总结回顾</option>\n+              </select>\n+              <span v-else class=\"node-type-badge\">{{ node.node_type }}</span>\n+\n+              <!-- 标题 -->\n+              <input\n+                v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+                v-model=\"node.title\"\n+                class=\"node-title-input\"\n+                placeholder=\"节点标题\"\n+                @input=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { title: node.title })\"\n+              />\n+              <div v-else class=\"node-title\">{{ node.title }}</div>\n+            </div>\n+\n+            <!-- 摘要 -->\n+            <textarea\n+              v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+              v-model=\"node.summary\"\n+              class=\"node-summary-input\"\n+              placeholder=\"节点摘要（简述本节点教学内容）\"\n+              rows=\"2\"\n+              @input=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { summary: node.summary })\"\n+            ></textarea>\n+            <p v-else class=\"node-summary\">{{ node.summary }}</p>\n+\n+            <!-- 核心知识点标签 -->\n+            <div class=\"node-key-points\">\n+              <span class=\"kp-label\">核心知识点：</span>\n+              <template v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\">\n+                <div class=\"kp-tags\">\n+                  <span\n+                    v-for=\"(kp, ki) in node.key_points\"\n+                    :key=\"ki\"\n+                    class=\"kp-tag\"\n+                  >\n+                    {{ kp }}\n+                    <button class=\"kp-remove\" @click=\"removeKeyPoint(node, ki)\">×</button>\n+                  </span>\n+                  <input\n+                    v-model=\"newKeyPoints[node.node_id]\"\n+                    class=\"kp-add-input\"\n+                    placeholder=\"+ 添加知识点\"\n+                    @keyup.enter=\"addKeyPoint(node)\"\n+                  />\n+                </div>\n+              </template>\n+              <template v-else>\n+                <span v-for=\"(kp, ki) in node.key_points\" :key=\"ki\" class=\"kp-tag-static\">\n+                  {{ kp }}\n+                </span>\n+              </template>\n+            </div>\n+\n+            <!-- 互动规划（仅 interactive / quiz 类型且有 plan 时显示）\n+                 注意：必须判 interactive_plan 非空——后端/LLM 产出的交互节点该字段常为 null，\n+                 直接访问 interactive_plan.x 会抛错并中断整个节点列表渲染。 -->\n+            <div\n+              v-if=\"(node.node_type === 'interactive' || node.node_type === 'quiz') && node.interactive_plan && outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+              class=\"node-interactive-plan\"\n+            >\n+              <details>\n+                <summary class=\"plan-toggle\">🎯 互动规划</summary>\n+                <div class=\"plan-fields\">\n+                  <label>\n+                    时长（分钟）\n+                    <input\n+                      type=\"number\"\n+                      v-model.number=\"node.interactive_plan.duration_minutes\"\n+                      min=\"1\"\n+                      max=\"60\"\n+                      @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { interactive_plan: { ...node.interactive_plan } })\"\n+                    />\n+                  </label>\n+                  <label>\n+                    题目数量\n+                    <input\n+                      type=\"number\"\n+                      v-model.number=\"node.interactive_plan.question_count\"\n+                      min=\"1\"\n+                      max=\"20\"\n+                      @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { interactive_plan: { ...node.interactive_plan } })\"\n+                    />\n+                  </label>\n+                  <label>\n+                    自动判分\n+                    <input\n+                      type=\"checkbox\"\n+                      v-model=\"node.interactive_plan.auto_grading\"\n+                      @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { interactive_plan: { ...node.interactive_plan } })\"\n+                    />\n+                  </label>\n+                  <label>\n+                    产出方式\n+                    <select v-model=\"node.interactive_plan.delivery\">\n+                      <option value=\"html5_link\">HTML5 链接</option>\n+                      <option value=\"ppt_native\">PPT 内嵌</option>\n+                      <option value=\"standalone_html\">独立 HTML</option>\n+                    </select>\n+                  </label>\n+                </div>\n+              </details>\n+            </div>\n+\n+            <!-- 时长 -->\n+            <div class=\"node-footer\">\n+              <label class=\"duration-label\">\n+                时长\n+                <input\n+                  type=\"number\"\n+                  v-model.number=\"node.estimated_duration_minutes\"\n+                  min=\"1\"\n+                  max=\"180\"\n+                  :disabled=\"!outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+                  class=\"duration-input\"\n+                  @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { estimated_duration_minutes: node.estimated_duration_minutes })\"\n+                />\n+                分钟\n+              </label>\n+\n+              <!-- 删除按钮 -->\n+              <button\n+                v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+                class=\"node-delete-btn\"\n+                @click=\"handleDeleteNode(node.node_id)\"\n+                title=\"删除节点\"\n+              >🗑</button>\n+            </div>\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+      </TransitionGroup>\n+\n+      <!-- 添加节点按钮 -->\n+      <div v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\" class=\"add-node-row\">\n+        <button class=\"btn btn-outline add-node-btn\" @click=\"handleAddNode\">\n+          ＋ 添加节点\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          v-if=\"outlineStore.nodes.length === 0\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-primary\"\n+          @click=\"handleGenerateOutline\"\n+          :disabled=\"outlineStore.loading\"\n+        >\n+          {{ outlineStore.loading ? 'AI 生成中...' : '🤖 AI 生成大纲' }}\n+        </button>\n+      </div>\n+    </div>\n+\n+    <!-- AI 修订对话框 -->\n+    <OutlineRevisionDialog\n+      :visible=\"showReviseDialog\"\n+      :loading=\"revisingDialogLoading\"\n+      :change-summary=\"outlineStore.changeSummary\"\n+      :pending-nodes=\"outlineStore.pendingRevision?.nodes || []\"\n+      @apply=\"handleApplyRevision\"\n+      @cancel=\"handleCancelRevision\"\n+    />\n+\n+    <!-- AI 修订输入弹窗 -->\n+    <div v-if=\"showReviseDialog\" class=\"dialog-overlay\" style=\"display:none\"><!-- 利用 OutlineRevisionDialog --></div>\n+\n+    <!-- 修订指令输入（集成在 OutlineRevisionDialog 之前） -->\n+    <div v-if=\"showReviseInput\" class=\"revise-input-bar\">\n+      <input\n+        v-model=\"reviseMessage\"\n+        class=\"revise-text-input\"\n+        placeholder=\"例如：增加一个生活案例，把课堂练习放到快速排序之后\"\n+        @keyup.enter=\"handleSendRevise\"\n+        autofocus\n+      />\n+      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" @click=\"handleSendRevise\" :disabled=\"!reviseMessage.trim()\">\n+        发送修订\n+      </button>\n+      <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" @click=\"showReviseInput = false\">取消</button>\n+    </div>\n+  </div>\n+</template>\n+\n+<script setup>\n+import { ref, computed, watch } from 'vue'\n+import { useOutlineStore } from '../../stores/outlineStore'\n+import OutlineRevisionDialog from './OutlineRevisionDialog.vue'\n+\n+const props = defineProps({\n+  /** 所属 session_id（从 S1 透传） */\n+  sessionId: { type: String, default: '' },\n+  /** 所属 intent_id（从 S1 透传） */\n+  intentId: { type: String, default: '' },\n+  /** 教学意图摘要（用于创建大纲） */\n+  intentSummary: { type: Object, default: null },\n+  /** 是否自动尝试从 localStorage 恢复大纲 */\n+  autoRestore: { type: Boolean, default: true }\n+})\n+\n+const emit = defineEmits(['confirm-complete', 'outline-created', 'error'])\n+\n+const outlineStore = useOutlineStore()\n+\n+const showReviseDialog = ref(false)\n+const showReviseInput = ref(false)\n+const reviseMessage = ref('')\n+const revisingDialogLoading = ref(false) // 对话框内 AI 正在生成修订\n+const newKeyPoints = ref({}) // { [node_id]: input value }\n+\n+const statusLabel = computed(() => ({\n+  draft: '草稿',\n+  confirming: '确认中',\n+  confirmed: '已确认',\n+  superseded: '已替代'\n+}[outlineStore.status] || outlineStore.status))\n+\n+// 自动恢复\n+// 最近一次与后端对齐（创建 / 保存 / 确认）时的节点快照签名\n+const lastPersistedSignature = ref('')\n+const savingOutline = ref(false)\n+\n+/** 节点快照签名——用于判断是否存在未落库的本地编辑 */\n+function nodesSignature() {\n+  return JSON.stringify(outlineStore.nodes || [])\n+}\n+\n+/**\n+ * 是否存在未落库的本地编辑（排序 / 增删 / 改字段 / 采纳 AI 修订）。\n+ * 根因：后端生成链路以「存储版本」的节点为准——\n+ * generation_handler.go:40 GetConfirmed 取库中版本，:49 直接以其 Nodes 覆盖 req.OutlineNodes。\n+ * 前端只写 localStorage 不落库时，本地编辑在内容生成与页面管理阶段被静默丢弃\n+ * （表现为：手动添加的节点传不过去、排序在生成后回弹）。\n+ */\n+const hasUnsavedEdit = computed(() => {\n+  if (!outlineStore.outline_id) return false\n+  return nodesSignature() !== lastPersistedSignature.value\n+})\n+\n+/** 标记当前节点已与后端对齐 */\n+function markPersisted() {\n+  lastPersistedSignature.value = nodesSignature()\n+}\n+\n+/**\n+ * 保存会产出新版本，且后端 SaveOutlineVersion 把新版本状态置为 draft\n+ * （修改已确认大纲时旧版转 superseded，新版需重新确认）。\n+ * 前端不同步 status 会误判「仍已确认」，随后生成请求被 GetConfirmed 以 409 拒绝。\n+ */\n+function syncStatusFromSave(data) {\n+  if (data && data.status) outlineStore.status = data.status\n+}\n+\n+/** 落库保障：把本地编辑提交为后端新版本；无改动则跳过（避免无谓的版本链膨胀） */\n+async function persistIfDirty() {\n+  if (!outlineStore.outline_id || !hasUnsavedEdit.value) return false\n+  savingOutline.value = true\n+  try {\n+    const data = await outlineStore.saveVersion()\n+    syncStatusFromSave(data)\n+    markPersisted()\n+    return true\n+  } finally {\n+    savingOutline.value = false\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+// 自动恢复\n+if (props.autoRestore) {\n+  outlineStore.restore()\n+}\n+// 恢复的节点来自本地缓存，作为对齐基线；否则刚进页面就会误报「有未保存的修改」\n+markPersisted()\n+}\n+\n+// 若无大纲且有 intent，自动创建\n+watch(\n+  () => [outlineStore.outline_id, outlineStore.nodes.length],\n+  ([oid, nc]) => {\n+    if (!oid && nc === 0 && props.intentSummary) {\n+      handleGenerateOutline()\n+    }\n+  },\n+  { immediate: true }\n+)\n+\n+async function handleGenerateOutline() {\n+  if (!props.sessionId) {\n+    emit('error', '缺少 session_id，请先完成 S1 意图理解')\n+    return\n+  }\n+  try {\n+    // 尝试从 localStorage 读取证据包\n+    let evidence = null\n+    try {\n+      const raw = window.localStorage.getItem('fuww_s2_evidence_packet')\n+      if (raw) evidence = JSON.parse(raw)\n+    } catch {}\n+    // 尝试从 localStorage 读取 markdown 内容\n+    let markdown = ''\n+    try {\n+      const m = window.localStorage.getItem('fuww_s2_markdown')\n+      if (m) markdown = m\n+    } catch {}\n+\n+    await outlineStore.createOutline({\n+      session_id: props.sessionId,\n+      intent_id: props.intentId,\n+      intent: props.intentSummary || {},\n+      evidence_packet: evidence,\n+      markdown\n+    })\n+    // 创建已落库（createOutline → POST /outlines），作为后续「未保存」判定的对齐基线\n+    markPersisted()\n+    emit('outline-created', {\n+      outline_id: outlineStore.outline_id,\n+      outline_version: outlineStore.outline_version\n+    })\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    emit('error', err?.message || '创建大纲失败')\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+function handleAddNode() {\n+  const lastNodeId = outlineStore.nodes.at(-1)?.node_id || null\n+  outlineStore.addNode(lastNodeId)\n+}\n+\n+function handleDeleteNode(nodeId) {\n+  if (outlineStore.nodes.length <= 1) {\n+    emit('error', '大纲至少需要一个节点')\n+    return\n+  }\n+  outlineStore.removeNode(nodeId)\n+}\n+\n+function addKeyPoint(node) {\n+  const val = (newKeyPoints.value[node.node_id] || '').trim()\n+  if (!val) return\n+  const kps = [...(node.key_points || []), val]\n+  outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { key_points: kps })\n+  newKeyPoints.value[node.node_id] = ''\n+}\n+\n+function removeKeyPoint(node, index) {\n+  const kps = [...(node.key_points || [])]\n+  kps.splice(index, 1)\n+  outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { key_points: kps })\n+}\n+\n+async function handleSave() {\n+  try {\n+    const data = await outlineStore.saveVersion()\n+    // 后端保存产出新版本并重置为 draft，前端必须同步状态，否则后续生成被 409 拒绝\n+    syncStatusFromSave(data)\n+    markPersisted()\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    emit('error', err?.message || '保存大纲失败')\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+async function handleConfirm() {\n+  try {\n+    // 确认前先落库：确认会冻结该版本，未提交的本地编辑（新增节点 / 排序）将永远进不了生成链路\n+    await persistIfDirty()\n+    await outlineStore.confirmOutline()\n+    markPersisted()\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    emit('error', err?.message || '确认大纲失败')\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+async function handleSendRevise() {\n+  const msg = reviseMessage.value.trim()\n+  if (!msg) return\n+  showReviseInput.value = false\n+  showReviseDialog.value = true\n+  revisingDialogLoading.value = true\n+  try {\n+    await outlineStore.reviseOutline(msg)\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    emit('error', err?.message || 'AI 修订失败')\n+    showReviseDialog.value = false\n+  } finally {\n+    revisingDialogLoading.value = false\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+async function handleApplyRevision() {\n+  outlineStore.applyRevision()\n+  showReviseDialog.value = false\n+  reviseMessage.value = ''\n+  // 采纳后立即落库：后端生成链路只认存储版本（GetConfirmed），\n+  // 不落库则修订结果只存在于 localStorage，大纲页刷新后即与后端分叉（表现为「AI 修订没加上节点」）。\n+  try {\n+    await persistIfDirty()\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    emit('error', err?.message || 'AI 修订落库失败，请点「保存大纲」重试')\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+function handleCancelRevision() {\n+  outlineStore.discardRevision()\n+  showReviseDialog.value = false\n+  reviseMessage.value = ''\n+}\n+</script>\n+\n+<style scoped>\n+.outline-editor {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 12px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 头部 */\n+.outline-header {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  padding: 12px 16px;\n+  background: #f8fbf9;\n+  border: 1px solid #e2ece6;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+}\n+.outline-meta {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 12px;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #607a71;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+.outline-status {\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+  padding: 2px 8px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+.status-draft { background: #f0f5f2; color: #2f605a; }\n+.status-confirming { background: #fff8e6; color: #7c4a15; }\n+.status-confirmed { background: #d1fae5; color: #065f46; }\n+.status-superseded { background: #f3f4f6; color: #6b7280; }\n+.outline-actions {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+\n+/* 错误条 */\n+.error-bar {\n+  padding: 10px 14px;\n+  background: #fef2f2;\n+  border: 1px solid #fecaca;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  color: #dc2626;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+}\n+.unsaved-bar {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  padding: 8px 14px;\n+  background: #fff8e6;\n+  border: 1px solid #f6dfa8;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  color: #7c4a15;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 节点列表 */\n+.nodes-list {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+}\n+\n+.outline-node-card {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 12px;\n+  padding: 14px 16px;\n+  background: #fff;\n+  border: 1.5px solid #e2ece6;\n+  border-radius: 14px;\n+  transition: border-color 0.15s;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card:hover {\n+  border-color: #5ca68f;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card.node-type-section {\n+  border-left: 4px solid #2f605a;\n+  background: #f8fbf9;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card.node-type-quiz {\n+  border-left: 4px solid #7c3aed;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card.node-type-interactive {\n+  border-left: 4px solid #ea580c;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card.node-type-summary {\n+  border-left: 4px solid #ca8a04;\n+}\n+\n+/* 序号 */\n+.node-drag-handle {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 4px;\n+  min-width: 28px;\n+}\n+.node-order {\n+  font-size: 16px;\n+  font-weight: 700;\n+  color: #5ca68f;\n+  line-height: 1;\n+}\n+.node-move-btns {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 2px;\n+}\n+.move-btn {\n+  background: none;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 4px;\n+  font-size: 10px;\n+  color: #5ca68f;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  padding: 1px 4px;\n+  line-height: 1;\n+}\n+.move-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.35; cursor: not-allowed; }\n+\n+/* 节点内容 */\n+.node-content {\n+  flex: 1;\n+  min-width: 0;\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+.node-top-row {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+.node-type-select {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 6px;\n+  padding: 3px 6px;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  background: #f0f5f2;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+}\n+.node-type-badge {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  background: #e2ece6;\n+  color: #5ca68f;\n+  padding: 2px 8px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+.node-title-input {\n+  flex: 1;\n+  font-size: 14px;\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+  border: none;\n+  border-bottom: 1.5px solid #c6ded6;\n+  padding: 2px 4px;\n+  outline: none;\n+  color: #1e293b;\n+  background: transparent;\n+  min-width: 0;\n+}\n+.node-title-input:focus { border-bottom-color: #5ca68f; }\n+.node-title { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #1e293b; }\n+.node-summary-input {\n+  width: 100%;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #475569;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  padding: 6px 8px;\n+  resize: vertical;\n+  outline: none;\n+  font-family: inherit;\n+  box-sizing: border-box;\n+  background: #fafcfa;\n+}\n+.node-summary-input:focus { border-color: #5ca68f; }\n+.node-summary { font-size: 12px; color: #475569; margin: 0; line-height: 1.5; }\n+\n+/* 知识点 */\n+.node-key-points {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: flex-start;\n+  gap: 6px;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+.kp-label { font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; white-space: nowrap; line-height: 22px; }\n+.kp-tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; align-items: center; }\n+.kp-tag {\n+  display: inline-flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 4px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  background: #e8f5f0;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  padding: 2px 8px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+.kp-remove {\n+  background: none;\n+  border: none;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  padding: 0;\n+  line-height: 1;\n+  opacity: 0.6;\n+}\n+.kp-remove:hover { opacity: 1; }\n+.kp-add-input {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  border: none;\n+  background: transparent;\n+  outline: none;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  width: 100px;\n+  padding: 2px 4px;\n+}\n+.kp-tag-static {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  background: #e8f5f0;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  padding: 2px 8px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 互动规划 */\n+.node-interactive-plan {\n+  border-top: 1px dashed #c6ded6;\n+  padding-top: 8px;\n+}\n+.plan-toggle {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #5ca68f;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  user-select: none;\n+  list-style: none;\n+}\n+.plan-toggle::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }\n+.plan-fields {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  margin-top: 8px;\n+}\n+.plan-fields label {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 4px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  color: #64748b;\n+}\n+.plan-fields input[type=\"number\"] {\n+  width: 54px;\n+  padding: 2px 5px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 5px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  outline: none;\n+}\n+.plan-fields select {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 5px;\n+  padding: 2px 4px;\n+  outline: none;\n+}\n+.plan-fields input[type=\"checkbox\"] { width: 14px; height: 14px; }\n+\n+/* 底部：时长 & 删除 */\n+.node-footer {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+.duration-label {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 5px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  color: #64748b;\n+}\n+.duration-input {\n+  width: 48px;\n+  padding: 2px 6px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 5px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  text-align: center;\n+  outline: none;\n+}\n+.duration-input:disabled { background: #f8fbf9; }\n+.node-delete-btn {\n+  background: none;\n+  border: none;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  font-size: 14px;\n+  opacity: 0.4;\n+  transition: opacity 0.15s;\n+}\n+.node-delete-btn:hover { opacity: 1; }\n+\n+/* 添加节点 */\n+.add-node-row {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  justify-content: center;\n+  padding: 10px 0;\n+}\n+.add-node-btn {\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+}\n+.btn {\n+  padding: 6px 14px;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  font-weight: 500;\n+  transition: all 0.15s;\n+  border: 1px solid transparent;\n+}\n+.btn-sm { padding: 5px 12px; font-size: 12px; }\n+.btn-outline {\n+  background: #fff;\n+  border-color: #c6ded6;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.btn-outline:hover { background: #f0f5f2; }\n+.btn-primary {\n+  background: #2f605a;\n+  color: #fff;\n+  border-color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.btn-primary:hover:not(:disabled) { background: #1e4a44; }\n+.btn-primary:disabled { opacity: 0.5; cursor: not-allowed; }\n+.btn:disabled { opacity: 0.5; cursor: not-allowed; }\n+\n+/* 修订输入条 */\n+.revise-input-bar {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  padding: 10px 14px;\n+  background: #f0f5f2;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 10px;\n+}\n+.revise-text-input {\n+  flex: 1;\n+  padding: 6px 10px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  outline: none;\n+}\n+.revise-text-input:focus { border-color: #5ca68f; }\n+\n+/* 过渡动画 */\n+.node-list-enter-active,\n+.node-list-leave-active { transition: all 0.25s ease; }\n+.node-list-enter-from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-8px); }\n+.node-list-leave-to { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-8px); }\n+</style>\ndiff --git a/.rivet/backups/1789137019152/frontend/teacher/src/pages/S3StudioPage.vue b/.rivet/backups/1789137019152/frontend/teacher/src/pages/S3StudioPage.vue\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..cc2bb8e\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/.rivet/backups/1789137019152/frontend/teacher/src/pages/S3StudioPage.vue\n@@ -0,0 +1,1085 @@\n+<template>\n+  <AppShell>\n+    <div class=\"s3-page\">\n+      <!-- 页面头部 -->\n+      <div class=\"page-header\">\n+        <div>\n+          <h2>S3 课件生成</h2>\n+          <p>大纲编辑 → 内容生成 → 页面预览</p>\n+        </div>\n+        <div class=\"page-header-right\">\n+          <div class=\"step-pills\">\n+            <router-link :to=\"{ name: 'S1Intent' }\" class=\"pill\"\n+              >S1 意图</router-link\n+            >\n+            <router-link :to=\"{ name: 'S2Material' }\" class=\"pill\"\n+              >S2 资料</router-link\n+            >\n+            <span class=\"pill active\">S3 生成</span>\n+            <router-link :to=\"{ name: 'S4Version' }\" class=\"pill\"\n+              >S4 版本</router-link\n+            >\n+            <router-link :to=\"{ name: 'Middle' }\" class=\"pill back-pill\"\n+              >返回中间页</router-link\n+            >\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+      </div>\n+\n+      <!-- 模式提示条 -->\n+      <div\n+        v-if=\"generationMode === 'without_evidence'\"\n+        class=\"evidence-warning\"\n+        role=\"status\"\n+      >\n+        <div>\n+          <strong>当前为无参考资料生成模式</strong>\n+          <span>本次内容仅依据 S1 教学意图生成，不会伪造资料引用。</span>\n+        </div>\n+        <router-link :to=\"{ name: 'S2Material' }\">返回补充资料</router-link>\n+      </div>\n+\n+      <!-- S3 阶段指示器 -->\n+      <div class=\"phase-tabs\">\n+        <button\n+          class=\"phase-tab\"\n+          :class=\"{ active: currentPhase === 'outline' }\"\n+          @click=\"currentPhase = 'outline'\"\n+        >\n+          📋 大纲编辑\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          class=\"phase-tab\"\n+          :class=\"{ active: currentPhase === 'generating' }\"\n+          @click=\"currentPhase = 'generating'\"\n+          :disabled=\"!outlineStore.isConfirmed\"\n+        >\n+          ⚙️ 内容生成\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          class=\"phase-tab\"\n+          :class=\"{ active: currentPhase === 'pages' }\"\n+          @click=\"currentPhase = 'pages'\"\n+          :disabled=\"!generationStore.lastGenId\"\n+        >\n+          📄 页面管理\n+        </button>\n+      </div>\n+\n+      <!-- ==================== 大纲阶段 ==================== -->\n+      <div v-if=\"currentPhase === 'outline'\" class=\"phase-panel\">\n+        <OutlineEditor\n+          :session-id=\"intentStore.sessionId\"\n+          :intent-id=\"intentStore.intentId\"\n+          :intent-summary=\"intentStore.intentSummary\"\n+          :auto-restore=\"true\"\n+          @confirm-complete=\"handleOutlineConfirmed\"\n+          @outline-created=\"handleOutlineCreated\"\n+          @error=\"handleError\"\n+        />\n+      </div>\n+\n+      <!-- ==================== 内容生成阶段 ==================== -->\n+      <div v-else-if=\"currentPhase === 'generating'\" class=\"phase-panel\">\n+        <!-- 生成控制栏 -->\n+        <div class=\"gen-control-bar\">\n+          <div class=\"gen-info\">\n+            <span class=\"gen-label\">大纲</span>\n+            <span class=\"gen-value\"\n+              >{{ outlineStore.outline_id }} v{{\n+                outlineStore.outline_version\n+              }}</span\n+            >\n+            <span class=\"gen-label\" style=\"margin-left: 12px\">生成模式</span>\n+            <select v-model=\"generateMode\" class=\"gen-mode-select\">\n+              <option value=\"page_incremental\">逐页增量生成</option>\n+              <option value=\"page_parallel\">全页面并行生成</option>\n+            </select>\n+          </div>\n+          <div class=\"gen-actions\">\n+            <button\n+              class=\"btn btn-primary\"\n+              :disabled=\"generationStore.isGenerating\"\n+              @click=\"handleStartGeneration\"\n+            >\n+              {{ generationStore.isGenerating ? \"生成中...\" : \"🚀 开始生成\" }}\n+            </button>\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+\n+        <!-- 进度展示 -->\n+        <div\n+          v-if=\"\n+            generationStore.isGenerating || generationStore.generateProgress > 0\n+          \"\n+          class=\"gen-progress-panel\"\n+        >\n+          <div class=\"progress-bar-wrap\">\n+            <div\n+              class=\"progress-bar-fill\"\n+              :style=\"{ width: generationStore.generateProgress + '%' }\"\n+            ></div>\n+          </div>\n+          <div class=\"progress-text\">\n+            <span>{{ generationStore.generateProgress }}%</span>\n+            <span>{{ generationStore.generateStageText }}</span>\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+\n+        <!-- 错误展示 -->\n+        <div v-if=\"genError\" class=\"error-bar\" role=\"alert\">{{ genError }}</div>\n+\n+        <!-- 生成的节点树预览 -->\n+        <div\n+          v-if=\"generationStore.currentScriptNodes.length > 0\"\n+          class=\"gen-nodes-preview\"\n+        >\n+          <h4>已生成节点</h4>\n+          <div class=\"nodes-summary\">\n+            <span\n+              v-for=\"(node, i) in generationStore.currentScriptNodes\"\n+              :key=\"i\"\n+              class=\"node-chip\"\n+            >\n+              {{ i + 1 }}.\n+              {{ node.title || node.node_title || \"节点\" + (i + 1) }}\n+            </span>\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+\n+        <!-- HTML5 预览区 -->\n+        <div v-if=\"generationStore.previewHtml\" class=\"preview-section\">\n+          <div class=\"preview-toolbar\">\n+            <span>📺 HTML5 预览</span>\n+            <button class=\"btn btn-sm\" @click=\"openPreviewWindow\">\n+              新窗口打开\n+            </button>\n+          </div>\n+          <iframe\n+            v-if=\"previewFrameSrc\"\n+            :src=\"previewFrameSrc\"\n+            class=\"preview-frame\"\n+            sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"\n+            title=\"课件预览\"\n+          ></iframe>\n+          <div v-else class=\"preview-placeholder\">\n+            预览将在生成完成后自动加载\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+\n+        <!-- 无参考资料提示 -->\n+        <div v-if=\"!hasEvidence\" class=\"no-evidence-hint\">\n+          ⚠️ 当前无参考资料，内容将基于 S1 意图自动生成。\n+          <router-link :to=\"{ name: 'S2Material' }\"\n+            >前往 S2 补充资料</router-link\n+          >\n+        </div>\n+\n+        <!-- 生成完成后操作 -->\n+        <div\n+          v-if=\"generationStore.generateProgress === 100\"\n+          class=\"gen-complete-actions\"\n+        >\n+          <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" @click=\"currentPhase = 'pages'\">\n+            管理生成页面\n+          </button>\n+          <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" @click=\"goToS4\">\n+            下一步：版本管理 →\n+          </button>\n+        </div>\n+      </div>\n+\n+      <!-- ==================== 页面管理阶段 ==================== -->\n+      <div v-else-if=\"currentPhase === 'pages'\" class=\"phase-panel\">\n+        <div class=\"pages-control-bar\">\n+          <div class=\"pages-info\">\n+            <span>Generation ID：{{ generationStore.lastGenId }}</span>\n+          </div>\n+          <div class=\"pages-actions\">\n+            <button class=\"btn btn-sm\" @click=\"loadGenerationStatus\">\n+              🔄 刷新状态\n+            </button>\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+\n+        <!-- 页面列表 -->\n+        <div v-if=\"generationPages.length > 0\" class=\"pages-list\">\n+          <div\n+            v-for=\"page in generationPages\"\n+            :key=\"page.page_id\"\n+            class=\"page-item\"\n+            :class=\"`page-status-${page.status}`\"\n+          >\n+            <div class=\"page-item-left\">\n+              <span class=\"page-order\">第 {{ page.page_order }} 页</span>\n+              <span class=\"page-node\">关联节点：{{ page.node_id }}</span>\n+            </div>\n+            <div class=\"page-item-right\">\n+              <span class=\"page-status-badge\">{{\n+                statusLabel(page.status)\n+              }}</span>\n+              <button\n+                v-if=\"page.status === 'failed'\"\n+                class=\"btn btn-sm\"\n+                :disabled=\"regeneratingPageId === page.page_id\"\n+                @click=\"handleRegeneratePage(page)\"\n+              >\n+                {{\n+                  regeneratingPageId === page.page_id\n+                    ? \"重生成中...\"\n+                    : \"🔄 重试\"\n+                }}\n+              </button>\n+              <button\n+                v-if=\"page.status === 'done'\"\n+                class=\"btn btn-sm\"\n+                @click=\"handlePreviewPage(page)\"\n+              >\n+                👁 预览\n+              </button>\n+            </div>\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+\n+        <div v-else class=\"pages-empty\">暂无页面数据，请先生成内容</div>\n+\n+        <!-- 互动资源入口 -->\n+        <div v-if=\"generationStore.lastGenId\" class=\"interactive-section\">\n+          <h4>🎮 互动资源管理</h4>\n+          <p class=\"interactive-hint\">\n+            从大纲中标记为互动的节点可在此生成 HTML5 互动资源\n+          </p>\n+          <div class=\"interactive-node-list\">\n+            <div\n+              v-for=\"node in interactiveNodes\"\n+              :key=\"node.node_id\"\n+              class=\"interactive-node-row\"\n+            >\n+              <div class=\"int-node-info\">\n+                <span class=\"int-node-title\">{{ node.title }}</span>\n+                <span class=\"int-node-type\">{{ node.node_type }}</span>\n+              </div>\n+              <div class=\"int-node-actions\">\n+                <template v-if=\"interactiveStore.hasAsset(node.node_id)\">\n+                  <span class=\"asset-done\">✅ 已生成</span>\n+                  <button\n+                    class=\"btn btn-sm\"\n+                    @click=\"openInteractiveAsset(node)\"\n+                  >\n+                    打开\n+                  </button>\n+                </template>\n+                <template\n+                  v-else-if=\"\n+                    interactiveStore.getAsset(node.node_id)?.status ===\n+                    'processing'\n+                  \"\n+                >\n+                  <span class=\"asset-pending\">⏳ 生成中...</span>\n+                </template>\n+                <template v-else>\n+                  <button\n+                    class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\"\n+                    :disabled=\"interactiveStore.loading\"\n+                    @click=\"handleGenerateInteractive(node)\"\n+                  >\n+                    生成互动\n+                  </button>\n+                </template>\n+              </div>\n+            </div>\n+            <p v-if=\"interactiveNodes.length === 0\" class=\"no-interactive-hint\">\n+              大纲中无互动节点，可在编辑大纲时将节点类型改为\"互动环节\"\n+            </p>\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+      </div>\n+    </div>\n+  </AppShell>\n+</template>\n+\n+<script setup>\n+import { ref, computed, onMounted, watch } from \"vue\";\n+import AppShell from \"../components/layout/AppShell.vue\";\n+import OutlineEditor from \"../components/teacher/OutlineEditor.vue\";\n+import { useGenerationStore } from \"../stores/generationStore\";\n+import { useOutlineStore } from \"../stores/outlineStore\";\n+import { useInteractiveStore } from \"../stores/interactiveStore\";\n+import { useIntentStore } from \"../stores/intentStore\";\n+import { teacherV1Api } from \"../services/v1\";\n+import { API_BASE, AI_API_BASE } from \"../config/api\";\n+\n+const generationStore = useGenerationStore();\n+const outlineStore = useOutlineStore();\n+const interactiveStore = useInteractiveStore();\n+const intentStore = useIntentStore();\n+\n+// 阶段：outline | generating | pages\n+const currentPhase = ref(\"outline\");\n+const generationMode = ref(\"\");\n+const generateMode = ref(\"page_incremental\");\n+const genError = ref(\"\");\n+const generationPages = ref([]);\n+const regeneratingPageId = ref(\"\");\n+const previewFrameSrc = ref(\"\");\n+\n+// 是否有参考资料\n+const hasEvidence = computed(() => {\n+  try {\n+    const raw = window.localStorage.getItem(\"fuww_s2_evidence_packet\");\n+    return !!raw;\n+  } catch {\n+    return false;\n+  }\n+});\n+\n+// 需要互动资源的节点（大纲中标记为 interactive / quiz 的节点）\n+const interactiveNodes = computed(() =>\n+  (outlineStore.nodes || []).filter(\n+    (n) => n.node_type === \"interactive\" || n.node_type === \"quiz\",\n+  ),\n+);\n+\n+onMounted(async () => {\n+  // 恢复 S1 会话/意图（刷新或直接进入 S3 时 store 内存为空，\n+  // 不恢复会导致 sessionId 缺失 → AI 生成大纲被 \"缺少 session_id\" 拦截）\n+  intentStore.initialize();\n+  if (typeof window !== \"undefined\") {\n+    generationMode.value =\n+      window.localStorage.getItem(\n+        `fuww_s2_generation_mode:${intentStore.sessionId}`,\n+      ) || \"\";\n+  }\n+  // 尝试从 localStorage 恢复大纲\n+  const restored = outlineStore.restore();\n+  if (restored && outlineStore.isConfirmed) {\n+    currentPhase.value = \"generating\";\n+  }\n+  // 恢复最近生成记录\n+  generationStore.restoreLastGenId();\n+  if (generationStore.lastGenId) {\n+    interactiveStore.setGenerationId(generationStore.lastGenId);\n+    await loadGenerationStatus();\n+  }\n+});\n+\n+function statusLabel(status) {\n+  return (\n+    {\n+      pending: \"等待\",\n+      processing: \"生成中\",\n+      done: \"完成\",\n+      failed: \"失败\",\n+    }[status] || status\n+  );\n+}\n+\n+// 大纲创建完成\n+function handleOutlineCreated({ outline_id, outline_version }) {\n+  console.log(\n+    \"[S3StudioPage] 大纲创建完成:\",\n+    outline_id,\n+    \"v\" + outline_version,\n+  );\n+}\n+\n+// 大纲确认完成，进入生成阶段\n+function handleOutlineConfirmed() {\n+  currentPhase.value = \"generating\";\n+}\n+\n+// 开始生成内容\n+async function handleStartGeneration() {\n+  if (!outlineStore.outline_id || !outlineStore.isConfirmed) {\n+    handleError(\"请先确认大纲\");\n+    return;\n+  }\n+  genError.value = \"\";\n+  generationStore.setGenerating(true);\n+  generationStore.setGenerateProgress(5, \"准备生成环境\");\n+\n+  try {\n+    let evidence = null;\n+    try {\n+      const raw = window.localStorage.getItem(\"fuww_s2_evidence_packet\");\n+      if (raw) evidence = JSON.parse(raw);\n+    } catch {}\n+\n+    generationStore.setGenerateProgress(15, \"创建生成任务\");\n+    const resp = await teacherV1Api.generation.createGeneration({\n+      session_id: intentStore.sessionId,\n+      outline_id: outlineStore.outline_id,\n+      outline_version: outlineStore.outline_version,\n+      outline_confirmed: true,\n+      template_id: \"default\",\n+      generate_mode: generateMode.value,\n+      intent: intentStore.intentSummary || undefined,\n+      evidence_packet: evidence,\n+    });\n+\n+    const task = resp?.data || resp || {};\n+    const taskId = task.task_id || task.generation_id;\n+    if (!taskId) throw new Error(\"未返回生成任务 ID\");\n+    generationStore.setLastTaskId(taskId);\n+\n+    // 记录 generation_id\n+    const genId = task.generation_id || taskId;\n+    generationStore.setLastGenId(genId);\n+    interactiveStore.setGenerationId(genId);\n+\n+    generationStore.setGenerateProgress(25, \"正在生成内容\");\n+    const status = await generationStore.waitForCoursewareGeneration(taskId, {\n+      intervalMs: 800,\n+      maxAttempts: 300,\n+    });\n+\n+    // 加载生成状态（页面列表）\n+    await loadGenerationStatus();\n+\n+    // 渲染预览\n+    generationStore.setGenerateProgress(92, \"正在加载预览\");\n+    const html = await generationStore.renderCoursewarePreview(\n+      outlineStore.title || intentStore.intentSummary?.topic || \"课件预览\",\n+      { genId },\n+    );\n+    if (html) {\n+      previewFrameSrc.value = `data:text/html;charset=utf-8,${encodeURIComponent(html)}`;\n+    }\n+\n+    generationStore.setGenerateProgress(100, \"生成完成\");\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    genError.value = err?.message || \"生成失败，请重试\";\n+    generationStore.setGenerateProgress(0, \"生成失败\");\n+  } finally {\n+    generationStore.setGenerating(false);\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+// 加载生成状态\n+async function loadGenerationStatus() {\n+  const taskId = generationStore.lastTaskId || generationStore.restoreLastTaskId();\n+  if (!taskId) return;\n+  try {\n+    const resp = await teacherV1Api.generation.getGenerationStatus(taskId);\n+    const data = resp?.data || resp || {};\n+    generationPages.value = (Array.isArray(data.nodes) ? data.nodes : []).map((node, index) => ({\n+      ...node,\n+      page_id: node.page_id || node.node_id || `page_${index + 1}`,\n+      page_order: Number(node.page_order || node.order || index + 1),\n+      status: node.status || 'completed'\n+    }));\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    console.warn(\"[S3StudioPage] 加载生成状态失败\", err);\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+// 单页重生成\n+async function handleRegeneratePage(page) {\n+  regeneratingPageId.value = page.page_id;\n+  try {\n+    await teacherV1Api.generation.regeneratePage(\n+      generationStore.lastGenId,\n+      page.page_id,\n+      { reason: \"教师手动重试\", mode: \"ai\" },\n+    );\n+    await loadGenerationStatus();\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    handleError(\"重生成失败: \" + (err?.message || \"\"));\n+  } finally {\n+    regeneratingPageId.value = \"\";\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+// 预览单页\n+async function handlePreviewPage(page) {\n+  try {\n+    const resp = await teacherV1Api.generation.getPage(\n+      generationStore.lastGenId,\n+      page.page_id,\n+    );\n+    const data = resp?.data || resp || {};\n+    if (data.preview_url) {\n+      window.open(data.preview_url, \"_blank\");\n+    }\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    handleError(\"预览加载失败\");\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+// 生成互动资源\n+async function handleGenerateInteractive(node) {\n+  if (!generationStore.lastGenId) return;\n+  try {\n+    await interactiveStore.generateInteractive({\n+      generation_id: generationStore.lastGenId,\n+      node_id: node.node_id,\n+      interactive_plan: node.interactive_plan || {\n+        enabled: true,\n+        kind: \"quiz\",\n+        question_count: 3,\n+        duration_minutes: 5,\n+        auto_grading: true,\n+        delivery: \"html5_link\",\n+      },\n+    });\n+    await interactiveStore.pollAssetStatus(node.node_id);\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    handleError(\"生成互动资源失败: \" + (err?.message || \"\"));\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+// 打开互动资源\n+function openInteractiveAsset(node) {\n+  const asset = interactiveStore.getAsset(node.node_id);\n+  if (asset?.entry_url) {\n+    window.open(asset.entry_url, \"_blank\");\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+// 新窗口打开 HTML5 预览\n+function openPreviewWindow() {\n+  if (!generationStore.previewHtml) return;\n+  const blob = new Blob([generationStore.previewHtml], { type: \"text/html\" });\n+  const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);\n+  window.open(url, \"_blank\");\n+  setTimeout(() => URL.revokeObjectURL(url), 10000);\n+}\n+\n+function goToS4() {\n+  // 同步大纲信息到 localStorage，供 S4 使用\n+  try {\n+    window.localStorage.setItem(\n+      \"fuww_s3_outline_info\",\n+      JSON.stringify({\n+        outline_id: outlineStore.outline_id,\n+        outline_version: outlineStore.outline_version,\n+        generation_id: generationStore.lastGenId,\n+      }),\n+    );\n+  } catch {}\n+  import(\"vue-router\").then(({ useRouter }) => {\n+    const router = useRouter();\n+    router.push({ name: \"S4Version\" });\n+  });\n+}\n+\n+function handleError(msg) {\n+  genError.value = msg;\n+  console.warn(\"[S3StudioPage]\", msg);\n+}\n+</script>\n+\n+<style scoped>\n+.s3-page {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  padding: 20px;\n+  min-height: calc(100vh - 140px);\n+  overflow: hidden;\n+  background:\n+    radial-gradient(\n+      circle at 86% -15%,\n+      rgba(175, 221, 203, 0.2),\n+      transparent 30%\n+    ),\n+    linear-gradient(180deg, #fcfefd 0%, #f7faf8 100%);\n+}\n+.page-header {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: flex-start;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  gap: 16px;\n+  margin-bottom: 14px;\n+}\n+.page-header h2 {\n+  margin: 0;\n+  font-size: 22px;\n+  color: #111827;\n+}\n+.page-header p {\n+  margin: 6px 0 0;\n+  font-size: 14px;\n+  color: #607a71;\n+}\n+.page-header-right {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  justify-content: flex-end;\n+}\n+.page-body {\n+  flex: 1;\n+}\n+.evidence-warning {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  gap: 18px;\n+  margin-bottom: 14px;\n+  padding: 13px 16px;\n+  border: 1px solid #f0d5a8;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+  background: #fffaf0;\n+  color: #7c4a15;\n+}\n+.evidence-warning div {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: baseline;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  min-width: 0;\n+}\n+.evidence-warning strong {\n+  flex-shrink: 0;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+}\n+.evidence-warning span {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  line-height: 1.55;\n+  color: #8a6337;\n+}\n+.evidence-warning a {\n+  flex-shrink: 0;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  font-weight: 700;\n+  text-decoration: none;\n+}\n+\n+/* 阶段选项卡 */\n+.phase-tabs {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 4px;\n+  margin-bottom: 14px;\n+  border-bottom: 2px solid #e2ece6;\n+}\n+.phase-tab {\n+  padding: 8px 18px;\n+  border: none;\n+  background: none;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  font-weight: 500;\n+  color: #607a71;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;\n+  margin-bottom: -2px;\n+  transition: all 0.15s;\n+}\n+.phase-tab:hover:not(:disabled) {\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.phase-tab.active {\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  border-bottom-color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.phase-tab:disabled {\n+  opacity: 0.4;\n+  cursor: not-allowed;\n+}\n+\n+/* 阶段面板 */\n+.phase-panel {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 14px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 生成控制栏 */\n+.gen-control-bar {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  padding: 12px 16px;\n+  background: #f8fbf9;\n+  border: 1px solid #e4ede8;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+}\n+.gen-info {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+.gen-label {\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.gen-value {\n+  color: #475569;\n+}\n+.gen-mode-select {\n+  padding: 4px 8px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 6px;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  background: #fff;\n+  outline: none;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+}\n+.gen-actions {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 进度条 */\n+.gen-progress-panel {\n+  padding: 12px 16px;\n+  background: #f8fbf9;\n+  border: 1px solid #e4ede8;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+}\n+.progress-bar-wrap {\n+  height: 8px;\n+  background: #e2ece6;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+  overflow: hidden;\n+  margin-bottom: 8px;\n+}\n+.progress-bar-fill {\n+  height: 100%;\n+  background: #2f605a;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+  transition: width 0.4s ease;\n+}\n+.progress-text {\n+  display: flex;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #607a71;\n+}\n+\n+/* 错误条 */\n+.error-bar {\n+  padding: 10px 14px;\n+  background: #fef2f2;\n+  border: 1px solid #fecaca;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  color: #dc2626;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 节点预览 */\n+.gen-nodes-preview {\n+  padding: 12px 16px;\n+  background: #f8fbf9;\n+  border: 1px solid #e4ede8;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+}\n+.gen-nodes-preview h4 {\n+  margin: 0 0 8px;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.nodes-summary {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  gap: 6px;\n+}\n+.node-chip {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  background: #e8f5f0;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  padding: 3px 10px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 预览区 */\n+.preview-section {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+.preview-toolbar {\n+  display: flex;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+}\n+.preview-frame {\n+  width: 100%;\n+  height: 480px;\n+  border: 1px solid #e2ece6;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+  background: #fff;\n+}\n+.preview-placeholder {\n+  height: 200px;\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: center;\n+  border: 1px dashed #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+  color: #94a3b8;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 无资料提示 */\n+.no-evidence-hint {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #7c4a15;\n+  background: #fffaf0;\n+  border: 1px solid #f0d5a8;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  padding: 10px 14px;\n+}\n+.no-evidence-hint a {\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+}\n+\n+/* 生成完成操作 */\n+.gen-complete-actions {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  justify-content: flex-end;\n+}\n+\n+/* 页面管理 */\n+.pages-control-bar {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  padding: 10px 14px;\n+  background: #f8fbf9;\n+  border: 1px solid #e4ede8;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+}\n+.pages-info {\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  color: #475569;\n+}\n+.pages-list {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+.page-item {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+  padding: 10px 14px;\n+  background: #fff;\n+  border: 1.5px solid #e2ece6;\n+  border-radius: 10px;\n+}\n+.page-status-done {\n+  border-color: #6ee7b7;\n+}\n+.page-status-failed {\n+  border-color: #fca5a5;\n+}\n+.page-status-processing {\n+  border-color: #fcd34d;\n+}\n+.page-item-left {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+}\n+.page-order {\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.page-node {\n+  color: #64748b;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+}\n+.page-item-right {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+.page-status-badge {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  padding: 2px 8px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+}\n+.page-status-done .page-status-badge {\n+  background: #d1fae5;\n+  color: #065f46;\n+}\n+.page-status-failed .page-status-badge {\n+  background: #fee2e2;\n+  color: #991b1b;\n+}\n+.page-status-processing .page-status-badge {\n+  background: #fef9c3;\n+  color: #854d0e;\n+}\n+.page-status-pending .page-status-badge {\n+  background: #f3f4f6;\n+  color: #6b7280;\n+}\n+.pages-empty {\n+  text-align: center;\n+  padding: 40px;\n+  color: #94a3b8;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 互动资源 */\n+.interactive-section {\n+  padding: 14px 16px;\n+  background: #fff;\n+  border: 1px solid #e4ede8;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+}\n+.interactive-section h4 {\n+  margin: 0 0 6px;\n+  font-size: 14px;\n+  color: #1e293b;\n+}\n+.interactive-hint {\n+  margin: 0 0 12px;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #64748b;\n+}\n+.interactive-node-list {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+.interactive-node-row {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+  padding: 8px 12px;\n+  background: #f8fbf9;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+}\n+.int-node-info {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+.int-node-title {\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  color: #1e293b;\n+}\n+.int-node-type {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  background: #e8f5f0;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  padding: 1px 6px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+.int-node-actions {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 6px;\n+}\n+.asset-done {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #065f46;\n+}\n+.asset-pending {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #854d0e;\n+}\n+.no-interactive-hint {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #94a3b8;\n+  text-align: center;\n+  padding: 10px 0;\n+}\n+\n+/* 通用按钮 */\n+.btn {\n+  padding: 6px 14px;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  font-weight: 500;\n+  transition: all 0.15s;\n+  border: 1px solid transparent;\n+}\n+.btn-sm {\n+  padding: 5px 12px;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+}\n+.btn-outline {\n+  background: #fff;\n+  border-color: #c6ded6;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.btn-outline:hover {\n+  background: #f0f5f2;\n+}\n+.btn-primary {\n+  background: #2f605a;\n+  color: #fff;\n+}\n+.btn-primary:hover:not(:disabled) {\n+  background: #1e4a44;\n+}\n+.btn-primary:disabled {\n+  opacity: 0.5;\n+  cursor: not-allowed;\n+}\n+.btn:disabled {\n+  opacity: 0.5;\n+  cursor: not-allowed;\n+}\n+\n+/* 步骤导航 */\n+.step-pills {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 6px;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+.pill {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+  color: #5f7467;\n+  background: #f0f5f2;\n+  border: 1px solid #e2ece6;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+  padding: 6px 14px;\n+  text-decoration: none;\n+  transition: all 0.15s;\n+}\n+.pill:hover {\n+  border-color: #5ca68f;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.pill.active {\n+  color: #fff;\n+  background: #2f605a;\n+  border-color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+\n+@media (max-width: 760px) {\n+  .page-header {\n+    flex-direction: column;\n+  }\n+  .gen-control-bar {\n+    flex-direction: column;\n+    align-items: flex-start;\n+  }\n+  .phase-tabs {\n+    overflow-x: auto;\n+  }\n+}\n+.pill.back-pill {\n+  background: #e8f0ed;\n+  border-color: #c6d9d0;\n+  color: #3d6b60;\n+}\n+.pill.back-pill:hover {\n+  background: #d6e8e0;\n+}\n+</style>\ndiff --git a/.rivet/backups/1789137032599/frontend/teacher/src/pages/S3StudioPage.vue b/.rivet/backups/1789137032599/frontend/teacher/src/pages/S3StudioPage.vue\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..1d56060\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/.rivet/backups/1789137032599/frontend/teacher/src/pages/S3StudioPage.vue\n@@ -0,0 +1,1086 @@\n+<template>\n+  <AppShell>\n+    <div class=\"s3-page\">\n+      <!-- 页面头部 -->\n+      <div class=\"page-header\">\n+        <div>\n+          <h2>S3 课件生成</h2>\n+          <p>大纲编辑 → 内容生成 → 页面预览</p>\n+        </div>\n+        <div class=\"page-header-right\">\n+          <div class=\"step-pills\">\n+            <router-link :to=\"{ name: 'S1Intent' }\" class=\"pill\"\n+              >S1 意图</router-link\n+            >\n+            <router-link :to=\"{ name: 'S2Material' }\" class=\"pill\"\n+              >S2 资料</router-link\n+            >\n+            <span class=\"pill active\">S3 生成</span>\n+            <router-link :to=\"{ name: 'S4Version' }\" class=\"pill\"\n+              >S4 版本</router-link\n+            >\n+            <router-link :to=\"{ name: 'Middle' }\" class=\"pill back-pill\"\n+              >返回中间页</router-link\n+            >\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+      </div>\n+\n+      <!-- 模式提示条 -->\n+      <div\n+        v-if=\"generationMode === 'without_evidence'\"\n+        class=\"evidence-warning\"\n+        role=\"status\"\n+      >\n+        <div>\n+          <strong>当前为无参考资料生成模式</strong>\n+          <span>本次内容仅依据 S1 教学意图生成，不会伪造资料引用。</span>\n+        </div>\n+        <router-link :to=\"{ name: 'S2Material' }\">返回补充资料</router-link>\n+      </div>\n+\n+      <!-- S3 阶段指示器 -->\n+      <div class=\"phase-tabs\">\n+        <button\n+          class=\"phase-tab\"\n+          :class=\"{ active: currentPhase === 'outline' }\"\n+          @click=\"currentPhase = 'outline'\"\n+        >\n+          📋 大纲编辑\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          class=\"phase-tab\"\n+          :class=\"{ active: currentPhase === 'generating' }\"\n+          @click=\"currentPhase = 'generating'\"\n+          :disabled=\"!outlineStore.isConfirmed\"\n+        >\n+          ⚙️ 内容生成\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          class=\"phase-tab\"\n+          :class=\"{ active: currentPhase === 'pages' }\"\n+          @click=\"currentPhase = 'pages'\"\n+          :disabled=\"!generationStore.lastGenId\"\n+        >\n+          📄 页面管理\n+        </button>\n+      </div>\n+\n+      <!-- ==================== 大纲阶段 ==================== -->\n+      <div v-if=\"currentPhase === 'outline'\" class=\"phase-panel\">\n+        <OutlineEditor\n+          ref=\"outlineEditorRef\"\n+          :session-id=\"intentStore.sessionId\"\n+          :intent-id=\"intentStore.intentId\"\n+          :intent-summary=\"intentStore.intentSummary\"\n+          :auto-restore=\"true\"\n+          @confirm-complete=\"handleOutlineConfirmed\"\n+          @outline-created=\"handleOutlineCreated\"\n+          @error=\"handleError\"\n+        />\n+      </div>\n+\n+      <!-- ==================== 内容生成阶段 ==================== -->\n+      <div v-else-if=\"currentPhase === 'generating'\" class=\"phase-panel\">\n+        <!-- 生成控制栏 -->\n+        <div class=\"gen-control-bar\">\n+          <div class=\"gen-info\">\n+            <span class=\"gen-label\">大纲</span>\n+            <span class=\"gen-value\"\n+              >{{ outlineStore.outline_id }} v{{\n+                outlineStore.outline_version\n+              }}</span\n+            >\n+            <span class=\"gen-label\" style=\"margin-left: 12px\">生成模式</span>\n+            <select v-model=\"generateMode\" class=\"gen-mode-select\">\n+              <option value=\"page_incremental\">逐页增量生成</option>\n+              <option value=\"page_parallel\">全页面并行生成</option>\n+            </select>\n+          </div>\n+          <div class=\"gen-actions\">\n+            <button\n+              class=\"btn btn-primary\"\n+              :disabled=\"generationStore.isGenerating\"\n+              @click=\"handleStartGeneration\"\n+            >\n+              {{ generationStore.isGenerating ? \"生成中...\" : \"🚀 开始生成\" }}\n+            </button>\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+\n+        <!-- 进度展示 -->\n+        <div\n+          v-if=\"\n+            generationStore.isGenerating || generationStore.generateProgress > 0\n+          \"\n+          class=\"gen-progress-panel\"\n+        >\n+          <div class=\"progress-bar-wrap\">\n+            <div\n+              class=\"progress-bar-fill\"\n+              :style=\"{ width: generationStore.generateProgress + '%' }\"\n+            ></div>\n+          </div>\n+          <div class=\"progress-text\">\n+            <span>{{ generationStore.generateProgress }}%</span>\n+            <span>{{ generationStore.generateStageText }}</span>\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+\n+        <!-- 错误展示 -->\n+        <div v-if=\"genError\" class=\"error-bar\" role=\"alert\">{{ genError }}</div>\n+\n+        <!-- 生成的节点树预览 -->\n+        <div\n+          v-if=\"generationStore.currentScriptNodes.length > 0\"\n+          class=\"gen-nodes-preview\"\n+        >\n+          <h4>已生成节点</h4>\n+          <div class=\"nodes-summary\">\n+            <span\n+              v-for=\"(node, i) in generationStore.currentScriptNodes\"\n+              :key=\"i\"\n+              class=\"node-chip\"\n+            >\n+              {{ i + 1 }}.\n+              {{ node.title || node.node_title || \"节点\" + (i + 1) }}\n+            </span>\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+\n+        <!-- HTML5 预览区 -->\n+        <div v-if=\"generationStore.previewHtml\" class=\"preview-section\">\n+          <div class=\"preview-toolbar\">\n+            <span>📺 HTML5 预览</span>\n+            <button class=\"btn btn-sm\" @click=\"openPreviewWindow\">\n+              新窗口打开\n+            </button>\n+          </div>\n+          <iframe\n+            v-if=\"previewFrameSrc\"\n+            :src=\"previewFrameSrc\"\n+            class=\"preview-frame\"\n+            sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"\n+            title=\"课件预览\"\n+          ></iframe>\n+          <div v-else class=\"preview-placeholder\">\n+            预览将在生成完成后自动加载\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+\n+        <!-- 无参考资料提示 -->\n+        <div v-if=\"!hasEvidence\" class=\"no-evidence-hint\">\n+          ⚠️ 当前无参考资料，内容将基于 S1 意图自动生成。\n+          <router-link :to=\"{ name: 'S2Material' }\"\n+            >前往 S2 补充资料</router-link\n+          >\n+        </div>\n+\n+        <!-- 生成完成后操作 -->\n+        <div\n+          v-if=\"generationStore.generateProgress === 100\"\n+          class=\"gen-complete-actions\"\n+        >\n+          <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" @click=\"currentPhase = 'pages'\">\n+            管理生成页面\n+          </button>\n+          <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" @click=\"goToS4\">\n+            下一步：版本管理 →\n+          </button>\n+        </div>\n+      </div>\n+\n+      <!-- ==================== 页面管理阶段 ==================== -->\n+      <div v-else-if=\"currentPhase === 'pages'\" class=\"phase-panel\">\n+        <div class=\"pages-control-bar\">\n+          <div class=\"pages-info\">\n+            <span>Generation ID：{{ generationStore.lastGenId }}</span>\n+          </div>\n+          <div class=\"pages-actions\">\n+            <button class=\"btn btn-sm\" @click=\"loadGenerationStatus\">\n+              🔄 刷新状态\n+            </button>\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+\n+        <!-- 页面列表 -->\n+        <div v-if=\"generationPages.length > 0\" class=\"pages-list\">\n+          <div\n+            v-for=\"page in generationPages\"\n+            :key=\"page.page_id\"\n+            class=\"page-item\"\n+            :class=\"`page-status-${page.status}`\"\n+          >\n+            <div class=\"page-item-left\">\n+              <span class=\"page-order\">第 {{ page.page_order }} 页</span>\n+              <span class=\"page-node\">关联节点：{{ page.node_id }}</span>\n+            </div>\n+            <div class=\"page-item-right\">\n+              <span class=\"page-status-badge\">{{\n+                statusLabel(page.status)\n+              }}</span>\n+              <button\n+                v-if=\"page.status === 'failed'\"\n+                class=\"btn btn-sm\"\n+                :disabled=\"regeneratingPageId === page.page_id\"\n+                @click=\"handleRegeneratePage(page)\"\n+              >\n+                {{\n+                  regeneratingPageId === page.page_id\n+                    ? \"重生成中...\"\n+                    : \"🔄 重试\"\n+                }}\n+              </button>\n+              <button\n+                v-if=\"page.status === 'done'\"\n+                class=\"btn btn-sm\"\n+                @click=\"handlePreviewPage(page)\"\n+              >\n+                👁 预览\n+              </button>\n+            </div>\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+\n+        <div v-else class=\"pages-empty\">暂无页面数据，请先生成内容</div>\n+\n+        <!-- 互动资源入口 -->\n+        <div v-if=\"generationStore.lastGenId\" class=\"interactive-section\">\n+          <h4>🎮 互动资源管理</h4>\n+          <p class=\"interactive-hint\">\n+            从大纲中标记为互动的节点可在此生成 HTML5 互动资源\n+          </p>\n+          <div class=\"interactive-node-list\">\n+            <div\n+              v-for=\"node in interactiveNodes\"\n+              :key=\"node.node_id\"\n+              class=\"interactive-node-row\"\n+            >\n+              <div class=\"int-node-info\">\n+                <span class=\"int-node-title\">{{ node.title }}</span>\n+                <span class=\"int-node-type\">{{ node.node_type }}</span>\n+              </div>\n+              <div class=\"int-node-actions\">\n+                <template v-if=\"interactiveStore.hasAsset(node.node_id)\">\n+                  <span class=\"asset-done\">✅ 已生成</span>\n+                  <button\n+                    class=\"btn btn-sm\"\n+                    @click=\"openInteractiveAsset(node)\"\n+                  >\n+                    打开\n+                  </button>\n+                </template>\n+                <template\n+                  v-else-if=\"\n+                    interactiveStore.getAsset(node.node_id)?.status ===\n+                    'processing'\n+                  \"\n+                >\n+                  <span class=\"asset-pending\">⏳ 生成中...</span>\n+                </template>\n+                <template v-else>\n+                  <button\n+                    class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\"\n+                    :disabled=\"interactiveStore.loading\"\n+                    @click=\"handleGenerateInteractive(node)\"\n+                  >\n+                    生成互动\n+                  </button>\n+                </template>\n+              </div>\n+            </div>\n+            <p v-if=\"interactiveNodes.length === 0\" class=\"no-interactive-hint\">\n+              大纲中无互动节点，可在编辑大纲时将节点类型改为\"互动环节\"\n+            </p>\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+      </div>\n+    </div>\n+  </AppShell>\n+</template>\n+\n+<script setup>\n+import { ref, computed, onMounted, watch } from \"vue\";\n+import AppShell from \"../components/layout/AppShell.vue\";\n+import OutlineEditor from \"../components/teacher/OutlineEditor.vue\";\n+import { useGenerationStore } from \"../stores/generationStore\";\n+import { useOutlineStore } from \"../stores/outlineStore\";\n+import { useInteractiveStore } from \"../stores/interactiveStore\";\n+import { useIntentStore } from \"../stores/intentStore\";\n+import { teacherV1Api } from \"../services/v1\";\n+import { API_BASE, AI_API_BASE } from \"../config/api\";\n+\n+const generationStore = useGenerationStore();\n+const outlineStore = useOutlineStore();\n+const interactiveStore = useInteractiveStore();\n+const intentStore = useIntentStore();\n+\n+// 阶段：outline | generating | pages\n+const currentPhase = ref(\"outline\");\n+const generationMode = ref(\"\");\n+const generateMode = ref(\"page_incremental\");\n+const genError = ref(\"\");\n+const generationPages = ref([]);\n+const regeneratingPageId = ref(\"\");\n+const previewFrameSrc = ref(\"\");\n+\n+// 是否有参考资料\n+const hasEvidence = computed(() => {\n+  try {\n+    const raw = window.localStorage.getItem(\"fuww_s2_evidence_packet\");\n+    return !!raw;\n+  } catch {\n+    return false;\n+  }\n+});\n+\n+// 需要互动资源的节点（大纲中标记为 interactive / quiz 的节点）\n+const interactiveNodes = computed(() =>\n+  (outlineStore.nodes || []).filter(\n+    (n) => n.node_type === \"interactive\" || n.node_type === \"quiz\",\n+  ),\n+);\n+\n+onMounted(async () => {\n+  // 恢复 S1 会话/意图（刷新或直接进入 S3 时 store 内存为空，\n+  // 不恢复会导致 sessionId 缺失 → AI 生成大纲被 \"缺少 session_id\" 拦截）\n+  intentStore.initialize();\n+  if (typeof window !== \"undefined\") {\n+    generationMode.value =\n+      window.localStorage.getItem(\n+        `fuww_s2_generation_mode:${intentStore.sessionId}`,\n+      ) || \"\";\n+  }\n+  // 尝试从 localStorage 恢复大纲\n+  const restored = outlineStore.restore();\n+  if (restored && outlineStore.isConfirmed) {\n+    currentPhase.value = \"generating\";\n+  }\n+  // 恢复最近生成记录\n+  generationStore.restoreLastGenId();\n+  if (generationStore.lastGenId) {\n+    interactiveStore.setGenerationId(generationStore.lastGenId);\n+    await loadGenerationStatus();\n+  }\n+});\n+\n+function statusLabel(status) {\n+  return (\n+    {\n+      pending: \"等待\",\n+      processing: \"生成中\",\n+      done: \"完成\",\n+      failed: \"失败\",\n+    }[status] || status\n+  );\n+}\n+\n+// 大纲创建完成\n+function handleOutlineCreated({ outline_id, outline_version }) {\n+  console.log(\n+    \"[S3StudioPage] 大纲创建完成:\",\n+    outline_id,\n+    \"v\" + outline_version,\n+  );\n+}\n+\n+// 大纲确认完成，进入生成阶段\n+function handleOutlineConfirmed() {\n+  currentPhase.value = \"generating\";\n+}\n+\n+// 开始生成内容\n+async function handleStartGeneration() {\n+  if (!outlineStore.outline_id || !outlineStore.isConfirmed) {\n+    handleError(\"请先确认大纲\");\n+    return;\n+  }\n+  genError.value = \"\";\n+  generationStore.setGenerating(true);\n+  generationStore.setGenerateProgress(5, \"准备生成环境\");\n+\n+  try {\n+    let evidence = null;\n+    try {\n+      const raw = window.localStorage.getItem(\"fuww_s2_evidence_packet\");\n+      if (raw) evidence = JSON.parse(raw);\n+    } catch {}\n+\n+    generationStore.setGenerateProgress(15, \"创建生成任务\");\n+    const resp = await teacherV1Api.generation.createGeneration({\n+      session_id: intentStore.sessionId,\n+      outline_id: outlineStore.outline_id,\n+      outline_version: outlineStore.outline_version,\n+      outline_confirmed: true,\n+      template_id: \"default\",\n+      generate_mode: generateMode.value,\n+      intent: intentStore.intentSummary || undefined,\n+      evidence_packet: evidence,\n+    });\n+\n+    const task = resp?.data || resp || {};\n+    const taskId = task.task_id || task.generation_id;\n+    if (!taskId) throw new Error(\"未返回生成任务 ID\");\n+    generationStore.setLastTaskId(taskId);\n+\n+    // 记录 generation_id\n+    const genId = task.generation_id || taskId;\n+    generationStore.setLastGenId(genId);\n+    interactiveStore.setGenerationId(genId);\n+\n+    generationStore.setGenerateProgress(25, \"正在生成内容\");\n+    const status = await generationStore.waitForCoursewareGeneration(taskId, {\n+      intervalMs: 800,\n+      maxAttempts: 300,\n+    });\n+\n+    // 加载生成状态（页面列表）\n+    await loadGenerationStatus();\n+\n+    // 渲染预览\n+    generationStore.setGenerateProgress(92, \"正在加载预览\");\n+    const html = await generationStore.renderCoursewarePreview(\n+      outlineStore.title || intentStore.intentSummary?.topic || \"课件预览\",\n+      { genId },\n+    );\n+    if (html) {\n+      previewFrameSrc.value = `data:text/html;charset=utf-8,${encodeURIComponent(html)}`;\n+    }\n+\n+    generationStore.setGenerateProgress(100, \"生成完成\");\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    genError.value = err?.message || \"生成失败，请重试\";\n+    generationStore.setGenerateProgress(0, \"生成失败\");\n+  } finally {\n+    generationStore.setGenerating(false);\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+// 加载生成状态\n+async function loadGenerationStatus() {\n+  const taskId = generationStore.lastTaskId || generationStore.restoreLastTaskId();\n+  if (!taskId) return;\n+  try {\n+    const resp = await teacherV1Api.generation.getGenerationStatus(taskId);\n+    const data = resp?.data || resp || {};\n+    generationPages.value = (Array.isArray(data.nodes) ? data.nodes : []).map((node, index) => ({\n+      ...node,\n+      page_id: node.page_id || node.node_id || `page_${index + 1}`,\n+      page_order: Number(node.page_order || node.order || index + 1),\n+      status: node.status || 'completed'\n+    }));\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    console.warn(\"[S3StudioPage] 加载生成状态失败\", err);\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+// 单页重生成\n+async function handleRegeneratePage(page) {\n+  regeneratingPageId.value = page.page_id;\n+  try {\n+    await teacherV1Api.generation.regeneratePage(\n+      generationStore.lastGenId,\n+      page.page_id,\n+      { reason: \"教师手动重试\", mode: \"ai\" },\n+    );\n+    await loadGenerationStatus();\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    handleError(\"重生成失败: \" + (err?.message || \"\"));\n+  } finally {\n+    regeneratingPageId.value = \"\";\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+// 预览单页\n+async function handlePreviewPage(page) {\n+  try {\n+    const resp = await teacherV1Api.generation.getPage(\n+      generationStore.lastGenId,\n+      page.page_id,\n+    );\n+    const data = resp?.data || resp || {};\n+    if (data.preview_url) {\n+      window.open(data.preview_url, \"_blank\");\n+    }\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    handleError(\"预览加载失败\");\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+// 生成互动资源\n+async function handleGenerateInteractive(node) {\n+  if (!generationStore.lastGenId) return;\n+  try {\n+    await interactiveStore.generateInteractive({\n+      generation_id: generationStore.lastGenId,\n+      node_id: node.node_id,\n+      interactive_plan: node.interactive_plan || {\n+        enabled: true,\n+        kind: \"quiz\",\n+        question_count: 3,\n+        duration_minutes: 5,\n+        auto_grading: true,\n+        delivery: \"html5_link\",\n+      },\n+    });\n+    await interactiveStore.pollAssetStatus(node.node_id);\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    handleError(\"生成互动资源失败: \" + (err?.message || \"\"));\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+// 打开互动资源\n+function openInteractiveAsset(node) {\n+  const asset = interactiveStore.getAsset(node.node_id);\n+  if (asset?.entry_url) {\n+    window.open(asset.entry_url, \"_blank\");\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+// 新窗口打开 HTML5 预览\n+function openPreviewWindow() {\n+  if (!generationStore.previewHtml) return;\n+  const blob = new Blob([generationStore.previewHtml], { type: \"text/html\" });\n+  const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);\n+  window.open(url, \"_blank\");\n+  setTimeout(() => URL.revokeObjectURL(url), 10000);\n+}\n+\n+function goToS4() {\n+  // 同步大纲信息到 localStorage，供 S4 使用\n+  try {\n+    window.localStorage.setItem(\n+      \"fuww_s3_outline_info\",\n+      JSON.stringify({\n+        outline_id: outlineStore.outline_id,\n+        outline_version: outlineStore.outline_version,\n+        generation_id: generationStore.lastGenId,\n+      }),\n+    );\n+  } catch {}\n+  import(\"vue-router\").then(({ useRouter }) => {\n+    const router = useRouter();\n+    router.push({ name: \"S4Version\" });\n+  });\n+}\n+\n+function handleError(msg) {\n+  genError.value = msg;\n+  console.warn(\"[S3StudioPage]\", msg);\n+}\n+</script>\n+\n+<style scoped>\n+.s3-page {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  padding: 20px;\n+  min-height: calc(100vh - 140px);\n+  overflow: hidden;\n+  background:\n+    radial-gradient(\n+      circle at 86% -15%,\n+      rgba(175, 221, 203, 0.2),\n+      transparent 30%\n+    ),\n+    linear-gradient(180deg, #fcfefd 0%, #f7faf8 100%);\n+}\n+.page-header {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: flex-start;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  gap: 16px;\n+  margin-bottom: 14px;\n+}\n+.page-header h2 {\n+  margin: 0;\n+  font-size: 22px;\n+  color: #111827;\n+}\n+.page-header p {\n+  margin: 6px 0 0;\n+  font-size: 14px;\n+  color: #607a71;\n+}\n+.page-header-right {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  justify-content: flex-end;\n+}\n+.page-body {\n+  flex: 1;\n+}\n+.evidence-warning {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  gap: 18px;\n+  margin-bottom: 14px;\n+  padding: 13px 16px;\n+  border: 1px solid #f0d5a8;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+  background: #fffaf0;\n+  color: #7c4a15;\n+}\n+.evidence-warning div {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: baseline;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  min-width: 0;\n+}\n+.evidence-warning strong {\n+  flex-shrink: 0;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+}\n+.evidence-warning span {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  line-height: 1.55;\n+  color: #8a6337;\n+}\n+.evidence-warning a {\n+  flex-shrink: 0;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  font-weight: 700;\n+  text-decoration: none;\n+}\n+\n+/* 阶段选项卡 */\n+.phase-tabs {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 4px;\n+  margin-bottom: 14px;\n+  border-bottom: 2px solid #e2ece6;\n+}\n+.phase-tab {\n+  padding: 8px 18px;\n+  border: none;\n+  background: none;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  font-weight: 500;\n+  color: #607a71;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;\n+  margin-bottom: -2px;\n+  transition: all 0.15s;\n+}\n+.phase-tab:hover:not(:disabled) {\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.phase-tab.active {\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  border-bottom-color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.phase-tab:disabled {\n+  opacity: 0.4;\n+  cursor: not-allowed;\n+}\n+\n+/* 阶段面板 */\n+.phase-panel {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 14px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 生成控制栏 */\n+.gen-control-bar {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  padding: 12px 16px;\n+  background: #f8fbf9;\n+  border: 1px solid #e4ede8;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+}\n+.gen-info {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+.gen-label {\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.gen-value {\n+  color: #475569;\n+}\n+.gen-mode-select {\n+  padding: 4px 8px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 6px;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  background: #fff;\n+  outline: none;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+}\n+.gen-actions {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 进度条 */\n+.gen-progress-panel {\n+  padding: 12px 16px;\n+  background: #f8fbf9;\n+  border: 1px solid #e4ede8;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+}\n+.progress-bar-wrap {\n+  height: 8px;\n+  background: #e2ece6;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+  overflow: hidden;\n+  margin-bottom: 8px;\n+}\n+.progress-bar-fill {\n+  height: 100%;\n+  background: #2f605a;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+  transition: width 0.4s ease;\n+}\n+.progress-text {\n+  display: flex;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #607a71;\n+}\n+\n+/* 错误条 */\n+.error-bar {\n+  padding: 10px 14px;\n+  background: #fef2f2;\n+  border: 1px solid #fecaca;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  color: #dc2626;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 节点预览 */\n+.gen-nodes-preview {\n+  padding: 12px 16px;\n+  background: #f8fbf9;\n+  border: 1px solid #e4ede8;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+}\n+.gen-nodes-preview h4 {\n+  margin: 0 0 8px;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.nodes-summary {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  gap: 6px;\n+}\n+.node-chip {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  background: #e8f5f0;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  padding: 3px 10px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 预览区 */\n+.preview-section {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+.preview-toolbar {\n+  display: flex;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+}\n+.preview-frame {\n+  width: 100%;\n+  height: 480px;\n+  border: 1px solid #e2ece6;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+  background: #fff;\n+}\n+.preview-placeholder {\n+  height: 200px;\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: center;\n+  border: 1px dashed #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+  color: #94a3b8;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 无资料提示 */\n+.no-evidence-hint {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #7c4a15;\n+  background: #fffaf0;\n+  border: 1px solid #f0d5a8;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  padding: 10px 14px;\n+}\n+.no-evidence-hint a {\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+}\n+\n+/* 生成完成操作 */\n+.gen-complete-actions {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  justify-content: flex-end;\n+}\n+\n+/* 页面管理 */\n+.pages-control-bar {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  padding: 10px 14px;\n+  background: #f8fbf9;\n+  border: 1px solid #e4ede8;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+}\n+.pages-info {\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  color: #475569;\n+}\n+.pages-list {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+.page-item {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+  padding: 10px 14px;\n+  background: #fff;\n+  border: 1.5px solid #e2ece6;\n+  border-radius: 10px;\n+}\n+.page-status-done {\n+  border-color: #6ee7b7;\n+}\n+.page-status-failed {\n+  border-color: #fca5a5;\n+}\n+.page-status-processing {\n+  border-color: #fcd34d;\n+}\n+.page-item-left {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+}\n+.page-order {\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.page-node {\n+  color: #64748b;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+}\n+.page-item-right {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+.page-status-badge {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  padding: 2px 8px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+}\n+.page-status-done .page-status-badge {\n+  background: #d1fae5;\n+  color: #065f46;\n+}\n+.page-status-failed .page-status-badge {\n+  background: #fee2e2;\n+  color: #991b1b;\n+}\n+.page-status-processing .page-status-badge {\n+  background: #fef9c3;\n+  color: #854d0e;\n+}\n+.page-status-pending .page-status-badge {\n+  background: #f3f4f6;\n+  color: #6b7280;\n+}\n+.pages-empty {\n+  text-align: center;\n+  padding: 40px;\n+  color: #94a3b8;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 互动资源 */\n+.interactive-section {\n+  padding: 14px 16px;\n+  background: #fff;\n+  border: 1px solid #e4ede8;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+}\n+.interactive-section h4 {\n+  margin: 0 0 6px;\n+  font-size: 14px;\n+  color: #1e293b;\n+}\n+.interactive-hint {\n+  margin: 0 0 12px;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #64748b;\n+}\n+.interactive-node-list {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+.interactive-node-row {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+  padding: 8px 12px;\n+  background: #f8fbf9;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+}\n+.int-node-info {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+.int-node-title {\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  color: #1e293b;\n+}\n+.int-node-type {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  background: #e8f5f0;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  padding: 1px 6px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+.int-node-actions {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 6px;\n+}\n+.asset-done {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #065f46;\n+}\n+.asset-pending {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #854d0e;\n+}\n+.no-interactive-hint {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #94a3b8;\n+  text-align: center;\n+  padding: 10px 0;\n+}\n+\n+/* 通用按钮 */\n+.btn {\n+  padding: 6px 14px;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  font-weight: 500;\n+  transition: all 0.15s;\n+  border: 1px solid transparent;\n+}\n+.btn-sm {\n+  padding: 5px 12px;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+}\n+.btn-outline {\n+  background: #fff;\n+  border-color: #c6ded6;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.btn-outline:hover {\n+  background: #f0f5f2;\n+}\n+.btn-primary {\n+  background: #2f605a;\n+  color: #fff;\n+}\n+.btn-primary:hover:not(:disabled) {\n+  background: #1e4a44;\n+}\n+.btn-primary:disabled {\n+  opacity: 0.5;\n+  cursor: not-allowed;\n+}\n+.btn:disabled {\n+  opacity: 0.5;\n+  cursor: not-allowed;\n+}\n+\n+/* 步骤导航 */\n+.step-pills {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 6px;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+.pill {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+  color: #5f7467;\n+  background: #f0f5f2;\n+  border: 1px solid #e2ece6;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+  padding: 6px 14px;\n+  text-decoration: none;\n+  transition: all 0.15s;\n+}\n+.pill:hover {\n+  border-color: #5ca68f;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.pill.active {\n+  color: #fff;\n+  background: #2f605a;\n+  border-color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+\n+@media (max-width: 760px) {\n+  .page-header {\n+    flex-direction: column;\n+  }\n+  .gen-control-bar {\n+    flex-direction: column;\n+    align-items: flex-start;\n+  }\n+  .phase-tabs {\n+    overflow-x: auto;\n+  }\n+}\n+.pill.back-pill {\n+  background: #e8f0ed;\n+  border-color: #c6d9d0;\n+  color: #3d6b60;\n+}\n+.pill.back-pill:hover {\n+  background: #d6e8e0;\n+}\n+</style>\ndiff --git a/.rivet/backups/1789137078157/frontend/teacher/src/pages/S3StudioPage.vue b/.rivet/backups/1789137078157/frontend/teacher/src/pages/S3StudioPage.vue\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..b0ad59b\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/.rivet/backups/1789137078157/frontend/teacher/src/pages/S3StudioPage.vue\n@@ -0,0 +1,1107 @@\n+<template>\n+  <AppShell>\n+    <div class=\"s3-page\">\n+      <!-- 页面头部 -->\n+      <div class=\"page-header\">\n+        <div>\n+          <h2>S3 课件生成</h2>\n+          <p>大纲编辑 → 内容生成 → 页面预览</p>\n+        </div>\n+        <div class=\"page-header-right\">\n+          <div class=\"step-pills\">\n+            <router-link :to=\"{ name: 'S1Intent' }\" class=\"pill\"\n+              >S1 意图</router-link\n+            >\n+            <router-link :to=\"{ name: 'S2Material' }\" class=\"pill\"\n+              >S2 资料</router-link\n+            >\n+            <span class=\"pill active\">S3 生成</span>\n+            <router-link :to=\"{ name: 'S4Version' }\" class=\"pill\"\n+              >S4 版本</router-link\n+            >\n+            <router-link :to=\"{ name: 'Middle' }\" class=\"pill back-pill\"\n+              >返回中间页</router-link\n+            >\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+      </div>\n+\n+      <!-- 模式提示条 -->\n+      <div\n+        v-if=\"generationMode === 'without_evidence'\"\n+        class=\"evidence-warning\"\n+        role=\"status\"\n+      >\n+        <div>\n+          <strong>当前为无参考资料生成模式</strong>\n+          <span>本次内容仅依据 S1 教学意图生成，不会伪造资料引用。</span>\n+        </div>\n+        <router-link :to=\"{ name: 'S2Material' }\">返回补充资料</router-link>\n+      </div>\n+\n+      <!-- S3 阶段指示器 -->\n+      <div class=\"phase-tabs\">\n+        <button\n+          class=\"phase-tab\"\n+          :class=\"{ active: currentPhase === 'outline' }\"\n+          @click=\"currentPhase = 'outline'\"\n+        >\n+          📋 大纲编辑\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          class=\"phase-tab\"\n+          :class=\"{ active: currentPhase === 'generating' }\"\n+          @click=\"currentPhase = 'generating'\"\n+          :disabled=\"!outlineStore.isConfirmed\"\n+        >\n+          ⚙️ 内容生成\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          class=\"phase-tab\"\n+          :class=\"{ active: currentPhase === 'pages' }\"\n+          @click=\"currentPhase = 'pages'\"\n+          :disabled=\"!generationStore.lastGenId\"\n+        >\n+          📄 页面管理\n+        </button>\n+      </div>\n+\n+      <!-- ==================== 大纲阶段 ==================== -->\n+      <div v-if=\"currentPhase === 'outline'\" class=\"phase-panel\">\n+        <OutlineEditor\n+          ref=\"outlineEditorRef\"\n+          :session-id=\"intentStore.sessionId\"\n+          :intent-id=\"intentStore.intentId\"\n+          :intent-summary=\"intentStore.intentSummary\"\n+          :auto-restore=\"true\"\n+          @confirm-complete=\"handleOutlineConfirmed\"\n+          @outline-created=\"handleOutlineCreated\"\n+          @error=\"handleError\"\n+        />\n+      </div>\n+\n+      <!-- ==================== 内容生成阶段 ==================== -->\n+      <div v-else-if=\"currentPhase === 'generating'\" class=\"phase-panel\">\n+        <!-- 生成控制栏 -->\n+        <div class=\"gen-control-bar\">\n+          <div class=\"gen-info\">\n+            <span class=\"gen-label\">大纲</span>\n+            <span class=\"gen-value\"\n+              >{{ outlineStore.outline_id }} v{{\n+                outlineStore.outline_version\n+              }}</span\n+            >\n+            <span class=\"gen-label\" style=\"margin-left: 12px\">生成模式</span>\n+            <select v-model=\"generateMode\" class=\"gen-mode-select\">\n+              <option value=\"page_incremental\">逐页增量生成</option>\n+              <option value=\"page_parallel\">全页面并行生成</option>\n+            </select>\n+          </div>\n+          <div class=\"gen-actions\">\n+            <button\n+              class=\"btn btn-primary\"\n+              :disabled=\"generationStore.isGenerating\"\n+              @click=\"handleStartGeneration\"\n+            >\n+              {{ generationStore.isGenerating ? \"生成中...\" : \"🚀 开始生成\" }}\n+            </button>\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+\n+        <!-- 进度展示 -->\n+        <div\n+          v-if=\"\n+            generationStore.isGenerating || generationStore.generateProgress > 0\n+          \"\n+          class=\"gen-progress-panel\"\n+        >\n+          <div class=\"progress-bar-wrap\">\n+            <div\n+              class=\"progress-bar-fill\"\n+              :style=\"{ width: generationStore.generateProgress + '%' }\"\n+            ></div>\n+          </div>\n+          <div class=\"progress-text\">\n+            <span>{{ generationStore.generateProgress }}%</span>\n+            <span>{{ generationStore.generateStageText }}</span>\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+\n+        <!-- 错误展示 -->\n+        <div v-if=\"genError\" class=\"error-bar\" role=\"alert\">{{ genError }}</div>\n+\n+        <!-- 生成的节点树预览 -->\n+        <div\n+          v-if=\"generationStore.currentScriptNodes.length > 0\"\n+          class=\"gen-nodes-preview\"\n+        >\n+          <h4>已生成节点</h4>\n+          <div class=\"nodes-summary\">\n+            <span\n+              v-for=\"(node, i) in generationStore.currentScriptNodes\"\n+              :key=\"i\"\n+              class=\"node-chip\"\n+            >\n+              {{ i + 1 }}.\n+              {{ node.title || node.node_title || \"节点\" + (i + 1) }}\n+            </span>\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+\n+        <!-- HTML5 预览区 -->\n+        <div v-if=\"generationStore.previewHtml\" class=\"preview-section\">\n+          <div class=\"preview-toolbar\">\n+            <span>📺 HTML5 预览</span>\n+            <button class=\"btn btn-sm\" @click=\"openPreviewWindow\">\n+              新窗口打开\n+            </button>\n+          </div>\n+          <iframe\n+            v-if=\"previewFrameSrc\"\n+            :src=\"previewFrameSrc\"\n+            class=\"preview-frame\"\n+            sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"\n+            title=\"课件预览\"\n+          ></iframe>\n+          <div v-else class=\"preview-placeholder\">\n+            预览将在生成完成后自动加载\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+\n+        <!-- 无参考资料提示 -->\n+        <div v-if=\"!hasEvidence\" class=\"no-evidence-hint\">\n+          ⚠️ 当前无参考资料，内容将基于 S1 意图自动生成。\n+          <router-link :to=\"{ name: 'S2Material' }\"\n+            >前往 S2 补充资料</router-link\n+          >\n+        </div>\n+\n+        <!-- 生成完成后操作 -->\n+        <div\n+          v-if=\"generationStore.generateProgress === 100\"\n+          class=\"gen-complete-actions\"\n+        >\n+          <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" @click=\"currentPhase = 'pages'\">\n+            管理生成页面\n+          </button>\n+          <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" @click=\"goToS4\">\n+            下一步：版本管理 →\n+          </button>\n+        </div>\n+      </div>\n+\n+      <!-- ==================== 页面管理阶段 ==================== -->\n+      <div v-else-if=\"currentPhase === 'pages'\" class=\"phase-panel\">\n+        <div class=\"pages-control-bar\">\n+          <div class=\"pages-info\">\n+            <span>Generation ID：{{ generationStore.lastGenId }}</span>\n+          </div>\n+          <div class=\"pages-actions\">\n+            <button class=\"btn btn-sm\" @click=\"loadGenerationStatus\">\n+              🔄 刷新状态\n+            </button>\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+\n+        <!-- 页面列表 -->\n+        <div v-if=\"generationPages.length > 0\" class=\"pages-list\">\n+          <div\n+            v-for=\"page in generationPages\"\n+            :key=\"page.page_id\"\n+            class=\"page-item\"\n+            :class=\"`page-status-${page.status}`\"\n+          >\n+            <div class=\"page-item-left\">\n+              <span class=\"page-order\">第 {{ page.page_order }} 页</span>\n+              <span class=\"page-node\">关联节点：{{ page.node_id }}</span>\n+            </div>\n+            <div class=\"page-item-right\">\n+              <span class=\"page-status-badge\">{{\n+                statusLabel(page.status)\n+              }}</span>\n+              <button\n+                v-if=\"page.status === 'failed'\"\n+                class=\"btn btn-sm\"\n+                :disabled=\"regeneratingPageId === page.page_id\"\n+                @click=\"handleRegeneratePage(page)\"\n+              >\n+                {{\n+                  regeneratingPageId === page.page_id\n+                    ? \"重生成中...\"\n+                    : \"🔄 重试\"\n+                }}\n+              </button>\n+              <button\n+                v-if=\"page.status === 'done'\"\n+                class=\"btn btn-sm\"\n+                @click=\"handlePreviewPage(page)\"\n+              >\n+                👁 预览\n+              </button>\n+            </div>\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+\n+        <div v-else class=\"pages-empty\">暂无页面数据，请先生成内容</div>\n+\n+        <!-- 互动资源入口 -->\n+        <div v-if=\"generationStore.lastGenId\" class=\"interactive-section\">\n+          <h4>🎮 互动资源管理</h4>\n+          <p class=\"interactive-hint\">\n+            从大纲中标记为互动的节点可在此生成 HTML5 互动资源\n+          </p>\n+          <div class=\"interactive-node-list\">\n+            <div\n+              v-for=\"node in interactiveNodes\"\n+              :key=\"node.node_id\"\n+              class=\"interactive-node-row\"\n+            >\n+              <div class=\"int-node-info\">\n+                <span class=\"int-node-title\">{{ node.title }}</span>\n+                <span class=\"int-node-type\">{{ node.node_type }}</span>\n+              </div>\n+              <div class=\"int-node-actions\">\n+                <template v-if=\"interactiveStore.hasAsset(node.node_id)\">\n+                  <span class=\"asset-done\">✅ 已生成</span>\n+                  <button\n+                    class=\"btn btn-sm\"\n+                    @click=\"openInteractiveAsset(node)\"\n+                  >\n+                    打开\n+                  </button>\n+                </template>\n+                <template\n+                  v-else-if=\"\n+                    interactiveStore.getAsset(node.node_id)?.status ===\n+                    'processing'\n+                  \"\n+                >\n+                  <span class=\"asset-pending\">⏳ 生成中...</span>\n+                </template>\n+                <template v-else>\n+                  <button\n+                    class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\"\n+                    :disabled=\"interactiveStore.loading\"\n+                    @click=\"handleGenerateInteractive(node)\"\n+                  >\n+                    生成互动\n+                  </button>\n+                </template>\n+              </div>\n+            </div>\n+            <p v-if=\"interactiveNodes.length === 0\" class=\"no-interactive-hint\">\n+              大纲中无互动节点，可在编辑大纲时将节点类型改为\"互动环节\"\n+            </p>\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+      </div>\n+    </div>\n+  </AppShell>\n+</template>\n+\n+<script setup>\n+import { ref, computed, onMounted, watch } from \"vue\";\n+import AppShell from \"../components/layout/AppShell.vue\";\n+import OutlineEditor from \"../components/teacher/OutlineEditor.vue\";\n+import { useGenerationStore } from \"../stores/generationStore\";\n+import { useOutlineStore } from \"../stores/outlineStore\";\n+import { useInteractiveStore } from \"../stores/interactiveStore\";\n+import { useIntentStore } from \"../stores/intentStore\";\n+import { teacherV1Api } from \"../services/v1\";\n+import { API_BASE, AI_API_BASE } from \"../config/api\";\n+\n+const generationStore = useGenerationStore();\n+const outlineStore = useOutlineStore();\n+const interactiveStore = useInteractiveStore();\n+const intentStore = useIntentStore();\n+\n+// 阶段：outline | generating | pages\n+const currentPhase = ref(\"outline\");\n+const generationMode = ref(\"\");\n+const generateMode = ref(\"page_incremental\");\n+const genError = ref(\"\");\n+const generationPages = ref([]);\n+const regeneratingPageId = ref(\"\");\n+const previewFrameSrc = ref(\"\");\n+// 大纲编辑器实例——用于在启动生成前强制把本地编辑落库\n+const outlineEditorRef = ref(null);\n+\n+/**\n+ * 进入生成阶段前落库保障。\n+ *\n+ * 根因：后端 generation_handler.go:40 在 outline_confirmed 时用\n+ * GetConfirmed 读取「存储版本」的节点，并以其 Nodes 覆盖请求里的 req.OutlineNodes(D:49)。\n+ * 前端只把编辑写进 localStorage 而不落库时，本地新增/排序的节点在生成与页面管理阶段\n+ * 会静默消失（用户实测：手动添加节点内容无法传递到内容生成和页面管理）。\n+ */\n+async function ensureOutlinePersisted() {\n+  const editor = outlineEditorRef.value;\n+  if (!editor?.persistIfDirty) return false;\n+  try {\n+    return await editor.persistIfDirty();\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    handleError(\"大纲保存失败：\" + (err?.message || \"\"));\n+    return false;\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+// 是否有参考资料\n+const hasEvidence = computed(() => {\n+  try {\n+    const raw = window.localStorage.getItem(\"fuww_s2_evidence_packet\");\n+    return !!raw;\n+  } catch {\n+    return false;\n+  }\n+});\n+\n+// 需要互动资源的节点（大纲中标记为 interactive / quiz 的节点）\n+const interactiveNodes = computed(() =>\n+  (outlineStore.nodes || []).filter(\n+    (n) => n.node_type === \"interactive\" || n.node_type === \"quiz\",\n+  ),\n+);\n+\n+onMounted(async () => {\n+  // 恢复 S1 会话/意图（刷新或直接进入 S3 时 store 内存为空，\n+  // 不恢复会导致 sessionId 缺失 → AI 生成大纲被 \"缺少 session_id\" 拦截）\n+  intentStore.initialize();\n+  if (typeof window !== \"undefined\") {\n+    generationMode.value =\n+      window.localStorage.getItem(\n+        `fuww_s2_generation_mode:${intentStore.sessionId}`,\n+      ) || \"\";\n+  }\n+  // 尝试从 localStorage 恢复大纲\n+  const restored = outlineStore.restore();\n+  if (restored && outlineStore.isConfirmed) {\n+    currentPhase.value = \"generating\";\n+  }\n+  // 恢复最近生成记录\n+  generationStore.restoreLastGenId();\n+  if (generationStore.lastGenId) {\n+    interactiveStore.setGenerationId(generationStore.lastGenId);\n+    await loadGenerationStatus();\n+  }\n+});\n+\n+function statusLabel(status) {\n+  return (\n+    {\n+      pending: \"等待\",\n+      processing: \"生成中\",\n+      done: \"完成\",\n+      failed: \"失败\",\n+    }[status] || status\n+  );\n+}\n+\n+// 大纲创建完成\n+function handleOutlineCreated({ outline_id, outline_version }) {\n+  console.log(\n+    \"[S3StudioPage] 大纲创建完成:\",\n+    outline_id,\n+    \"v\" + outline_version,\n+  );\n+}\n+\n+// 大纲确认完成，进入生成阶段\n+function handleOutlineConfirmed() {\n+  currentPhase.value = \"generating\";\n+}\n+\n+// 开始生成内容\n+async function handleStartGeneration() {\n+  if (!outlineStore.outline_id || !outlineStore.isConfirmed) {\n+    handleError(\"请先确认大纲\");\n+    return;\n+  }\n+  genError.value = \"\";\n+  generationStore.setGenerating(true);\n+  generationStore.setGenerateProgress(5, \"准备生成环境\");\n+\n+  try {\n+    let evidence = null;\n+    try {\n+      const raw = window.localStorage.getItem(\"fuww_s2_evidence_packet\");\n+      if (raw) evidence = JSON.parse(raw);\n+    } catch {}\n+\n+    generationStore.setGenerateProgress(15, \"创建生成任务\");\n+    const resp = await teacherV1Api.generation.createGeneration({\n+      session_id: intentStore.sessionId,\n+      outline_id: outlineStore.outline_id,\n+      outline_version: outlineStore.outline_version,\n+      outline_confirmed: true,\n+      template_id: \"default\",\n+      generate_mode: generateMode.value,\n+      intent: intentStore.intentSummary || undefined,\n+      evidence_packet: evidence,\n+    });\n+\n+    const task = resp?.data || resp || {};\n+    const taskId = task.task_id || task.generation_id;\n+    if (!taskId) throw new Error(\"未返回生成任务 ID\");\n+    generationStore.setLastTaskId(taskId);\n+\n+    // 记录 generation_id\n+    const genId = task.generation_id || taskId;\n+    generationStore.setLastGenId(genId);\n+    interactiveStore.setGenerationId(genId);\n+\n+    generationStore.setGenerateProgress(25, \"正在生成内容\");\n+    const status = await generationStore.waitForCoursewareGeneration(taskId, {\n+      intervalMs: 800,\n+      maxAttempts: 300,\n+    });\n+\n+    // 加载生成状态（页面列表）\n+    await loadGenerationStatus();\n+\n+    // 渲染预览\n+    generationStore.setGenerateProgress(92, \"正在加载预览\");\n+    const html = await generationStore.renderCoursewarePreview(\n+      outlineStore.title || intentStore.intentSummary?.topic || \"课件预览\",\n+      { genId },\n+    );\n+    if (html) {\n+      previewFrameSrc.value = `data:text/html;charset=utf-8,${encodeURIComponent(html)}`;\n+    }\n+\n+    generationStore.setGenerateProgress(100, \"生成完成\");\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    genError.value = err?.message || \"生成失败，请重试\";\n+    generationStore.setGenerateProgress(0, \"生成失败\");\n+  } finally {\n+    generationStore.setGenerating(false);\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+// 加载生成状态\n+async function loadGenerationStatus() {\n+  const taskId = generationStore.lastTaskId || generationStore.restoreLastTaskId();\n+  if (!taskId) return;\n+  try {\n+    const resp = await teacherV1Api.generation.getGenerationStatus(taskId);\n+    const data = resp?.data || resp || {};\n+    generationPages.value = (Array.isArray(data.nodes) ? data.nodes : []).map((node, index) => ({\n+      ...node,\n+      page_id: node.page_id || node.node_id || `page_${index + 1}`,\n+      page_order: Number(node.page_order || node.order || index + 1),\n+      status: node.status || 'completed'\n+    }));\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    console.warn(\"[S3StudioPage] 加载生成状态失败\", err);\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+// 单页重生成\n+async function handleRegeneratePage(page) {\n+  regeneratingPageId.value = page.page_id;\n+  try {\n+    await teacherV1Api.generation.regeneratePage(\n+      generationStore.lastGenId,\n+      page.page_id,\n+      { reason: \"教师手动重试\", mode: \"ai\" },\n+    );\n+    await loadGenerationStatus();\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    handleError(\"重生成失败: \" + (err?.message || \"\"));\n+  } finally {\n+    regeneratingPageId.value = \"\";\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+// 预览单页\n+async function handlePreviewPage(page) {\n+  try {\n+    const resp = await teacherV1Api.generation.getPage(\n+      generationStore.lastGenId,\n+      page.page_id,\n+    );\n+    const data = resp?.data || resp || {};\n+    if (data.preview_url) {\n+      window.open(data.preview_url, \"_blank\");\n+    }\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    handleError(\"预览加载失败\");\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+// 生成互动资源\n+async function handleGenerateInteractive(node) {\n+  if (!generationStore.lastGenId) return;\n+  try {\n+    await interactiveStore.generateInteractive({\n+      generation_id: generationStore.lastGenId,\n+      node_id: node.node_id,\n+      interactive_plan: node.interactive_plan || {\n+        enabled: true,\n+        kind: \"quiz\",\n+        question_count: 3,\n+        duration_minutes: 5,\n+        auto_grading: true,\n+        delivery: \"html5_link\",\n+      },\n+    });\n+    await interactiveStore.pollAssetStatus(node.node_id);\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    handleError(\"生成互动资源失败: \" + (err?.message || \"\"));\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+// 打开互动资源\n+function openInteractiveAsset(node) {\n+  const asset = interactiveStore.getAsset(node.node_id);\n+  if (asset?.entry_url) {\n+    window.open(asset.entry_url, \"_blank\");\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+// 新窗口打开 HTML5 预览\n+function openPreviewWindow() {\n+  if (!generationStore.previewHtml) return;\n+  const blob = new Blob([generationStore.previewHtml], { type: \"text/html\" });\n+  const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);\n+  window.open(url, \"_blank\");\n+  setTimeout(() => URL.revokeObjectURL(url), 10000);\n+}\n+\n+function goToS4() {\n+  // 同步大纲信息到 localStorage，供 S4 使用\n+  try {\n+    window.localStorage.setItem(\n+      \"fuww_s3_outline_info\",\n+      JSON.stringify({\n+        outline_id: outlineStore.outline_id,\n+        outline_version: outlineStore.outline_version,\n+        generation_id: generationStore.lastGenId,\n+      }),\n+    );\n+  } catch {}\n+  import(\"vue-router\").then(({ useRouter }) => {\n+    const router = useRouter();\n+    router.push({ name: \"S4Version\" });\n+  });\n+}\n+\n+function handleError(msg) {\n+  genError.value = msg;\n+  console.warn(\"[S3StudioPage]\", msg);\n+}\n+</script>\n+\n+<style scoped>\n+.s3-page {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  padding: 20px;\n+  min-height: calc(100vh - 140px);\n+  overflow: hidden;\n+  background:\n+    radial-gradient(\n+      circle at 86% -15%,\n+      rgba(175, 221, 203, 0.2),\n+      transparent 30%\n+    ),\n+    linear-gradient(180deg, #fcfefd 0%, #f7faf8 100%);\n+}\n+.page-header {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: flex-start;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  gap: 16px;\n+  margin-bottom: 14px;\n+}\n+.page-header h2 {\n+  margin: 0;\n+  font-size: 22px;\n+  color: #111827;\n+}\n+.page-header p {\n+  margin: 6px 0 0;\n+  font-size: 14px;\n+  color: #607a71;\n+}\n+.page-header-right {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  justify-content: flex-end;\n+}\n+.page-body {\n+  flex: 1;\n+}\n+.evidence-warning {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  gap: 18px;\n+  margin-bottom: 14px;\n+  padding: 13px 16px;\n+  border: 1px solid #f0d5a8;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+  background: #fffaf0;\n+  color: #7c4a15;\n+}\n+.evidence-warning div {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: baseline;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  min-width: 0;\n+}\n+.evidence-warning strong {\n+  flex-shrink: 0;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+}\n+.evidence-warning span {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  line-height: 1.55;\n+  color: #8a6337;\n+}\n+.evidence-warning a {\n+  flex-shrink: 0;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  font-weight: 700;\n+  text-decoration: none;\n+}\n+\n+/* 阶段选项卡 */\n+.phase-tabs {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 4px;\n+  margin-bottom: 14px;\n+  border-bottom: 2px solid #e2ece6;\n+}\n+.phase-tab {\n+  padding: 8px 18px;\n+  border: none;\n+  background: none;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  font-weight: 500;\n+  color: #607a71;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;\n+  margin-bottom: -2px;\n+  transition: all 0.15s;\n+}\n+.phase-tab:hover:not(:disabled) {\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.phase-tab.active {\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  border-bottom-color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.phase-tab:disabled {\n+  opacity: 0.4;\n+  cursor: not-allowed;\n+}\n+\n+/* 阶段面板 */\n+.phase-panel {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 14px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 生成控制栏 */\n+.gen-control-bar {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  padding: 12px 16px;\n+  background: #f8fbf9;\n+  border: 1px solid #e4ede8;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+}\n+.gen-info {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+.gen-label {\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.gen-value {\n+  color: #475569;\n+}\n+.gen-mode-select {\n+  padding: 4px 8px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 6px;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  background: #fff;\n+  outline: none;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+}\n+.gen-actions {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 进度条 */\n+.gen-progress-panel {\n+  padding: 12px 16px;\n+  background: #f8fbf9;\n+  border: 1px solid #e4ede8;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+}\n+.progress-bar-wrap {\n+  height: 8px;\n+  background: #e2ece6;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+  overflow: hidden;\n+  margin-bottom: 8px;\n+}\n+.progress-bar-fill {\n+  height: 100%;\n+  background: #2f605a;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+  transition: width 0.4s ease;\n+}\n+.progress-text {\n+  display: flex;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #607a71;\n+}\n+\n+/* 错误条 */\n+.error-bar {\n+  padding: 10px 14px;\n+  background: #fef2f2;\n+  border: 1px solid #fecaca;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  color: #dc2626;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 节点预览 */\n+.gen-nodes-preview {\n+  padding: 12px 16px;\n+  background: #f8fbf9;\n+  border: 1px solid #e4ede8;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+}\n+.gen-nodes-preview h4 {\n+  margin: 0 0 8px;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.nodes-summary {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  gap: 6px;\n+}\n+.node-chip {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  background: #e8f5f0;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  padding: 3px 10px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 预览区 */\n+.preview-section {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+.preview-toolbar {\n+  display: flex;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+}\n+.preview-frame {\n+  width: 100%;\n+  height: 480px;\n+  border: 1px solid #e2ece6;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+  background: #fff;\n+}\n+.preview-placeholder {\n+  height: 200px;\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: center;\n+  border: 1px dashed #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+  color: #94a3b8;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 无资料提示 */\n+.no-evidence-hint {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #7c4a15;\n+  background: #fffaf0;\n+  border: 1px solid #f0d5a8;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  padding: 10px 14px;\n+}\n+.no-evidence-hint a {\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+}\n+\n+/* 生成完成操作 */\n+.gen-complete-actions {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  justify-content: flex-end;\n+}\n+\n+/* 页面管理 */\n+.pages-control-bar {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  padding: 10px 14px;\n+  background: #f8fbf9;\n+  border: 1px solid #e4ede8;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+}\n+.pages-info {\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  color: #475569;\n+}\n+.pages-list {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+.page-item {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+  padding: 10px 14px;\n+  background: #fff;\n+  border: 1.5px solid #e2ece6;\n+  border-radius: 10px;\n+}\n+.page-status-done {\n+  border-color: #6ee7b7;\n+}\n+.page-status-failed {\n+  border-color: #fca5a5;\n+}\n+.page-status-processing {\n+  border-color: #fcd34d;\n+}\n+.page-item-left {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+}\n+.page-order {\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.page-node {\n+  color: #64748b;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+}\n+.page-item-right {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+.page-status-badge {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  padding: 2px 8px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+}\n+.page-status-done .page-status-badge {\n+  background: #d1fae5;\n+  color: #065f46;\n+}\n+.page-status-failed .page-status-badge {\n+  background: #fee2e2;\n+  color: #991b1b;\n+}\n+.page-status-processing .page-status-badge {\n+  background: #fef9c3;\n+  color: #854d0e;\n+}\n+.page-status-pending .page-status-badge {\n+  background: #f3f4f6;\n+  color: #6b7280;\n+}\n+.pages-empty {\n+  text-align: center;\n+  padding: 40px;\n+  color: #94a3b8;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 互动资源 */\n+.interactive-section {\n+  padding: 14px 16px;\n+  background: #fff;\n+  border: 1px solid #e4ede8;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+}\n+.interactive-section h4 {\n+  margin: 0 0 6px;\n+  font-size: 14px;\n+  color: #1e293b;\n+}\n+.interactive-hint {\n+  margin: 0 0 12px;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #64748b;\n+}\n+.interactive-node-list {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+.interactive-node-row {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+  padding: 8px 12px;\n+  background: #f8fbf9;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+}\n+.int-node-info {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+.int-node-title {\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  color: #1e293b;\n+}\n+.int-node-type {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  background: #e8f5f0;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  padding: 1px 6px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+.int-node-actions {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 6px;\n+}\n+.asset-done {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #065f46;\n+}\n+.asset-pending {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #854d0e;\n+}\n+.no-interactive-hint {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #94a3b8;\n+  text-align: center;\n+  padding: 10px 0;\n+}\n+\n+/* 通用按钮 */\n+.btn {\n+  padding: 6px 14px;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  font-weight: 500;\n+  transition: all 0.15s;\n+  border: 1px solid transparent;\n+}\n+.btn-sm {\n+  padding: 5px 12px;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+}\n+.btn-outline {\n+  background: #fff;\n+  border-color: #c6ded6;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.btn-outline:hover {\n+  background: #f0f5f2;\n+}\n+.btn-primary {\n+  background: #2f605a;\n+  color: #fff;\n+}\n+.btn-primary:hover:not(:disabled) {\n+  background: #1e4a44;\n+}\n+.btn-primary:disabled {\n+  opacity: 0.5;\n+  cursor: not-allowed;\n+}\n+.btn:disabled {\n+  opacity: 0.5;\n+  cursor: not-allowed;\n+}\n+\n+/* 步骤导航 */\n+.step-pills {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 6px;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+.pill {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+  color: #5f7467;\n+  background: #f0f5f2;\n+  border: 1px solid #e2ece6;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+  padding: 6px 14px;\n+  text-decoration: none;\n+  transition: all 0.15s;\n+}\n+.pill:hover {\n+  border-color: #5ca68f;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.pill.active {\n+  color: #fff;\n+  background: #2f605a;\n+  border-color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+\n+@media (max-width: 760px) {\n+  .page-header {\n+    flex-direction: column;\n+  }\n+  .gen-control-bar {\n+    flex-direction: column;\n+    align-items: flex-start;\n+  }\n+  .phase-tabs {\n+    overflow-x: auto;\n+  }\n+}\n+.pill.back-pill {\n+  background: #e8f0ed;\n+  border-color: #c6d9d0;\n+  color: #3d6b60;\n+}\n+.pill.back-pill:hover {\n+  background: #d6e8e0;\n+}\n+</style>\ndiff --git a/.rivet/backups/1789137107206/frontend/teacher/src/pages/S3StudioPage.vue b/.rivet/backups/1789137107206/frontend/teacher/src/pages/S3StudioPage.vue\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..576728b\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/.rivet/backups/1789137107206/frontend/teacher/src/pages/S3StudioPage.vue\n@@ -0,0 +1,1121 @@\n+<template>\n+  <AppShell>\n+    <div class=\"s3-page\">\n+      <!-- 页面头部 -->\n+      <div class=\"page-header\">\n+        <div>\n+          <h2>S3 课件生成</h2>\n+          <p>大纲编辑 → 内容生成 → 页面预览</p>\n+        </div>\n+        <div class=\"page-header-right\">\n+          <div class=\"step-pills\">\n+            <router-link :to=\"{ name: 'S1Intent' }\" class=\"pill\"\n+              >S1 意图</router-link\n+            >\n+            <router-link :to=\"{ name: 'S2Material' }\" class=\"pill\"\n+              >S2 资料</router-link\n+            >\n+            <span class=\"pill active\">S3 生成</span>\n+            <router-link :to=\"{ name: 'S4Version' }\" class=\"pill\"\n+              >S4 版本</router-link\n+            >\n+            <router-link :to=\"{ name: 'Middle' }\" class=\"pill back-pill\"\n+              >返回中间页</router-link\n+            >\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+      </div>\n+\n+      <!-- 模式提示条 -->\n+      <div\n+        v-if=\"generationMode === 'without_evidence'\"\n+        class=\"evidence-warning\"\n+        role=\"status\"\n+      >\n+        <div>\n+          <strong>当前为无参考资料生成模式</strong>\n+          <span>本次内容仅依据 S1 教学意图生成，不会伪造资料引用。</span>\n+        </div>\n+        <router-link :to=\"{ name: 'S2Material' }\">返回补充资料</router-link>\n+      </div>\n+\n+      <!-- S3 阶段指示器 -->\n+      <div class=\"phase-tabs\">\n+        <button\n+          class=\"phase-tab\"\n+          :class=\"{ active: currentPhase === 'outline' }\"\n+          @click=\"currentPhase = 'outline'\"\n+        >\n+          📋 大纲编辑\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          class=\"phase-tab\"\n+          :class=\"{ active: currentPhase === 'generating' }\"\n+          @click=\"currentPhase = 'generating'\"\n+          :disabled=\"!outlineStore.isConfirmed\"\n+        >\n+          ⚙️ 内容生成\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          class=\"phase-tab\"\n+          :class=\"{ active: currentPhase === 'pages' }\"\n+          @click=\"currentPhase = 'pages'\"\n+          :disabled=\"!generationStore.lastGenId\"\n+        >\n+          📄 页面管理\n+        </button>\n+      </div>\n+\n+      <!-- ==================== 大纲阶段 ==================== -->\n+      <div v-if=\"currentPhase === 'outline'\" class=\"phase-panel\">\n+        <OutlineEditor\n+          ref=\"outlineEditorRef\"\n+          :session-id=\"intentStore.sessionId\"\n+          :intent-id=\"intentStore.intentId\"\n+          :intent-summary=\"intentStore.intentSummary\"\n+          :auto-restore=\"true\"\n+          @confirm-complete=\"handleOutlineConfirmed\"\n+          @outline-created=\"handleOutlineCreated\"\n+          @error=\"handleError\"\n+        />\n+      </div>\n+\n+      <!-- ==================== 内容生成阶段 ==================== -->\n+      <div v-else-if=\"currentPhase === 'generating'\" class=\"phase-panel\">\n+        <!-- 生成控制栏 -->\n+        <div class=\"gen-control-bar\">\n+          <div class=\"gen-info\">\n+            <span class=\"gen-label\">大纲</span>\n+            <span class=\"gen-value\"\n+              >{{ outlineStore.outline_id }} v{{\n+                outlineStore.outline_version\n+              }}</span\n+            >\n+            <span class=\"gen-label\" style=\"margin-left: 12px\">生成模式</span>\n+            <select v-model=\"generateMode\" class=\"gen-mode-select\">\n+              <option value=\"page_incremental\">逐页增量生成</option>\n+              <option value=\"page_parallel\">全页面并行生成</option>\n+            </select>\n+          </div>\n+          <div class=\"gen-actions\">\n+            <button\n+              class=\"btn btn-primary\"\n+              :disabled=\"generationStore.isGenerating\"\n+              @click=\"handleStartGeneration\"\n+            >\n+              {{ generationStore.isGenerating ? \"生成中...\" : \"🚀 开始生成\" }}\n+            </button>\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+\n+        <!-- 进度展示 -->\n+        <div\n+          v-if=\"\n+            generationStore.isGenerating || generationStore.generateProgress > 0\n+          \"\n+          class=\"gen-progress-panel\"\n+        >\n+          <div class=\"progress-bar-wrap\">\n+            <div\n+              class=\"progress-bar-fill\"\n+              :style=\"{ width: generationStore.generateProgress + '%' }\"\n+            ></div>\n+          </div>\n+          <div class=\"progress-text\">\n+            <span>{{ generationStore.generateProgress }}%</span>\n+            <span>{{ generationStore.generateStageText }}</span>\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+\n+        <!-- 错误展示 -->\n+        <div v-if=\"genError\" class=\"error-bar\" role=\"alert\">{{ genError }}</div>\n+\n+        <!-- 生成的节点树预览 -->\n+        <div\n+          v-if=\"generationStore.currentScriptNodes.length > 0\"\n+          class=\"gen-nodes-preview\"\n+        >\n+          <h4>已生成节点</h4>\n+          <div class=\"nodes-summary\">\n+            <span\n+              v-for=\"(node, i) in generationStore.currentScriptNodes\"\n+              :key=\"i\"\n+              class=\"node-chip\"\n+            >\n+              {{ i + 1 }}.\n+              {{ node.title || node.node_title || \"节点\" + (i + 1) }}\n+            </span>\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+\n+        <!-- HTML5 预览区 -->\n+        <div v-if=\"generationStore.previewHtml\" class=\"preview-section\">\n+          <div class=\"preview-toolbar\">\n+            <span>📺 HTML5 预览</span>\n+            <button class=\"btn btn-sm\" @click=\"openPreviewWindow\">\n+              新窗口打开\n+            </button>\n+          </div>\n+          <iframe\n+            v-if=\"previewFrameSrc\"\n+            :src=\"previewFrameSrc\"\n+            class=\"preview-frame\"\n+            sandbox=\"allow-scripts allow-same-origin\"\n+            title=\"课件预览\"\n+          ></iframe>\n+          <div v-else class=\"preview-placeholder\">\n+            预览将在生成完成后自动加载\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+\n+        <!-- 无参考资料提示 -->\n+        <div v-if=\"!hasEvidence\" class=\"no-evidence-hint\">\n+          ⚠️ 当前无参考资料，内容将基于 S1 意图自动生成。\n+          <router-link :to=\"{ name: 'S2Material' }\"\n+            >前往 S2 补充资料</router-link\n+          >\n+        </div>\n+\n+        <!-- 生成完成后操作 -->\n+        <div\n+          v-if=\"generationStore.generateProgress === 100\"\n+          class=\"gen-complete-actions\"\n+        >\n+          <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" @click=\"currentPhase = 'pages'\">\n+            管理生成页面\n+          </button>\n+          <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" @click=\"goToS4\">\n+            下一步：版本管理 →\n+          </button>\n+        </div>\n+      </div>\n+\n+      <!-- ==================== 页面管理阶段 ==================== -->\n+      <div v-else-if=\"currentPhase === 'pages'\" class=\"phase-panel\">\n+        <div class=\"pages-control-bar\">\n+          <div class=\"pages-info\">\n+            <span>Generation ID：{{ generationStore.lastGenId }}</span>\n+          </div>\n+          <div class=\"pages-actions\">\n+            <button class=\"btn btn-sm\" @click=\"loadGenerationStatus\">\n+              🔄 刷新状态\n+            </button>\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+\n+        <!-- 页面列表 -->\n+        <div v-if=\"generationPages.length > 0\" class=\"pages-list\">\n+          <div\n+            v-for=\"page in generationPages\"\n+            :key=\"page.page_id\"\n+            class=\"page-item\"\n+            :class=\"`page-status-${page.status}`\"\n+          >\n+            <div class=\"page-item-left\">\n+              <span class=\"page-order\">第 {{ page.page_order }} 页</span>\n+              <span class=\"page-node\">关联节点：{{ page.node_id }}</span>\n+            </div>\n+            <div class=\"page-item-right\">\n+              <span class=\"page-status-badge\">{{\n+                statusLabel(page.status)\n+              }}</span>\n+              <button\n+                v-if=\"page.status === 'failed'\"\n+                class=\"btn btn-sm\"\n+                :disabled=\"regeneratingPageId === page.page_id\"\n+                @click=\"handleRegeneratePage(page)\"\n+              >\n+                {{\n+                  regeneratingPageId === page.page_id\n+                    ? \"重生成中...\"\n+                    : \"🔄 重试\"\n+                }}\n+              </button>\n+              <button\n+                v-if=\"page.status === 'done'\"\n+                class=\"btn btn-sm\"\n+                @click=\"handlePreviewPage(page)\"\n+              >\n+                👁 预览\n+              </button>\n+            </div>\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+\n+        <div v-else class=\"pages-empty\">暂无页面数据，请先生成内容</div>\n+\n+        <!-- 互动资源入口 -->\n+        <div v-if=\"generationStore.lastGenId\" class=\"interactive-section\">\n+          <h4>🎮 互动资源管理</h4>\n+          <p class=\"interactive-hint\">\n+            从大纲中标记为互动的节点可在此生成 HTML5 互动资源\n+          </p>\n+          <div class=\"interactive-node-list\">\n+            <div\n+              v-for=\"node in interactiveNodes\"\n+              :key=\"node.node_id\"\n+              class=\"interactive-node-row\"\n+            >\n+              <div class=\"int-node-info\">\n+                <span class=\"int-node-title\">{{ node.title }}</span>\n+                <span class=\"int-node-type\">{{ node.node_type }}</span>\n+              </div>\n+              <div class=\"int-node-actions\">\n+                <template v-if=\"interactiveStore.hasAsset(node.node_id)\">\n+                  <span class=\"asset-done\">✅ 已生成</span>\n+                  <button\n+                    class=\"btn btn-sm\"\n+                    @click=\"openInteractiveAsset(node)\"\n+                  >\n+                    打开\n+                  </button>\n+                </template>\n+                <template\n+                  v-else-if=\"\n+                    interactiveStore.getAsset(node.node_id)?.status ===\n+                    'processing'\n+                  \"\n+                >\n+                  <span class=\"asset-pending\">⏳ 生成中...</span>\n+                </template>\n+                <template v-else>\n+                  <button\n+                    class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\"\n+                    :disabled=\"interactiveStore.loading\"\n+                    @click=\"handleGenerateInteractive(node)\"\n+                  >\n+                    生成互动\n+                  </button>\n+                </template>\n+              </div>\n+            </div>\n+            <p v-if=\"interactiveNodes.length === 0\" class=\"no-interactive-hint\">\n+              大纲中无互动节点，可在编辑大纲时将节点类型改为\"互动环节\"\n+            </p>\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+      </div>\n+    </div>\n+  </AppShell>\n+</template>\n+\n+<script setup>\n+import { ref, computed, onMounted, watch } from \"vue\";\n+import AppShell from \"../components/layout/AppShell.vue\";\n+import OutlineEditor from \"../components/teacher/OutlineEditor.vue\";\n+import { useGenerationStore } from \"../stores/generationStore\";\n+import { useOutlineStore } from \"../stores/outlineStore\";\n+import { useInteractiveStore } from \"../stores/interactiveStore\";\n+import { useIntentStore } from \"../stores/intentStore\";\n+import { teacherV1Api } from \"../services/v1\";\n+import { API_BASE, AI_API_BASE } from \"../config/api\";\n+\n+const generationStore = useGenerationStore();\n+const outlineStore = useOutlineStore();\n+const interactiveStore = useInteractiveStore();\n+const intentStore = useIntentStore();\n+\n+// 阶段：outline | generating | pages\n+const currentPhase = ref(\"outline\");\n+const generationMode = ref(\"\");\n+const generateMode = ref(\"page_incremental\");\n+const genError = ref(\"\");\n+const generationPages = ref([]);\n+const regeneratingPageId = ref(\"\");\n+const previewFrameSrc = ref(\"\");\n+// 大纲编辑器实例——用于在启动生成前强制把本地编辑落库\n+const outlineEditorRef = ref(null);\n+\n+/**\n+ * 进入生成阶段前落库保障。\n+ *\n+ * 根因：后端 generation_handler.go:40 在 outline_confirmed 时用\n+ * GetConfirmed 读取「存储版本」的节点，并以其 Nodes 覆盖请求里的 req.OutlineNodes(D:49)。\n+ * 前端只把编辑写进 localStorage 而不落库时，本地新增/排序的节点在生成与页面管理阶段\n+ * 会静默消失（用户实测：手动添加节点内容无法传递到内容生成和页面管理）。\n+ */\n+async function ensureOutlinePersisted() {\n+  const editor = outlineEditorRef.value;\n+  if (!editor?.persistIfDirty) return false;\n+  try {\n+    const saved = await editor.persistIfDirty();\n+    if (saved && !outlineStore.isConfirmed) {\n+      // 后端 SaveOutlineVersion 把新版本置为 draft（规范 §2.3：confirmed 大纲被修改则旧版 superseded），\n+      // 必须重新确认，否则生成链路 GetConfirmed 会以「必须使用后端已确认的大纲版本」409 拒绝。\n+      await outlineStore.confirmOutline();\n+    }\n+    return saved;\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    handleError(\"大纲保存失败：\" + (err?.message || \"\"));\n+    return false;\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+// 离开大纲阶段前落库：编辑器随后被 v-if 卸载，ref 失效，\n+// 未落库的编辑届时无法再提交，只能带着旧节点进入内容生成。\n+watch(currentPhase, async (next, prev) => {\n+  if (prev === \"outline\" && next !== \"outline\") {\n+    await ensureOutlinePersisted();\n+  }\n+});\n+\n+// 是否有参考资料\n+const hasEvidence = computed(() => {\n+  try {\n+    const raw = window.localStorage.getItem(\"fuww_s2_evidence_packet\");\n+    return !!raw;\n+  } catch {\n+    return false;\n+  }\n+});\n+\n+// 需要互动资源的节点（大纲中标记为 interactive / quiz 的节点）\n+const interactiveNodes = computed(() =>\n+  (outlineStore.nodes || []).filter(\n+    (n) => n.node_type === \"interactive\" || n.node_type === \"quiz\",\n+  ),\n+);\n+\n+onMounted(async () => {\n+  // 恢复 S1 会话/意图（刷新或直接进入 S3 时 store 内存为空，\n+  // 不恢复会导致 sessionId 缺失 → AI 生成大纲被 \"缺少 session_id\" 拦截）\n+  intentStore.initialize();\n+  if (typeof window !== \"undefined\") {\n+    generationMode.value =\n+      window.localStorage.getItem(\n+        `fuww_s2_generation_mode:${intentStore.sessionId}`,\n+      ) || \"\";\n+  }\n+  // 尝试从 localStorage 恢复大纲\n+  const restored = outlineStore.restore();\n+  if (restored && outlineStore.isConfirmed) {\n+    currentPhase.value = \"generating\";\n+  }\n+  // 恢复最近生成记录\n+  generationStore.restoreLastGenId();\n+  if (generationStore.lastGenId) {\n+    interactiveStore.setGenerationId(generationStore.lastGenId);\n+    await loadGenerationStatus();\n+  }\n+});\n+\n+function statusLabel(status) {\n+  return (\n+    {\n+      pending: \"等待\",\n+      processing: \"生成中\",\n+      done: \"完成\",\n+      failed: \"失败\",\n+    }[status] || status\n+  );\n+}\n+\n+// 大纲创建完成\n+function handleOutlineCreated({ outline_id, outline_version }) {\n+  console.log(\n+    \"[S3StudioPage] 大纲创建完成:\",\n+    outline_id,\n+    \"v\" + outline_version,\n+  );\n+}\n+\n+// 大纲确认完成，进入生成阶段\n+function handleOutlineConfirmed() {\n+  currentPhase.value = \"generating\";\n+}\n+\n+// 开始生成内容\n+async function handleStartGeneration() {\n+  if (!outlineStore.outline_id || !outlineStore.isConfirmed) {\n+    handleError(\"请先确认大纲\");\n+    return;\n+  }\n+  genError.value = \"\";\n+  generationStore.setGenerating(true);\n+  generationStore.setGenerateProgress(5, \"准备生成环境\");\n+\n+  try {\n+    let evidence = null;\n+    try {\n+      const raw = window.localStorage.getItem(\"fuww_s2_evidence_packet\");\n+      if (raw) evidence = JSON.parse(raw);\n+    } catch {}\n+\n+    generationStore.setGenerateProgress(15, \"创建生成任务\");\n+    const resp = await teacherV1Api.generation.createGeneration({\n+      session_id: intentStore.sessionId,\n+      outline_id: outlineStore.outline_id,\n+      outline_version: outlineStore.outline_version,\n+      outline_confirmed: true,\n+      template_id: \"default\",\n+      generate_mode: generateMode.value,\n+      intent: intentStore.intentSummary || undefined,\n+      evidence_packet: evidence,\n+    });\n+\n+    const task = resp?.data || resp || {};\n+    const taskId = task.task_id || task.generation_id;\n+    if (!taskId) throw new Error(\"未返回生成任务 ID\");\n+    generationStore.setLastTaskId(taskId);\n+\n+    // 记录 generation_id\n+    const genId = task.generation_id || taskId;\n+    generationStore.setLastGenId(genId);\n+    interactiveStore.setGenerationId(genId);\n+\n+    generationStore.setGenerateProgress(25, \"正在生成内容\");\n+    const status = await generationStore.waitForCoursewareGeneration(taskId, {\n+      intervalMs: 800,\n+      maxAttempts: 300,\n+    });\n+\n+    // 加载生成状态（页面列表）\n+    await loadGenerationStatus();\n+\n+    // 渲染预览\n+    generationStore.setGenerateProgress(92, \"正在加载预览\");\n+    const html = await generationStore.renderCoursewarePreview(\n+      outlineStore.title || intentStore.intentSummary?.topic || \"课件预览\",\n+      { genId },\n+    );\n+    if (html) {\n+      previewFrameSrc.value = `data:text/html;charset=utf-8,${encodeURIComponent(html)}`;\n+    }\n+\n+    generationStore.setGenerateProgress(100, \"生成完成\");\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    genError.value = err?.message || \"生成失败，请重试\";\n+    generationStore.setGenerateProgress(0, \"生成失败\");\n+  } finally {\n+    generationStore.setGenerating(false);\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+// 加载生成状态\n+async function loadGenerationStatus() {\n+  const taskId = generationStore.lastTaskId || generationStore.restoreLastTaskId();\n+  if (!taskId) return;\n+  try {\n+    const resp = await teacherV1Api.generation.getGenerationStatus(taskId);\n+    const data = resp?.data || resp || {};\n+    generationPages.value = (Array.isArray(data.nodes) ? data.nodes : []).map((node, index) => ({\n+      ...node,\n+      page_id: node.page_id || node.node_id || `page_${index + 1}`,\n+      page_order: Number(node.page_order || node.order || index + 1),\n+      status: node.status || 'completed'\n+    }));\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    console.warn(\"[S3StudioPage] 加载生成状态失败\", err);\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+// 单页重生成\n+async function handleRegeneratePage(page) {\n+  regeneratingPageId.value = page.page_id;\n+  try {\n+    await teacherV1Api.generation.regeneratePage(\n+      generationStore.lastGenId,\n+      page.page_id,\n+      { reason: \"教师手动重试\", mode: \"ai\" },\n+    );\n+    await loadGenerationStatus();\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    handleError(\"重生成失败: \" + (err?.message || \"\"));\n+  } finally {\n+    regeneratingPageId.value = \"\";\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+// 预览单页\n+async function handlePreviewPage(page) {\n+  try {\n+    const resp = await teacherV1Api.generation.getPage(\n+      generationStore.lastGenId,\n+      page.page_id,\n+    );\n+    const data = resp?.data || resp || {};\n+    if (data.preview_url) {\n+      window.open(data.preview_url, \"_blank\");\n+    }\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    handleError(\"预览加载失败\");\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+// 生成互动资源\n+async function handleGenerateInteractive(node) {\n+  if (!generationStore.lastGenId) return;\n+  try {\n+    await interactiveStore.generateInteractive({\n+      generation_id: generationStore.lastGenId,\n+      node_id: node.node_id,\n+      interactive_plan: node.interactive_plan || {\n+        enabled: true,\n+        kind: \"quiz\",\n+        question_count: 3,\n+        duration_minutes: 5,\n+        auto_grading: true,\n+        delivery: \"html5_link\",\n+      },\n+    });\n+    await interactiveStore.pollAssetStatus(node.node_id);\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    handleError(\"生成互动资源失败: \" + (err?.message || \"\"));\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+// 打开互动资源\n+function openInteractiveAsset(node) {\n+  const asset = interactiveStore.getAsset(node.node_id);\n+  if (asset?.entry_url) {\n+    window.open(asset.entry_url, \"_blank\");\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+// 新窗口打开 HTML5 预览\n+function openPreviewWindow() {\n+  if (!generationStore.previewHtml) return;\n+  const blob = new Blob([generationStore.previewHtml], { type: \"text/html\" });\n+  const url = URL.createObjectURL(blob);\n+  window.open(url, \"_blank\");\n+  setTimeout(() => URL.revokeObjectURL(url), 10000);\n+}\n+\n+function goToS4() {\n+  // 同步大纲信息到 localStorage，供 S4 使用\n+  try {\n+    window.localStorage.setItem(\n+      \"fuww_s3_outline_info\",\n+      JSON.stringify({\n+        outline_id: outlineStore.outline_id,\n+        outline_version: outlineStore.outline_version,\n+        generation_id: generationStore.lastGenId,\n+      }),\n+    );\n+  } catch {}\n+  import(\"vue-router\").then(({ useRouter }) => {\n+    const router = useRouter();\n+    router.push({ name: \"S4Version\" });\n+  });\n+}\n+\n+function handleError(msg) {\n+  genError.value = msg;\n+  console.warn(\"[S3StudioPage]\", msg);\n+}\n+</script>\n+\n+<style scoped>\n+.s3-page {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  padding: 20px;\n+  min-height: calc(100vh - 140px);\n+  overflow: hidden;\n+  background:\n+    radial-gradient(\n+      circle at 86% -15%,\n+      rgba(175, 221, 203, 0.2),\n+      transparent 30%\n+    ),\n+    linear-gradient(180deg, #fcfefd 0%, #f7faf8 100%);\n+}\n+.page-header {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: flex-start;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  gap: 16px;\n+  margin-bottom: 14px;\n+}\n+.page-header h2 {\n+  margin: 0;\n+  font-size: 22px;\n+  color: #111827;\n+}\n+.page-header p {\n+  margin: 6px 0 0;\n+  font-size: 14px;\n+  color: #607a71;\n+}\n+.page-header-right {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  justify-content: flex-end;\n+}\n+.page-body {\n+  flex: 1;\n+}\n+.evidence-warning {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  gap: 18px;\n+  margin-bottom: 14px;\n+  padding: 13px 16px;\n+  border: 1px solid #f0d5a8;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+  background: #fffaf0;\n+  color: #7c4a15;\n+}\n+.evidence-warning div {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: baseline;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  min-width: 0;\n+}\n+.evidence-warning strong {\n+  flex-shrink: 0;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+}\n+.evidence-warning span {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  line-height: 1.55;\n+  color: #8a6337;\n+}\n+.evidence-warning a {\n+  flex-shrink: 0;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  font-weight: 700;\n+  text-decoration: none;\n+}\n+\n+/* 阶段选项卡 */\n+.phase-tabs {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 4px;\n+  margin-bottom: 14px;\n+  border-bottom: 2px solid #e2ece6;\n+}\n+.phase-tab {\n+  padding: 8px 18px;\n+  border: none;\n+  background: none;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  font-weight: 500;\n+  color: #607a71;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  border-bottom: 2px solid transparent;\n+  margin-bottom: -2px;\n+  transition: all 0.15s;\n+}\n+.phase-tab:hover:not(:disabled) {\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.phase-tab.active {\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  border-bottom-color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.phase-tab:disabled {\n+  opacity: 0.4;\n+  cursor: not-allowed;\n+}\n+\n+/* 阶段面板 */\n+.phase-panel {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 14px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 生成控制栏 */\n+.gen-control-bar {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  padding: 12px 16px;\n+  background: #f8fbf9;\n+  border: 1px solid #e4ede8;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+}\n+.gen-info {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+.gen-label {\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.gen-value {\n+  color: #475569;\n+}\n+.gen-mode-select {\n+  padding: 4px 8px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 6px;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  background: #fff;\n+  outline: none;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+}\n+.gen-actions {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 进度条 */\n+.gen-progress-panel {\n+  padding: 12px 16px;\n+  background: #f8fbf9;\n+  border: 1px solid #e4ede8;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+}\n+.progress-bar-wrap {\n+  height: 8px;\n+  background: #e2ece6;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+  overflow: hidden;\n+  margin-bottom: 8px;\n+}\n+.progress-bar-fill {\n+  height: 100%;\n+  background: #2f605a;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+  transition: width 0.4s ease;\n+}\n+.progress-text {\n+  display: flex;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #607a71;\n+}\n+\n+/* 错误条 */\n+.error-bar {\n+  padding: 10px 14px;\n+  background: #fef2f2;\n+  border: 1px solid #fecaca;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  color: #dc2626;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 节点预览 */\n+.gen-nodes-preview {\n+  padding: 12px 16px;\n+  background: #f8fbf9;\n+  border: 1px solid #e4ede8;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+}\n+.gen-nodes-preview h4 {\n+  margin: 0 0 8px;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.nodes-summary {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  gap: 6px;\n+}\n+.node-chip {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  background: #e8f5f0;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  padding: 3px 10px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 预览区 */\n+.preview-section {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+.preview-toolbar {\n+  display: flex;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+}\n+.preview-frame {\n+  width: 100%;\n+  height: 480px;\n+  border: 1px solid #e2ece6;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+  background: #fff;\n+}\n+.preview-placeholder {\n+  height: 200px;\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: center;\n+  border: 1px dashed #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+  color: #94a3b8;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 无资料提示 */\n+.no-evidence-hint {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #7c4a15;\n+  background: #fffaf0;\n+  border: 1px solid #f0d5a8;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  padding: 10px 14px;\n+}\n+.no-evidence-hint a {\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+}\n+\n+/* 生成完成操作 */\n+.gen-complete-actions {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  justify-content: flex-end;\n+}\n+\n+/* 页面管理 */\n+.pages-control-bar {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  padding: 10px 14px;\n+  background: #f8fbf9;\n+  border: 1px solid #e4ede8;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+}\n+.pages-info {\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  color: #475569;\n+}\n+.pages-list {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+.page-item {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+  padding: 10px 14px;\n+  background: #fff;\n+  border: 1.5px solid #e2ece6;\n+  border-radius: 10px;\n+}\n+.page-status-done {\n+  border-color: #6ee7b7;\n+}\n+.page-status-failed {\n+  border-color: #fca5a5;\n+}\n+.page-status-processing {\n+  border-color: #fcd34d;\n+}\n+.page-item-left {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+}\n+.page-order {\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.page-node {\n+  color: #64748b;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+}\n+.page-item-right {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+.page-status-badge {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  padding: 2px 8px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+}\n+.page-status-done .page-status-badge {\n+  background: #d1fae5;\n+  color: #065f46;\n+}\n+.page-status-failed .page-status-badge {\n+  background: #fee2e2;\n+  color: #991b1b;\n+}\n+.page-status-processing .page-status-badge {\n+  background: #fef9c3;\n+  color: #854d0e;\n+}\n+.page-status-pending .page-status-badge {\n+  background: #f3f4f6;\n+  color: #6b7280;\n+}\n+.pages-empty {\n+  text-align: center;\n+  padding: 40px;\n+  color: #94a3b8;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 互动资源 */\n+.interactive-section {\n+  padding: 14px 16px;\n+  background: #fff;\n+  border: 1px solid #e4ede8;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+}\n+.interactive-section h4 {\n+  margin: 0 0 6px;\n+  font-size: 14px;\n+  color: #1e293b;\n+}\n+.interactive-hint {\n+  margin: 0 0 12px;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #64748b;\n+}\n+.interactive-node-list {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+.interactive-node-row {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+  padding: 8px 12px;\n+  background: #f8fbf9;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+}\n+.int-node-info {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+.int-node-title {\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  color: #1e293b;\n+}\n+.int-node-type {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  background: #e8f5f0;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  padding: 1px 6px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+.int-node-actions {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 6px;\n+}\n+.asset-done {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #065f46;\n+}\n+.asset-pending {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #854d0e;\n+}\n+.no-interactive-hint {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #94a3b8;\n+  text-align: center;\n+  padding: 10px 0;\n+}\n+\n+/* 通用按钮 */\n+.btn {\n+  padding: 6px 14px;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  font-weight: 500;\n+  transition: all 0.15s;\n+  border: 1px solid transparent;\n+}\n+.btn-sm {\n+  padding: 5px 12px;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+}\n+.btn-outline {\n+  background: #fff;\n+  border-color: #c6ded6;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.btn-outline:hover {\n+  background: #f0f5f2;\n+}\n+.btn-primary {\n+  background: #2f605a;\n+  color: #fff;\n+}\n+.btn-primary:hover:not(:disabled) {\n+  background: #1e4a44;\n+}\n+.btn-primary:disabled {\n+  opacity: 0.5;\n+  cursor: not-allowed;\n+}\n+.btn:disabled {\n+  opacity: 0.5;\n+  cursor: not-allowed;\n+}\n+\n+/* 步骤导航 */\n+.step-pills {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 6px;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+.pill {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+  color: #5f7467;\n+  background: #f0f5f2;\n+  border: 1px solid #e2ece6;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+  padding: 6px 14px;\n+  text-decoration: none;\n+  transition: all 0.15s;\n+}\n+.pill:hover {\n+  border-color: #5ca68f;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.pill.active {\n+  color: #fff;\n+  background: #2f605a;\n+  border-color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+\n+@media (max-width: 760px) {\n+  .page-header {\n+    flex-direction: column;\n+  }\n+  .gen-control-bar {\n+    flex-direction: column;\n+    align-items: flex-start;\n+  }\n+  .phase-tabs {\n+    overflow-x: auto;\n+  }\n+}\n+.pill.back-pill {\n+  background: #e8f0ed;\n+  border-color: #c6d9d0;\n+  color: #3d6b60;\n+}\n+.pill.back-pill:hover {\n+  background: #d6e8e0;\n+}\n+</style>\ndiff --git a/.rivet/backups/1789137192663/frontend/teacher/src/components/teacher/OutlineEditor.vue b/.rivet/backups/1789137192663/frontend/teacher/src/components/teacher/OutlineEditor.vue\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..f678eb7\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/.rivet/backups/1789137192663/frontend/teacher/src/components/teacher/OutlineEditor.vue\n@@ -0,0 +1,895 @@\n+<template>\n+  <div class=\"outline-editor\">\n+    <!-- 大纲头部信息 -->\n+    <div class=\"outline-header\">\n+      <div class=\"outline-meta\">\n+        <span class=\"outline-id\" v-if=\"outlineStore.outline_id\">\n+          大纲 ID：{{ outlineStore.outline_id }}\n+        </span>\n+        <span class=\"outline-version\" v-if=\"outlineStore.outline_version\">\n+          v{{ outlineStore.outline_version }}\n+        </span>\n+        <span class=\"outline-status\" :class=\"`status-${outlineStore.status}`\">\n+          {{ statusLabel }}\n+        </span>\n+        <span class=\"outline-duration\">\n+          ⏱ 总计 {{ outlineStore.totalDuration }} 分钟 · {{ outlineStore.nodeCount }} 个节点\n+        </span>\n+      </div>\n+      <div class=\"outline-actions\">\n+        <button\n+          v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-sm\"\n+          :disabled=\"outlineStore.reviseLoading\"\n+          @click=\"showReviseInput = true\"\n+          title=\"发送指令让 AI 修改大纲\"\n+        >\n+          {{ outlineStore.reviseLoading ? 'AI 修订中...' : '🤖 AI 修订' }}\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-sm\"\n+          :disabled=\"outlineStore.loading\"\n+          @click=\"handleSave\"\n+        >\n+          保存大纲\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          v-if=\"outlineStore.isConfirmed\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\"\n+          @click=\"$emit('confirm-complete')\"\n+        >\n+          进入内容生成 →\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          v-else-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit && outlineStore.nodeCount > 0\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-sm btn-primary\"\n+          :disabled=\"outlineStore.loading\"\n+          @click=\"handleConfirm\"\n+        >\n+          {{ outlineStore.loading ? '确认中...' : '确认大纲' }}\n+        </button>\n+      </div>\n+    </div>\n+\n+    <!-- 错误提示 -->\n+    <div v-if=\"outlineStore.error || outlineStore.confirmError\" class=\"error-bar\" role=\"alert\">\n+      {{ outlineStore.confirmError || outlineStore.error }}\n+    </div>\n+\n+    <!-- 未落库提示：内容生成与页面管理读取的是后端存储版本，本地编辑不落库会丢失 -->\n+    <div v-if=\"hasUnsavedEdit\" class=\"unsaved-bar\" role=\"status\">\n+      <span>\n+        有未保存的修改（节点 / 排序 / 知识点）。确认大纲时会自动保存，确保这些改动能进入内容生成与页面管理。\n+      </span>\n+      <button\n+        class=\"btn btn-sm\"\n+        :disabled=\"outlineStore.loading || savingOutline\"\n+        @click=\"handleSave\"\n+      >{{ savingOutline ? '保存中...' : '立即保存' }}</button>\n+    </div>\n+\n+    <!-- 节点编辑器 -->\n+    <div class=\"nodes-list\">\n+      <TransitionGroup name=\"node-list\">\n+        <div\n+          v-for=\"(node, idx) in outlineStore.nodes\"\n+          :key=\"node.node_id\"\n+          class=\"outline-node-card\"\n+          :class=\"`node-type-${node.node_type}`\"\n+        >\n+          <!-- 节点序号 & 移动按钮 -->\n+          <div class=\"node-drag-handle\">\n+            <span class=\"node-order\">{{ idx + 1 }}</span>\n+            <div class=\"node-move-btns\" v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\">\n+              <button\n+                class=\"move-btn\"\n+                :disabled=\"idx === 0\"\n+                @click=\"outlineStore.moveNode(node.node_id, 'up')\"\n+                title=\"上移\"\n+              >↑</button>\n+              <button\n+                class=\"move-btn\"\n+                :disabled=\"idx === outlineStore.nodes.length - 1\"\n+                @click=\"outlineStore.moveNode(node.node_id, 'down')\"\n+                title=\"下移\"\n+              >↓</button>\n+            </div>\n+          </div>\n+\n+          <!-- 节点内容 -->\n+          <div class=\"node-content\">\n+            <div class=\"node-top-row\">\n+              <!-- 节点类型选择 -->\n+              <select\n+                v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+                v-model=\"node.node_type\"\n+                class=\"node-type-select\"\n+                @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { node_type: node.node_type })\"\n+              >\n+                <option value=\"content\">📖 知识讲解</option>\n+                <option value=\"section\">📂 章节标题</option>\n+                <option value=\"quiz\">❓ 随堂测验</option>\n+                <option value=\"interactive\">🎮 互动环节</option>\n+                <option value=\"summary\">📋 总结回顾</option>\n+              </select>\n+              <span v-else class=\"node-type-badge\">{{ node.node_type }}</span>\n+\n+              <!-- 标题 -->\n+              <input\n+                v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+                v-model=\"node.title\"\n+                class=\"node-title-input\"\n+                placeholder=\"节点标题\"\n+                @input=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { title: node.title })\"\n+              />\n+              <div v-else class=\"node-title\">{{ node.title }}</div>\n+            </div>\n+\n+            <!-- 摘要 -->\n+            <textarea\n+              v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+              v-model=\"node.summary\"\n+              class=\"node-summary-input\"\n+              placeholder=\"节点摘要（简述本节点教学内容）\"\n+              rows=\"2\"\n+              @input=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { summary: node.summary })\"\n+            ></textarea>\n+            <p v-else class=\"node-summary\">{{ node.summary }}</p>\n+\n+            <!-- 核心知识点标签 -->\n+            <div class=\"node-key-points\">\n+              <span class=\"kp-label\">核心知识点：</span>\n+              <template v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\">\n+                <div class=\"kp-tags\">\n+                  <span\n+                    v-for=\"(kp, ki) in node.key_points\"\n+                    :key=\"ki\"\n+                    class=\"kp-tag\"\n+                  >\n+                    {{ kp }}\n+                    <button class=\"kp-remove\" @click=\"removeKeyPoint(node, ki)\">×</button>\n+                  </span>\n+                  <input\n+                    v-model=\"newKeyPoints[node.node_id]\"\n+                    class=\"kp-add-input\"\n+                    placeholder=\"+ 添加知识点\"\n+                    @keyup.enter=\"addKeyPoint(node)\"\n+                  />\n+                </div>\n+              </template>\n+              <template v-else>\n+                <span v-for=\"(kp, ki) in node.key_points\" :key=\"ki\" class=\"kp-tag-static\">\n+                  {{ kp }}\n+                </span>\n+              </template>\n+            </div>\n+\n+            <!-- 互动规划（仅 interactive / quiz 类型且有 plan 时显示）\n+                 注意：必须判 interactive_plan 非空——后端/LLM 产出的交互节点该字段常为 null，\n+                 直接访问 interactive_plan.x 会抛错并中断整个节点列表渲染。 -->\n+            <div\n+              v-if=\"(node.node_type === 'interactive' || node.node_type === 'quiz') && node.interactive_plan && outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+              class=\"node-interactive-plan\"\n+            >\n+              <details>\n+                <summary class=\"plan-toggle\">🎯 互动规划</summary>\n+                <div class=\"plan-fields\">\n+                  <label>\n+                    时长（分钟）\n+                    <input\n+                      type=\"number\"\n+                      v-model.number=\"node.interactive_plan.duration_minutes\"\n+                      min=\"1\"\n+                      max=\"60\"\n+                      @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { interactive_plan: { ...node.interactive_plan } })\"\n+                    />\n+                  </label>\n+                  <label>\n+                    题目数量\n+                    <input\n+                      type=\"number\"\n+                      v-model.number=\"node.interactive_plan.question_count\"\n+                      min=\"1\"\n+                      max=\"20\"\n+                      @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { interactive_plan: { ...node.interactive_plan } })\"\n+                    />\n+                  </label>\n+                  <label>\n+                    自动判分\n+                    <input\n+                      type=\"checkbox\"\n+                      v-model=\"node.interactive_plan.auto_grading\"\n+                      @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { interactive_plan: { ...node.interactive_plan } })\"\n+                    />\n+                  </label>\n+                  <label>\n+                    产出方式\n+                    <select v-model=\"node.interactive_plan.delivery\">\n+                      <option value=\"html5_link\">HTML5 链接</option>\n+                      <option value=\"ppt_native\">PPT 内嵌</option>\n+                      <option value=\"standalone_html\">独立 HTML</option>\n+                    </select>\n+                  </label>\n+                </div>\n+              </details>\n+            </div>\n+\n+            <!-- 时长 -->\n+            <div class=\"node-footer\">\n+              <label class=\"duration-label\">\n+                时长\n+                <input\n+                  type=\"number\"\n+                  v-model.number=\"node.estimated_duration_minutes\"\n+                  min=\"1\"\n+                  max=\"180\"\n+                  :disabled=\"!outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+                  class=\"duration-input\"\n+                  @change=\"outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { estimated_duration_minutes: node.estimated_duration_minutes })\"\n+                />\n+                分钟\n+              </label>\n+\n+              <!-- 删除按钮 -->\n+              <button\n+                v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\"\n+                class=\"node-delete-btn\"\n+                @click=\"handleDeleteNode(node.node_id)\"\n+                title=\"删除节点\"\n+              >🗑</button>\n+            </div>\n+          </div>\n+        </div>\n+      </TransitionGroup>\n+\n+      <!-- 添加节点按钮 -->\n+      <div v-if=\"outlineStore.canEdit\" class=\"add-node-row\">\n+        <button class=\"btn btn-outline add-node-btn\" @click=\"handleAddNode\">\n+          ＋ 添加节点\n+        </button>\n+        <button\n+          v-if=\"outlineStore.nodes.length === 0\"\n+          class=\"btn btn-primary\"\n+          @click=\"handleGenerateOutline\"\n+          :disabled=\"outlineStore.loading\"\n+        >\n+          {{ outlineStore.loading ? 'AI 生成中...' : '🤖 AI 生成大纲' }}\n+        </button>\n+      </div>\n+    </div>\n+\n+    <!-- AI 修订对话框 -->\n+    <OutlineRevisionDialog\n+      :visible=\"showReviseDialog\"\n+      :loading=\"revisingDialogLoading\"\n+      :change-summary=\"outlineStore.changeSummary\"\n+      :pending-nodes=\"outlineStore.pendingRevision?.nodes || []\"\n+      @apply=\"handleApplyRevision\"\n+      @cancel=\"handleCancelRevision\"\n+    />\n+\n+    <!-- AI 修订输入弹窗 -->\n+    <div v-if=\"showReviseDialog\" class=\"dialog-overlay\" style=\"display:none\"><!-- 利用 OutlineRevisionDialog --></div>\n+\n+    <!-- 修订指令输入（集成在 OutlineRevisionDialog 之前） -->\n+    <div v-if=\"showReviseInput\" class=\"revise-input-bar\">\n+      <input\n+        v-model=\"reviseMessage\"\n+        class=\"revise-text-input\"\n+        placeholder=\"例如：增加一个生活案例，把课堂练习放到快速排序之后\"\n+        @keyup.enter=\"handleSendRevise\"\n+        autofocus\n+      />\n+      <button class=\"btn btn-primary\" @click=\"handleSendRevise\" :disabled=\"!reviseMessage.trim()\">\n+        发送修订\n+      </button>\n+      <button class=\"btn btn-outline\" @click=\"showReviseInput = false\">取消</button>\n+    </div>\n+  </div>\n+</template>\n+\n+<script setup>\n+import { ref, computed, watch } from 'vue'\n+import { useOutlineStore } from '../../stores/outlineStore'\n+import OutlineRevisionDialog from './OutlineRevisionDialog.vue'\n+\n+const props = defineProps({\n+  /** 所属 session_id（从 S1 透传） */\n+  sessionId: { type: String, default: '' },\n+  /** 所属 intent_id（从 S1 透传） */\n+  intentId: { type: String, default: '' },\n+  /** 教学意图摘要（用于创建大纲） */\n+  intentSummary: { type: Object, default: null },\n+  /** 是否自动尝试从 localStorage 恢复大纲 */\n+  autoRestore: { type: Boolean, default: true }\n+})\n+\n+const emit = defineEmits(['confirm-complete', 'outline-created', 'error'])\n+\n+const outlineStore = useOutlineStore()\n+\n+const showReviseDialog = ref(false)\n+const showReviseInput = ref(false)\n+const reviseMessage = ref('')\n+const revisingDialogLoading = ref(false) // 对话框内 AI 正在生成修订\n+const newKeyPoints = ref({}) // { [node_id]: input value }\n+\n+const statusLabel = computed(() => ({\n+  draft: '草稿',\n+  confirming: '确认中',\n+  confirmed: '已确认',\n+  superseded: '已替代'\n+}[outlineStore.status] || outlineStore.status))\n+\n+// 自动恢复\n+// 最近一次与后端对齐（创建 / 保存 / 确认）时的节点快照签名\n+const lastPersistedSignature = ref('')\n+const savingOutline = ref(false)\n+\n+/** 节点快照签名——用于判断是否存在未落库的本地编辑 */\n+function nodesSignature() {\n+  return JSON.stringify(outlineStore.nodes || [])\n+}\n+\n+/**\n+ * 是否存在未落库的本地编辑（排序 / 增删 / 改字段 / 采纳 AI 修订）。\n+ * 根因：后端生成链路以「存储版本」的节点为准——\n+ * generation_handler.go:40 GetConfirmed 取库中版本，:49 直接以其 Nodes 覆盖 req.OutlineNodes。\n+ * 前端只写 localStorage 不落库时，本地编辑在内容生成与页面管理阶段被静默丢弃\n+ * （表现为：手动添加的节点传不过去、排序在生成后回弹）。\n+ */\n+const hasUnsavedEdit = computed(() => {\n+  if (!outlineStore.outline_id) return false\n+  return nodesSignature() !== lastPersistedSignature.value\n+})\n+\n+/** 标记当前节点已与后端对齐 */\n+function markPersisted() {\n+  lastPersistedSignature.value = nodesSignature()\n+}\n+\n+/**\n+ * 保存会产出新版本，且后端 SaveOutlineVersion 把新版本状态置为 draft\n+ * （修改已确认大纲时旧版转 superseded，新版需重新确认）。\n+ * 前端不同步 status 会误判「仍已确认」，随后生成请求被 GetConfirmed 以 409 拒绝。\n+ */\n+function syncStatusFromSave(data) {\n+  if (data && data.status) outlineStore.status = data.status\n+}\n+\n+/** 落库保障：把本地编辑提交为后端新版本；无改动则跳过（避免无谓的版本链膨胀） */\n+async function persistIfDirty() {\n+  if (!outlineStore.outline_id || !hasUnsavedEdit.value) return false\n+  savingOutline.value = true\n+  try {\n+    const data = await outlineStore.saveVersion()\n+    syncStatusFromSave(data)\n+    markPersisted()\n+    return true\n+  } finally {\n+    savingOutline.value = false\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+// 自动恢复\n+if (props.autoRestore) {\n+  outlineStore.restore()\n+}\n+// 恢复的节点来自本地缓存，作为对齐基线；否则刚进页面就会误报「有未保存的修改」\n+markPersisted()\n+}\n+\n+// 若无大纲且有 intent，自动创建\n+watch(\n+  () => [outlineStore.outline_id, outlineStore.nodes.length],\n+  ([oid, nc]) => {\n+    if (!oid && nc === 0 && props.intentSummary) {\n+      handleGenerateOutline()\n+    }\n+  },\n+  { immediate: true }\n+)\n+\n+async function handleGenerateOutline() {\n+  if (!props.sessionId) {\n+    emit('error', '缺少 session_id，请先完成 S1 意图理解')\n+    return\n+  }\n+  try {\n+    // 尝试从 localStorage 读取证据包\n+    let evidence = null\n+    try {\n+      const raw = window.localStorage.getItem('fuww_s2_evidence_packet')\n+      if (raw) evidence = JSON.parse(raw)\n+    } catch {}\n+    // 尝试从 localStorage 读取 markdown 内容\n+    let markdown = ''\n+    try {\n+      const m = window.localStorage.getItem('fuww_s2_markdown')\n+      if (m) markdown = m\n+    } catch {}\n+\n+    await outlineStore.createOutline({\n+      session_id: props.sessionId,\n+      intent_id: props.intentId,\n+      intent: props.intentSummary || {},\n+      evidence_packet: evidence,\n+      markdown\n+    })\n+    // 创建已落库（createOutline → POST /outlines），作为后续「未保存」判定的对齐基线\n+    markPersisted()\n+    emit('outline-created', {\n+      outline_id: outlineStore.outline_id,\n+      outline_version: outlineStore.outline_version\n+    })\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    emit('error', err?.message || '创建大纲失败')\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+function handleAddNode() {\n+  const lastNodeId = outlineStore.nodes.at(-1)?.node_id || null\n+  outlineStore.addNode(lastNodeId)\n+}\n+\n+function handleDeleteNode(nodeId) {\n+  if (outlineStore.nodes.length <= 1) {\n+    emit('error', '大纲至少需要一个节点')\n+    return\n+  }\n+  outlineStore.removeNode(nodeId)\n+}\n+\n+function addKeyPoint(node) {\n+  const val = (newKeyPoints.value[node.node_id] || '').trim()\n+  if (!val) return\n+  const kps = [...(node.key_points || []), val]\n+  outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { key_points: kps })\n+  newKeyPoints.value[node.node_id] = ''\n+}\n+\n+function removeKeyPoint(node, index) {\n+  const kps = [...(node.key_points || [])]\n+  kps.splice(index, 1)\n+  outlineStore.updateNode(node.node_id, { key_points: kps })\n+}\n+\n+async function handleSave() {\n+  try {\n+    const data = await outlineStore.saveVersion()\n+    // 后端保存产出新版本并重置为 draft，前端必须同步状态，否则后续生成被 409 拒绝\n+    syncStatusFromSave(data)\n+    markPersisted()\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    emit('error', err?.message || '保存大纲失败')\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+async function handleConfirm() {\n+  try {\n+    // 确认前先落库：确认会冻结该版本，未提交的本地编辑（新增节点 / 排序）将永远进不了生成链路\n+    await persistIfDirty()\n+    await outlineStore.confirmOutline()\n+    markPersisted()\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    emit('error', err?.message || '确认大纲失败')\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+async function handleSendRevise() {\n+  const msg = reviseMessage.value.trim()\n+  if (!msg) return\n+  showReviseInput.value = false\n+  showReviseDialog.value = true\n+  revisingDialogLoading.value = true\n+  try {\n+    await outlineStore.reviseOutline(msg)\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    emit('error', err?.message || 'AI 修订失败')\n+    showReviseDialog.value = false\n+  } finally {\n+    revisingDialogLoading.value = false\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+async function handleApplyRevision() {\n+  outlineStore.applyRevision()\n+  showReviseDialog.value = false\n+  reviseMessage.value = ''\n+  // 采纳后立即落库：后端生成链路只认存储版本（GetConfirmed），\n+  // 不落库则修订结果只存在于 localStorage，大纲页刷新后即与后端分叉（表现为「AI 修订没加上节点」）。\n+  try {\n+    await persistIfDirty()\n+  } catch (err) {\n+    emit('error', err?.message || 'AI 修订落库失败，请点「保存大纲」重试')\n+  }\n+}\n+\n+function handleCancelRevision() {\n+  outlineStore.discardRevision()\n+  showReviseDialog.value = false\n+  reviseMessage.value = ''\n+}\n+\n+/**\n+ * 向父页面（S3 工作台）暴露落库保障入口。\n+ * 父页面在切换阶段 / 启动生成前调用，避免绕过本组件按钮的路径把未落库编辑带进生成链路。\n+ */\n+defineExpose({ persistIfDirty, hasUnsavedEdit })\n+</script>\n+\n+<style scoped>\n+.outline-editor {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 12px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 头部 */\n+.outline-header {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  padding: 12px 16px;\n+  background: #f8fbf9;\n+  border: 1px solid #e2ece6;\n+  border-radius: 12px;\n+}\n+.outline-meta {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 12px;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #607a71;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+.outline-status {\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+  padding: 2px 8px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+.status-draft { background: #f0f5f2; color: #2f605a; }\n+.status-confirming { background: #fff8e6; color: #7c4a15; }\n+.status-confirmed { background: #d1fae5; color: #065f46; }\n+.status-superseded { background: #f3f4f6; color: #6b7280; }\n+.outline-actions {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+\n+/* 错误条 */\n+.error-bar {\n+  padding: 10px 14px;\n+  background: #fef2f2;\n+  border: 1px solid #fecaca;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  color: #dc2626;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+}\n+.unsaved-bar {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  padding: 8px 14px;\n+  background: #fff8e6;\n+  border: 1px solid #f6dfa8;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  color: #7c4a15;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 节点列表 */\n+.nodes-list {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+}\n+\n+.outline-node-card {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 12px;\n+  padding: 14px 16px;\n+  background: #fff;\n+  border: 1.5px solid #e2ece6;\n+  border-radius: 14px;\n+  transition: border-color 0.15s;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card:hover {\n+  border-color: #5ca68f;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card.node-type-section {\n+  border-left: 4px solid #2f605a;\n+  background: #f8fbf9;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card.node-type-quiz {\n+  border-left: 4px solid #7c3aed;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card.node-type-interactive {\n+  border-left: 4px solid #ea580c;\n+}\n+.outline-node-card.node-type-summary {\n+  border-left: 4px solid #ca8a04;\n+}\n+\n+/* 序号 */\n+.node-drag-handle {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 4px;\n+  min-width: 28px;\n+}\n+.node-order {\n+  font-size: 16px;\n+  font-weight: 700;\n+  color: #5ca68f;\n+  line-height: 1;\n+}\n+.node-move-btns {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 2px;\n+}\n+.move-btn {\n+  background: none;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 4px;\n+  font-size: 10px;\n+  color: #5ca68f;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  padding: 1px 4px;\n+  line-height: 1;\n+}\n+.move-btn:disabled { opacity: 0.35; cursor: not-allowed; }\n+\n+/* 节点内容 */\n+.node-content {\n+  flex: 1;\n+  min-width: 0;\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-direction: column;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+.node-top-row {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+.node-type-select {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 6px;\n+  padding: 3px 6px;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  background: #f0f5f2;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+}\n+.node-type-badge {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  background: #e2ece6;\n+  color: #5ca68f;\n+  padding: 2px 8px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+.node-title-input {\n+  flex: 1;\n+  font-size: 14px;\n+  font-weight: 600;\n+  border: none;\n+  border-bottom: 1.5px solid #c6ded6;\n+  padding: 2px 4px;\n+  outline: none;\n+  color: #1e293b;\n+  background: transparent;\n+  min-width: 0;\n+}\n+.node-title-input:focus { border-bottom-color: #5ca68f; }\n+.node-title { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: #1e293b; }\n+.node-summary-input {\n+  width: 100%;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #475569;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  padding: 6px 8px;\n+  resize: vertical;\n+  outline: none;\n+  font-family: inherit;\n+  box-sizing: border-box;\n+  background: #fafcfa;\n+}\n+.node-summary-input:focus { border-color: #5ca68f; }\n+.node-summary { font-size: 12px; color: #475569; margin: 0; line-height: 1.5; }\n+\n+/* 知识点 */\n+.node-key-points {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: flex-start;\n+  gap: 6px;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+}\n+.kp-label { font-size: 11px; color: #94a3b8; white-space: nowrap; line-height: 22px; }\n+.kp-tags { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 4px; align-items: center; }\n+.kp-tag {\n+  display: inline-flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 4px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  background: #e8f5f0;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  padding: 2px 8px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+.kp-remove {\n+  background: none;\n+  border: none;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  padding: 0;\n+  line-height: 1;\n+  opacity: 0.6;\n+}\n+.kp-remove:hover { opacity: 1; }\n+.kp-add-input {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  border: none;\n+  background: transparent;\n+  outline: none;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  width: 100px;\n+  padding: 2px 4px;\n+}\n+.kp-tag-static {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  background: #e8f5f0;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+  padding: 2px 8px;\n+  border-radius: 999px;\n+}\n+\n+/* 互动规划 */\n+.node-interactive-plan {\n+  border-top: 1px dashed #c6ded6;\n+  padding-top: 8px;\n+}\n+.plan-toggle {\n+  font-size: 12px;\n+  color: #5ca68f;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  user-select: none;\n+  list-style: none;\n+}\n+.plan-toggle::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }\n+.plan-fields {\n+  display: flex;\n+  flex-wrap: wrap;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  margin-top: 8px;\n+}\n+.plan-fields label {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 4px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  color: #64748b;\n+}\n+.plan-fields input[type=\"number\"] {\n+  width: 54px;\n+  padding: 2px 5px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 5px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  outline: none;\n+}\n+.plan-fields select {\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 5px;\n+  padding: 2px 4px;\n+  outline: none;\n+}\n+.plan-fields input[type=\"checkbox\"] { width: 14px; height: 14px; }\n+\n+/* 底部：时长 & 删除 */\n+.node-footer {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  justify-content: space-between;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+}\n+.duration-label {\n+  display: flex;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  gap: 5px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  color: #64748b;\n+}\n+.duration-input {\n+  width: 48px;\n+  padding: 2px 6px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 5px;\n+  font-size: 11px;\n+  text-align: center;\n+  outline: none;\n+}\n+.duration-input:disabled { background: #f8fbf9; }\n+.node-delete-btn {\n+  background: none;\n+  border: none;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  font-size: 14px;\n+  opacity: 0.4;\n+  transition: opacity 0.15s;\n+}\n+.node-delete-btn:hover { opacity: 1; }\n+\n+/* 添加节点 */\n+.add-node-row {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 10px;\n+  justify-content: center;\n+  padding: 10px 0;\n+}\n+.add-node-btn {\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+}\n+.btn {\n+  padding: 6px 14px;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  cursor: pointer;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  font-weight: 500;\n+  transition: all 0.15s;\n+  border: 1px solid transparent;\n+}\n+.btn-sm { padding: 5px 12px; font-size: 12px; }\n+.btn-outline {\n+  background: #fff;\n+  border-color: #c6ded6;\n+  color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.btn-outline:hover { background: #f0f5f2; }\n+.btn-primary {\n+  background: #2f605a;\n+  color: #fff;\n+  border-color: #2f605a;\n+}\n+.btn-primary:hover:not(:disabled) { background: #1e4a44; }\n+.btn-primary:disabled { opacity: 0.5; cursor: not-allowed; }\n+.btn:disabled { opacity: 0.5; cursor: not-allowed; }\n+\n+/* 修订输入条 */\n+.revise-input-bar {\n+  display: flex;\n+  gap: 8px;\n+  align-items: center;\n+  padding: 10px 14px;\n+  background: #f0f5f2;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 10px;\n+}\n+.revise-text-input {\n+  flex: 1;\n+  padding: 6px 10px;\n+  border: 1px solid #c6ded6;\n+  border-radius: 8px;\n+  font-size: 13px;\n+  outline: none;\n+}\n+.revise-text-input:focus { border-color: #5ca68f; }\n+\n+/* 过渡动画 */\n+.node-list-enter-active,\n+.node-list-leave-active { transition: all 0.25s ease; }\n+.node-list-enter-from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-8px); }\n+.node-list-leave-to { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-8px); }\n+</style>\ndiff --git a/.rivet/knowledge/advisory-efficacy.jsonl b/.rivet/knowledge/advisory-efficacy.jsonl\nnew file mode 100644\nindex 0000000..09c15c1\n--- /dev/null\n+++ b/.rivet/knowledge/advisory-efficacy.jsonl\n@@ -0,0 +1,11 @@\n+{\"key\":\"self-verify\",\"delivered\":6.998,\"adopted\":0,\"ignored\":0,\"shadowHeld\":0,\"shadowSatisfied\":0,\"updatedAt\":1789137480095}\n+{\"key\":\"lossy-observation\",\"delivered\":3,\"adopted\":0,\"ignored\":0,\"shadowHeld\":0,\"shadowSatisfied\":0,\"updatedAt\":1789137480095}\n+{\"key\":\"batch-convergence\",\"delivered\":2.999,\"adopted\":0,\"ignored\":0,\"shadowHeld\":0,\"shadowSatisfied\":0,\"updatedAt\":1789137480095}\n+{\"key\":\"capsule-recall-tanlang\",\"delivered\":2,\"adopted\":0,\"ignored\":0,\"shadowHeld\":0,\"shadowSatisfied\":0,\"updatedAt\":1789137480095}\n+{\"key\":\"language-anchor\",\"delivered\":2,\"adopted\":0,\"ignored\":0,\"shadowHeld\":0,\"shadowSatisfied\":0,\"updatedAt\":1789137480095}\n+{\"key\":\"render-verify\",\"delivered\":2,\"adopted\":0,\"ignored\":0,\"shadowHeld\":0,\"shadowSatisfied\":0,\"updatedAt\":1789137480095}\n+{\"key\":\"pointer-prophylaxis\",\"delivered\":2,\"adopted\":0,\"ignored\":0,\"shadowHeld\":0,\"shadowSatisfied\":0,\"updatedAt\":1789137480095}\n+{\"key\":\"discipline-reanchor\",\"delivered\":2,\"adopted\":0,\"ignored\":0,\"shadowHeld\":0,\"shadowSatisfied\":0,\"updatedAt\":1789137480095}\n+{\"key\":\"courage\",\"delivered\":1,\"adopted\":0,\"ignored\":0,\"shadowHeld\":0,\"shadowSatisfied\":0,\"updatedAt\":1789137480095}\n+{\"key\":\"action-intent\",\"delivered\":1,\"adopted\":1,\"ignored\":0,\"shadowHe